export const swissAhvPensionTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"es":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de escenarios de pensiones de jubilación suizas AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Calculadora de pensiones suiza AHV: escenarios para 2026 y 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Estime un escenario de pensión de vejez suizo AHV/AVS a partir de su ingreso anual promedio oficial y los años de contribución acreditados. Incluye la fórmula de pensión federal para 2026 y 2027 y la decimotercera pensión de vejez.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Ingrese el ingreso promedio anual determinante y los años de cotización de su cuenta AHV o estimación oficial de pensión. La herramienta aplica la fórmula federal de jubilación normal para 2026 o 2027 y muestra los montos mensuales y anuales, incluida la decimotercera pensión de vejez.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"El ingreso medio anual (RAM) determinante no es tu salario actual. Refleja los ingresos por contribuciones indexadas y puede incluir créditos de educación y atención y división de ingresos. Utilice la cantidad que se muestra en su cuenta oficial o previsión. Este escenario cubre a una persona en edad normal de jubilación; no reconstruye una carrera a partir del salario ni determina la elegibilidad por edad.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Solo ilustración: con un ingreso anual promedio determinante para 2027 de CHF 46 080 y 44 de los 44 años de cotización acreditados, la pensión mensual completa estimada es de CHF 1 946. A partir de 2026, se pagará una pensión de vejez 13 veces al año; Este escenario supone que la pensión se paga durante los 12 meses.","Pension year":"Año de pensión","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Determinación del ingreso anual promedio a partir de su declaración AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Usar la RAM oficial/determinar el ingreso medio anual. No ingrese solo su salario actual o último.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Años de aportación acreditados desde tu cuenta","Full contribution duration for your case":"Duración total del aporte para su caso","43 years":"43 años","43 years and 3 months":"43 años y 3 meses","43 years and 6 months":"43 años y 6 meses","43 years and 9 months":"43 años y 9 meses","44 years":"44 años","Estimate pension scenario":"Escenario de estimación de pensiones","Clear inputs":"Borrar entradas","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Ingrese los valores que muestra su cuenta AHV o pronóstico oficial.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Escenario indicativo de pensiones de vejez","Estimated monthly pension":"Pensión mensual estimada","12 regular monthly payments":"12 pagos mensuales regulares","13th old-age pension":"13ª pensión de vejez","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Total estimado para 12 meses más pensión 13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Monto mensual completo antes del ajuste del año de contribución","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Determinación del ingreso anual promedio redondeado a la banda de la tabla oficial","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Años de cotización acreditados/duración total","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensión mensual mínima completa para el año seleccionado","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensión mensual completa máxima para el año seleccionado","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"La cifra oficial de ingresos se redondea al siguiente rango de la tabla publicada. Se aplica la fórmula legal y luego se ajusta según la duración de la contribución que ingresa.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Presupuesto oficial online para Suiza y el extranjero: ESCAL","Official references:":"Referencias oficiales:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Fórmula y montos de pensión del BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Folleto AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Decimotercera regla de pensión","Download scenario CSV":"Descargar escenario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Escenario calculado en este navegador.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Consulta el año fiscal, el ingreso anual promedio oficial y los montos del año de contribución.","Inputs cleared.":"Entradas borradas.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Escenario descargado como archivo CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"¿Puedo ingresar mi salario actual?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"No. La determinación oficial del ingreso promedio anual se basa en la carrera asegurada, la indexación y los créditos aplicables. Un salario actual por sí solo no puede predecirlo.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"¿Dónde encuentro el ingreso medio anual determinante?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Utiliza tu cuenta individual de AHV, una previsión oficial de ESCAL o tu oficina de compensación. Esta herramienta no lo deduce de la edad, el país o el salario actual.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"¿Esto incluye créditos de cuidado y educación o separación del matrimonio?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Sólo si dichos efectos ya están incluidos en el ingreso medio oficial que ingresa. La herramienta no puede determinar sus créditos individuales ni sus ingresos divididos.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"¿Calcula jubilación anticipada o diferida?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"No. Muestra únicamente escenarios de jubilación normal. Las reducciones de reclamaciones anticipadas, los aumentos de aplazamientos, los suplementos de generación de transición y los límites de cónyuge requieren registros oficiales individuales y no están incluidos.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"¿Por qué hay un pago número 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Desde 2026, las personas con derecho a una pensión de vejez AHV en diciembre reciben un pago anual adicional. Esta estimación supone un año completo de derecho y no incluye los suplementos por hijos o de transición.","Is this an official pension decision?":"¿Es esta una decisión oficial sobre pensiones?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"No. Es una estimación utilizando los valores que usted proporciona. Su oficina de compensación determinará la pensión vinculante después de comprobar el historial del asegurado."},"fr":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Calculateur de scénarios de prévoyance AVS/AVS suisse","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Calculateur de rente AVS suisse — Scénarios 2026 et 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Estimez un scénario de rente de vieillesse AVS suisse à partir de votre détermination officielle du revenu annuel moyen et des années de cotisation créditées. Comprend la formule de retraite fédérale 2026 et 2027 et la 13e rente de vieillesse.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Indiquez le revenu annuel moyen déterminant et les années de cotisation de votre compte AVS ou de l'estimation officielle de la rente. L'outil applique la formule fédérale de retraite normale pour 2026 ou 2027 et indique les montants mensuels et annuels, y compris la 13e rente de vieillesse.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Le revenu annuel moyen (RAM) déterminant n'est pas votre salaire actuel. Il reflète les revenus de cotisations indexés et peut inclure des crédits d’éducation et de soins ainsi qu’un fractionnement du revenu. Utilisez le montant indiqué dans votre compte officiel ou vos prévisions. Ce scénario couvre une personne à l’âge normal de la retraite ; il ne reconstruit pas une carrière à partir du salaire ni ne détermine l'âge d'éligibilité.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Illustration uniquement : avec un revenu annuel moyen déterminant en 2027 de CHF 46'080 et 44 des 44 années de cotisation créditées, la rente mensuelle complète estimée est de CHF 1'946. À partir de 2026, une pension de vieillesse ouvrant droit est versée 13 fois par an ; ce scénario suppose que la pension est payable pour les 12 mois.","Pension year":"Année de retraite","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Détermination du revenu annuel moyen à partir du décompte AVS (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Utiliser la RAM officielle / déterminer le revenu annuel moyen. N'inscrivez pas uniquement votre salaire actuel ou votre dernier salaire.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Années de cotisation créditées sur votre compte","Full contribution duration for your case":"Durée totale de cotisation pour votre cas","43 years":"43 ans","43 years and 3 months":"43 ans et 3 mois","43 years and 6 months":"43 ans et 6 mois","43 years and 9 months":"43 ans et 9 mois","44 years":"44 ans","Estimate pension scenario":"Scénario d'estimation de la retraite","Clear inputs":"Effacer les entrées","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Saisissez les valeurs indiquées par votre compte AVS ou par la prévision officielle.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Scénario indicatif de pension de vieillesse","Estimated monthly pension":"Retraite mensuelle estimée","12 regular monthly payments":"12 mensualités régulières","13th old-age pension":"13ème pension de vieillesse","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Total estimé pour 12 mois plus 13ème pension","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Montant mensuel forfaitaire avant ajustement année de cotisation","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Détermination du revenu annuel moyen arrondi à la tranche officielle du tableau","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Années de cotisation créditées / durée complète","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pension mensuelle complète minimale pour l'année sélectionnée","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pension mensuelle complète maximale pour l'année sélectionnée","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Le chiffre officiel des revenus est arrondi à la tranche de tableau publiée suivante. La formule légale est appliquée, puis ajustée en fonction de la durée de cotisation que vous indiquez.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Estimation en ligne officielle pour la Suisse et l'étranger : ESCAL","Official references:":"Références officielles :","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Formule et montants de la pension BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Dépliant AVS/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"13ème règlement retraite","Download scenario CSV":"Télécharger le scénario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scénario calculé dans ce navigateur.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Vérifiez l'année d'imposition, le revenu annuel moyen officiel et les montants de l'année de cotisation.","Inputs cleared.":"Entrées effacées.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scénario téléchargé sous forme de fichier CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Puis-je saisir mon salaire actuel ?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Non. Le fonctionnaire déterminant le revenu annuel moyen est basé sur la carrière assurée, l'indexation et les crédits applicables. Un salaire actuel ne peut à lui seul le prédire.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Où puis-je trouver le revenu annuel moyen déterminant ?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Utilisez votre compte individuel AVS, une prévision officielle ESCAL ou votre caisse de compensation. Cet outil ne le déduit pas de l’âge, du pays ou du salaire actuel.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Cela inclut-il les crédits de soins et d'éducation ou la séparation des couples mariés ?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Seulement si ces effets sont déjà inclus dans le revenu moyen officiel que vous saisissez. L’outil ne peut pas déterminer vos crédits individuels ou votre revenu fractionné.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Calcule-t-il une retraite anticipée ou différée ?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Non. Il montre uniquement des scénarios de retraite normale. Les réductions de demandes anticipées, les augmentations de report, les suppléments de génération de transition et les plafonds pour conjoints nécessitent des dossiers officiels individuels et ne sont pas inclus.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Pourquoi y a-t-il un 13ème versement ?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Depuis 2026, les personnes ayant droit à une rente de vieillesse AVS en décembre perçoivent un versement annuel supplémentaire. Cette estimation suppose une année complète d'admissibilité et n'inclut pas les suppléments pour enfants ou de transition.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Est-ce une décision officielle en matière de retraite ?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Non. Il s'agit d'une estimation utilisant les valeurs que vous fournissez. Votre caisse de compensation détermine la rente obligatoire après avoir vérifié le dossier assuré."},"pt":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de cenário de pensão de aposentadoria Swiss AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Calculadora de pensões Swiss AHV - cenários de 2026 e 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Estime um cenário de pensão de velhice AHV/AVS suíço a partir do seu funcionário, determinando a renda média anual e os anos de contribuição creditados. Inclui a fórmula previdenciária federal de 2026 e 2027 e a 13ª pensão por velhice.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Insira o rendimento médio anual e os anos de contribuição da sua conta AHV ou estimativa oficial de pensão. A ferramenta aplica a fórmula da aposentadoria normal federal para 2026 ou 2027 e mostra valores mensais e anuais, incluindo a 13ª pensão por velhice.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"A renda média anual (RAM) determinante não é o seu salário atual. Reflete rendimentos de contribuição indexados e pode incluir créditos para educação e cuidados e divisão de rendimentos. Use o valor mostrado em sua conta oficial ou previsão. Este cenário abrange uma pessoa na idade normal de reforma; não reconstrói uma carreira a partir do salário nem determina a elegibilidade por idade.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Apenas ilustração: com um rendimento médio anual determinado em 2027 de CHF 46.080 e 44 dos 44 anos de contribuição creditados, a pensão mensal completa estimada é de CHF 1.946. A partir de 2026, uma pensão de velhice qualificada será paga 13 vezes por ano; este cenário pressupõe que a pensão seja paga durante todos os 12 meses.","Pension year":"Ano de pensão","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Determinando a renda média anual do seu extrato AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Utilize o RAM oficial / determinação do rendimento médio anual. Não insira apenas seu salário atual ou último.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Anos de contribuição creditados em sua conta","Full contribution duration for your case":"Duração total da contribuição para o seu caso","43 years":"43 anos","43 years and 3 months":"43 anos e 3 meses","43 years and 6 months":"43 anos e 6 meses","43 years and 9 months":"43 anos e 9 meses","44 years":"44 anos","Estimate pension scenario":"Estimativa do cenário previdenciário","Clear inputs":"Limpar entradas","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Insira os valores mostrados pela sua conta AHV ou previsão oficial.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Cenário indicativo de pensão de velhice","Estimated monthly pension":"Pensão mensal estimada","12 regular monthly payments":"12 pagamentos mensais regulares","13th old-age pension":"13ª pensão de velhice","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Total estimado para 12 meses mais 13ª pensão","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Valor mensal completo antes do ajuste do ano de contribuição","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Determinação do rendimento médio anual arredondado para a faixa da tabela oficial","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Anos de contribuição creditados / duração total","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensão mensal completa mínima para o ano selecionado","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensão mensal completa máxima para o ano selecionado","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"O valor oficial da receita é arredondado para a próxima faixa da tabela publicada. A fórmula legal é aplicada e depois ajustada de acordo com a duração da contribuição inserida.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Estimativa online oficial para a Suíça e o exterior: ESCAL","Official references:":"Referências oficiais:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Fórmula e valores de pensão BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Folheto AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"13ª regras previdenciárias","Download scenario CSV":"Baixar cenário CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Cenário calculado neste navegador.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Verifique o ano fiscal, o rendimento médio anual oficial e os valores do ano contributivo.","Inputs cleared.":"Entradas apagadas.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Cenário baixado como um arquivo CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Posso inserir meu salário atual?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Não. O rendimento médio anual oficial que determina a carreira segurada, a indexação e os créditos aplicáveis. Um salário atual por si só não pode prever isso.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Onde encontro o rendimento médio anual determinante?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Use sua conta individual AHV, uma previsão oficial da ESCAL ou seu escritório de compensação. Esta ferramenta não infere isso com base na idade, no país ou no salário atual.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Isso inclui créditos de assistência e educação ou separação de casal?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Somente se esses efeitos já estiverem incluídos no rendimento médio oficial que você insere. A ferramenta não pode determinar seus créditos individuais ou dividir a renda.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Calcula aposentadoria antecipada ou diferida?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Não. Mostra apenas cenários de aposentadoria normal. Reduções de sinistros antecipados, aumentos de diferimento, suplementos de geração de transição e limites máximos para cônjuges exigem registros oficiais individuais e não estão incluídos.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Por que existe um 13º pagamento?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Desde 2026, as pessoas com direito à pensão de velhice AHV em dezembro recebem uma prestação anual adicional. Esta estimativa pressupõe um ano completo de direito e não inclui suplementos infantis ou de transição.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Esta é uma decisão oficial sobre pensões?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Não. É uma estimativa usando os valores que você fornece. O seu escritório de compensação determina a pensão vinculativa após verificar o registro do segurado."},"de":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Schweizer AHV/AVS-Altersvorsorge-Szenario-Rechner","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Schweizer AHV-Rentenrechner – Szenarien 2026 und 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Schätzen Sie ein Schweizer AHV-Altersrentenszenario anhand Ihres Beamten, der das durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen und die angerechneten Beitragsjahre ermittelt. Beinhaltet die Bundesrentenformel 2026 und 2027 sowie die 13. Altersrente.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Geben Sie das maßgebende durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen und die Beitragsjahre aus Ihrem AHV-Konto oder der offiziellen Rentenschätzung ein. Das Tool wendet die Bundesnormal-Rentenformel für 2026 oder 2027 an und zeigt monatliche und jährliche Beträge, einschließlich der 13. Altersrente.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Das maßgebende durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen (RAM) ist nicht Ihr aktuelles Gehalt. Es spiegelt das indexierte Beitragseinkommen wider und kann Bildungs- und Pflegegutschriften sowie Einkommensaufteilung umfassen. Verwenden Sie den in Ihrer offiziellen Rechnung oder Prognose angezeigten Betrag. Dieses Szenario umfasst eine Person im normalen Rentenalter; Es lässt sich nicht anhand des Gehalts auf eine Karriere schließen oder die Altersberechtigung bestimmen.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Nur Abbildung: Bei einem für das Jahr 2027 maßgeblichen durchschnittlichen Jahreseinkommen von CHF 46'080 und 44 von 44 angerechneten Beitragsjahren beträgt die geschätzte volle Monatsrente CHF 1'946. Ab 2026 wird 13-mal pro Jahr eine anrechenbare Altersrente gezahlt; In diesem Szenario wird davon ausgegangen, dass die Rente für alle 12 Monate gezahlt wird.","Pension year":"Rentenjahr","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Ermittlung des durchschnittlichen Jahreseinkommens aus Ihrer AHV-Abrechnung (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Verwenden Sie den offiziellen RAM / ermitteln Sie das durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen. Geben Sie nicht nur Ihr aktuelles oder letztes Gehalt ein.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Beitragsjahre von Ihrem Konto gutgeschrieben","Full contribution duration for your case":"Volle Beitragsdauer für Ihren Fall","43 years":"43 Jahre","43 years and 3 months":"43 Jahre und 3 Monate","43 years and 6 months":"43 Jahre und 6 Monate","43 years and 9 months":"43 Jahre und 9 Monate","44 years":"44 Jahre","Estimate pension scenario":"Rentenszenario schätzen","Clear inputs":"Eingaben löschen","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Geben Sie die Werte Ihres AHV-Kontos oder Ihrer offiziellen Prognose ein.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Indikatives Altersrentenszenario","Estimated monthly pension":"Geschätzte monatliche Rente","12 regular monthly payments":"12 regelmäßige monatliche Zahlungen","13th old-age pension":"13. Altersrente","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Geschätzter Gesamtbetrag für 12 Monate plus 13. Rente","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Vollständiger monatlicher Betrag vor Anpassung an das Beitragsjahr","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Ermittlung des durchschnittlichen Jahreseinkommens aufgerundet auf die offizielle Tabelle","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Angerechnete Beitragsjahre / volle Laufzeit","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Mindestvolle monatliche Rente für das ausgewählte Jahr","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maximale volle Monatsrente für das ausgewählte Jahr","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Der offizielle Einkommenswert wird auf den nächsten veröffentlichten Tabellenbereich aufgerundet. Es wird die gesetzliche Formel angewendet und anschließend an die von Ihnen eingegebene Beitragsdauer angepasst.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Offizieller Online-Kostenvoranschlag für die Schweiz und das Ausland: ESCAL","Official references:":"Offizielle Referenzen:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV-Rentenformel und -beträge","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV-Merkblatt 3.01","13th pension rules":"13. Rentenordnung","Download scenario CSV":"Szenario CSV herunterladen","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"In diesem Browser berechnetes Szenario.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Überprüfen Sie das Steuerjahr, das offizielle durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen und die Beträge des Beitragsjahres.","Inputs cleared.":"Eingänge gelöscht.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Szenario als CSV-Datei heruntergeladen.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Kann ich mein aktuelles Gehalt eingeben?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Nr. Das amtlich ermittelte durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen basiert auf der versicherten Laufbahn, der Indexierung und den geltenden Krediten. Ein aktuelles Gehalt allein kann es nicht vorhersagen.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Wo finde ich das maßgebende durchschnittliche Jahreseinkommen?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Nutzen Sie Ihr AHV-Einzelkonto, eine offizielle ESCAL-Prognose oder Ihre Ausgleichskasse. Dieses Tool schließt dies nicht aus dem Alter, dem Land oder dem aktuellen Gehalt ab.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Beinhaltet dies auch Pflege- und Ausbildungsgutschriften oder Ehesplitting?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Nur wenn diese Effekte bereits in dem von Ihnen eingegebenen offiziellen Durchschnittseinkommen enthalten sind. Das Tool kann weder Ihr individuelles Guthaben noch Ihr aufgeteiltes Einkommen ermitteln.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Wird eine vorzeitige oder eine aufgeschobene Pensionierung berechnet?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Nr. Es werden nur normale Ruhestandsszenarien angezeigt. Vorzeitige Anspruchskürzungen, Stundungserhöhungen, Zulagen für Übergangsgenerationen und Ehegattenobergrenzen erfordern individuelle amtliche Aufzeichnungen und sind nicht enthalten.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Warum gibt es eine 13. Zahlung?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Seit 2026 erhalten Anspruchsberechtigte einer AHV-Altersrente im Dezember eine jährliche Zusatzzahlung. Diese Schätzung geht von einem vollen Anspruchsjahr aus und berücksichtigt keine Kinder- oder Übergangszuschläge.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Ist das eine offizielle Rentenentscheidung?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Nr. Es handelt sich um eine Schätzung anhand der von Ihnen angegebenen Werte. Ihre Ausgleichskasse ermittelt die verbindliche Rente nach Prüfung der Versichertenakte."},"ja":{"2026":"2026年","2027":"2027年","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"スイス AHV/AVS 退職年金シナリオ計算ツール","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"スイス AHV 年金計算ツール — 2026 年および 2027 年のシナリオ","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"公的に決定される平均年収と控除拠出年数から、スイスの AHV/AVS 老齢年金シナリオを推定します。 2026 年と 2027 年の連邦年金計算式と 13 番目の老齢年金が含まれます。","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"AHV アカウントまたは公式の年金見積もりから決定される平均年収と拠出年数を入力します。このツールは、2026 年または 2027 年の連邦標準退職金計算式を適用し、13 番目の老齢年金を含む月額および年額を表示します。","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"決定的な平均年収 (RAM) はあなたの現在の給与ではありません。これは、指数化された寄付収入を反映しており、教育および介護のクレジットや収入の分割が含まれる場合があります。公式アカウントまたは予測に表示されている金額を使用してください。このシナリオは、通常の退職年齢に達した 1 人を対象としています。給与からキャリアを再構築したり、年齢の適格性を決定したりするものではありません。","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"図のみ: 2027 年に決定される平均年間収入が 46,080 スイスフラン、クレジット拠出年数 44 年のうち 44 年を考慮すると、推定満額年金月額は 1,946 スイスフランとなります。 2026 年からは、対象となる老齢年金が年 13 回支払われます。このシナリオは、年金が 12 か月すべて支払われることを前提としています。","Pension year":"年金年","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"AHV 明細書 (CHF) からの平均年収の決定","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"公式RAMを使用/平均年収を決定します。現在の給与または前回の給与のみを入力しないでください。","Credited contribution years from your account":"アカウントからクレジットされた拠出年数","Full contribution duration for your case":"あなたのケースの全拠出期間","43 years":"43 年","43 years and 3 months":"43 年 3 か月","43 years and 6 months":"43 歳 6 か月","43 years and 9 months":"43 歳 9 か月","44 years":"44 年","Estimate pension scenario":"年金シナリオの推計","Clear inputs":"入力をクリア","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"AHV アカウントまたは公式予測によって示された値を入力します。","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"老齢年金の目安シナリオ","Estimated monthly pension":"推定月額年金","12 regular monthly payments":"12 回の定期的な月々の支払い","13th old-age pension":"13 番目の老齢年金","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 か月と 13 回目の年金の推定合計額","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"拠出年調整前の本格的な月額","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"公式テーブルバンドに切り上げられた平均年収の決定","Credited contribution years / full duration":"クレジット貢献年数 / 全期間","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"選択した年の最低月額満額年金","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"選択した年の最大満額年金月額","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"公式の収入数値は、次に公表される表の範囲に切り上げられます。法定の計算式が適用され、入力した拠出期間に合わせて調整されます。","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"スイスおよび海外向けの公式オンライン見積り: ESCAL","Official references:":"公式参照:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV 年金の計算式と金額","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV リーフレット 3.01","13th pension rules":"第 13 回年金規則","Download scenario CSV":"シナリオ CSV をダウンロード","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"このブラウザで計算されたシナリオ。","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"課税年度、公式の平均年収、拠出年の金額を確認します。","Inputs cleared.":"入力がクリアされました。","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"CSV ファイルとしてダウンロードされたシナリオ。","Can I enter my current salary?":"現在の給与を入力できますか?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"いいえ。公式に決定される平均年収は、被保険者のキャリア、指数化、適用されるクレジットに基づいて決定されます。現在の給与だけでは予測できません。","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"決定的な平均年収はどこでわかりますか?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"AHV の個人アカウント、公式の ESCAL 予測、または補償事務所を使用してください。このツールは、年齢、国、現在の給与から推定するものではありません。","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"これには、介護や教育の単位、または夫婦の分割が含まれますか?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"入力した公式平均収入にそれらの影響がすでに含まれている場合のみ。このツールは、個人のクレジットや収入の分割を判断することはできません。","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"早期退職または繰り延べ退職を計算しますか?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"いいえ。通常の退職シナリオのみを示しています。早期保険金の減額、繰り延べ増額、移行世代の補足、配偶者の上限には個人の公式記録が必要であり、含まれていません。","Why is there a 13th payment?":"なぜ 13 回目の支払いがあるのですか?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 年以降、12 月に AHV 老齢年金を受け取る資格がある人は、追加の年次支払いを受け取ります。この見積もりは、1 年間の権利を前提としており、子供や移行のための追加料金は含まれていません。","Is this an official pension decision?":"これは公的年金決定ですか?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"いいえ。入力された値を使用した推定値です。あなたの補償局は、被保険者記録を確認した後、拘束力のある年金を決定します。"},"ko":{"2026":"2026년","2027":"2027년","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"스위스 AHV/AVS 퇴직 연금 시나리오 계산기","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"스위스 AHV 연금 계산기 — 2026년 및 2027년 시나리오","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"공식적으로 결정된 평균 연간 소득 및 적립 기여 기간을 통해 스위스 AHV/AVS 노령 연금 시나리오를 추정합니다. 2026년 및 2027년 연방 연금 공식과 13차 노령 연금이 포함됩니다.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"AHV 계정 또는 공식 연금 추정치에서 결정되는 평균 연간 소득 및 기여 연수를 입력하세요. 이 도구는 2026년 또는 2027년에 연방 정상 퇴직 공식을 적용하고 13번째 노령 연금을 포함한 월별 및 연간 금액을 표시합니다.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"평균 연소득(RAM)을 결정하는 것은 현재 급여가 아닙니다. 이는 지수화된 기여 소득을 반영하며 교육 및 돌봄 크레딧과 소득 분할을 포함할 수 있습니다. 공식 계정이나 예측에 표시된 금액을 사용하세요. 이 시나리오는 정상 퇴직 연령의 한 사람을 대상으로 합니다. 급여로 경력을 재구성하거나 연령 자격을 결정하지 않습니다.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"그림만 해당: 2027년 평균 연간 소득이 CHF 46,080이고 44년의 기여 기여 연도 중 44년이 결정되면 예상 월 전체 연금은 CHF 1,946입니다. 2026년부터 적격노령연금은 연간 13회 지급됩니다. 이 시나리오에서는 연금이 12개월 내내 지급된다고 가정합니다.","Pension year":"연금 연도","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"AHV 명세서(CHF)를 통해 평균 연간 소득 결정","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"공식 RAM을 사용하여 평균 연소득을 결정합니다. 현재 또는 마지막 급여만 입력하지 마십시오.","Credited contribution years from your account":"귀하의 계정에서 기여 연수 인정","Full contribution duration for your case":"귀하의 사례에 대한 전체 기여 기간","43 years":"43년","43 years and 3 months":"43세 3개월","43 years and 6 months":"43세 6개월","43 years and 9 months":"43세 9개월","44 years":"44년","Estimate pension scenario":"추정 연금 시나리오","Clear inputs":"입력 지우기","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"AHV 계정 또는 공식 예측에 표시된 값을 입력하세요.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"노령연금 시나리오","Estimated monthly pension":"추정 월별 연금","12 regular monthly payments":"12개월 정기 결제","13th old-age pension":"13번째 노령연금","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12개월 + 13번째 연금에 대한 추정 총액","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"기여 연도 조정 전 본격적인 월별 금액","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"공식 테이블 밴드로 반올림하여 평균 연소득 결정","Credited contribution years / full duration":"공인 기여 기간(년)/전체 기간","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"선택한 연도의 최소 월 전액 연금","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"선택한 연도의 최대 월 연금 전액","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"공식 수입 수치는 다음 게시된 테이블 밴드로 반올림됩니다. 법정 공식이 적용된 후 입력한 기여 기간에 맞게 조정됩니다.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"스위스 및 해외 공식 온라인 견적: ESCAL","Official references:":"공식 참조:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV 연금 공식 및 금액","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 전단지 3.01","13th pension rules":"13번째 연금 규정","Download scenario CSV":"시나리오 CSV 다운로드","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"이 브라우저에서 계산된 시나리오입니다.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"과세 연도, 공식 평균 연소득 및 기여 연도 금액을 확인하세요.","Inputs cleared.":"입력이 삭제되었습니다.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"시나리오가 CSV 파일로 다운로드되었습니다.","Can I enter my current salary?":"현재 급여를 입력할 수 있나요?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"아니요. 공식적으로 결정되는 평균 연소득은 보험 경력, 지수 및 적용 가능한 크레딧을 기준으로 결정됩니다. 현재 연봉만으로는 예측할 수 없습니다.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"평균 연소득을 결정하는 방법은 어디에서 확인할 수 있나요?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"AHV 개인 계정, 공식 ESCAL 예측 또는 보상 사무소를 사용하세요. 이 도구는 연령, 국가 또는 현재 급여를 기준으로 추론하지 않습니다.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"여기에는 돌봄 및 교육 학점 또는 부부 별거가 포함됩니까?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"해당 효과가 입력한 공식 평균 소득에 이미 포함된 경우에만 해당됩니다. 이 도구는 귀하의 개별 크레딧이나 분할 소득을 결정할 수 없습니다.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"조기 퇴직 또는 연기 퇴직을 계산합니까?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"아니요. 이는 일반 퇴직 시나리오만 표시합니다. 조기 청구 감소, 연기 증가, 전환 세대 보충 및 배우자 한도에는 개별 공식 기록이 필요하며 포함되지 않습니다.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"왜 13번째 결제가 있나요?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026년부터 12월에 AHV 노령연금을 받을 자격이 있는 사람들은 추가 연간 지급금을 받습니다. 이 추정치는 1년 동안의 자격을 가정한 것이며 자녀 또는 전환 보조금은 포함하지 않습니다.","Is this an official pension decision?":"이것이 공식적인 연금 결정입니까?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"아니요. 귀하가 제공한 값을 사용한 추정치입니다. 보상 사무소에서는 보험 기록을 확인한 후 구속력 있는 연금을 결정합니다."},"id":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Skenario Pensiun Pensiun AHV/AVS Swiss","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Kalkulator Pensiun AHV Swiss — Skenario 2026 dan 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Perkirakan skenario pensiun hari tua Swiss AHV/AVS dari pejabat Anda yang menentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata dan tahun kontribusi yang dikreditkan. Termasuk formula pensiun federal tahun 2026 dan 2027 serta pensiun hari tua ke-13.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Masukkan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata dan tahun kontribusi dari akun AHV Anda atau perkiraan pensiun resmi. Alat ini menerapkan rumus pensiun normal federal untuk tahun 2026 atau 2027 dan menunjukkan jumlah bulanan dan tahunan, termasuk pensiun hari tua ke-13.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Yang menentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata (RAM) bukanlah gaji Anda saat ini. Hal ini mencerminkan pendapatan kontribusi yang diindeks dan mungkin mencakup kredit pendidikan dan perawatan serta pembagian pendapatan. Gunakan jumlah yang ditampilkan di akun resmi atau perkiraan Anda. Skenario ini mencakup satu orang pada usia pensiun normal; itu tidak merekonstruksi karier dari gaji atau menentukan kelayakan usia.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Hanya ilustrasi: dengan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata yang ditentukan pada tahun 2027 sebesar CHF 46,080 dan 44 dari 44 tahun kontribusi yang dikreditkan, perkiraan pensiun bulanan penuh adalah CHF 1,946. Mulai tahun 2026, pensiun hari tua yang memenuhi syarat dibayarkan 13 kali per tahun; skenario ini mengasumsikan pensiun dibayarkan selama 12 bulan.","Pension year":"Tahun pensiun","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Menentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata dari laporan AHV Anda (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Gunakan RAM resmi / tentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata. Jangan hanya memasukkan gaji Anda saat ini atau terakhir.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Kontribusi yang dikreditkan bertahun-tahun dari akun Anda","Full contribution duration for your case":"Durasi kontribusi penuh untuk kasus Anda","43 years":"43 tahun","43 years and 3 months":"43 tahun 3 bulan","43 years and 6 months":"43 tahun 6 bulan","43 years and 9 months":"43 tahun 9 bulan","44 years":"44 tahun","Estimate pension scenario":"Perkiraan skenario pensiun","Clear inputs":"Hapus masukan","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Masukkan nilai yang ditunjukkan oleh akun AHV atau perkiraan resmi Anda.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Indikatif skenario pensiun hari tua","Estimated monthly pension":"Perkiraan pensiun bulanan","12 regular monthly payments":"12 pembayaran bulanan reguler","13th old-age pension":"Pensiun hari tua ke-13","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Perkiraan total selama 12 bulan ditambah pensiun ke-13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Jumlah bulanan skala penuh sebelum penyesuaian tahun kontribusi","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Menentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata dibulatkan ke tabel resmi","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Tahun kontribusi yang dikreditkan / durasi penuh","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensiun bulanan penuh minimum untuk tahun yang dipilih","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensiun bulanan penuh maksimum untuk tahun yang dipilih","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Angka pendapatan resmi dibulatkan ke tabel berikutnya yang diterbitkan. Rumus undang-undang diterapkan, kemudian disesuaikan dengan durasi iuran yang Anda masukkan.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Estimasi online resmi untuk Swiss dan luar negeri: ESCAL","Official references:":"Referensi resmi:\nFormula dan jumlah pensiun","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV\nSelebaran","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Aturan pensiun ke-13","Download scenario CSV":"Unduh skenario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Skenario dihitung di browser ini.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Periksa tahun pajak, pendapatan tahunan rata-rata resmi, dan jumlah tahun kontribusi.","Inputs cleared.":"Input dihapus.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Skenario diunduh sebagai file CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Bisakah saya memasukkan gaji saya saat ini?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Tidak. Pejabat yang menentukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata didasarkan pada karir yang diasuransikan, indeksasi dan kredit yang berlaku. Gaji saat ini saja tidak bisa memprediksinya.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Di mana saya bisa menemukan pendapatan tahunan rata-rata yang menentukan?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Gunakan akun perorangan AHV Anda, perkiraan ESCAL resmi, atau kantor kompensasi Anda. Alat ini tidak menyimpulkannya berdasarkan usia, negara, atau gaji saat ini.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Apakah ini termasuk kredit perawatan dan pendidikan atau pemisahan pasangan suami istri?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Hanya jika dampak tersebut sudah termasuk dalam pendapatan rata-rata resmi yang Anda masukkan. Alat ini tidak dapat menentukan kredit individual atau pendapatan terpisah Anda.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Apakah ini menghitung pensiun dini atau pensiun tertunda?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Tidak. Ini hanya menunjukkan skenario pensiun normal. Pengurangan klaim awal, kenaikan penangguhan, suplemen generasi transisi, dan batasan pasangan memerlukan catatan resmi individu dan tidak disertakan.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Kenapa ada pembayaran ke 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Sejak tahun 2026, masyarakat yang berhak atas pensiun hari tua AHV pada bulan Desember menerima pembayaran tahunan tambahan. Perkiraan ini mengasumsikan hak selama satu tahun penuh dan tidak termasuk suplemen anak atau transisi.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Apakah ini keputusan pensiun resmi?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Tidak. Ini adalah perkiraan menggunakan nilai yang Anda berikan. Kantor kompensasi Anda menentukan pensiun yang mengikat setelah memeriksa catatan tertanggung."},"hi":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"स्विस AHV/AVS सेवानिवृत्ति पेंशन परिदृश्य कैलकुलेटर\nयूवीएवीएस01|स्विस एएचवी पेंशन कैलकुलेटर - 2026 और 2027 परिदृश्य","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"स्विस एएचवी पेंशन कैलकुलेटर - 2026 और 2027 परिदृश्य","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"औसत वार्षिक आय और जमा अंशदान वर्ष निर्धारित करने वाले अपने अधिकारी से स्विस एएचवी/एवीएस वृद्धावस्था पेंशन परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाएं। इसमें 2026 और 2027 संघीय पेंशन फॉर्मूला और 13वीं वृद्धावस्था पेंशन शामिल है।","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"अपने AHV खाते या आधिकारिक पेंशन अनुमान से निर्धारित औसत वार्षिक आय और योगदान वर्ष दर्ज करें। यह टूल 2026 या 2027 के लिए संघीय सामान्य-सेवानिवृत्ति फॉर्मूला लागू करता है और 13वीं वृद्धावस्था पेंशन सहित मासिक और वार्षिक राशि दिखाता है।","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"निर्धारण औसत वार्षिक आय (RAM) आपका वर्तमान वेतन नहीं है। यह अनुक्रमित योगदान आय को दर्शाता है और इसमें शिक्षा और देखभाल क्रेडिट और आय विभाजन शामिल हो सकते हैं। अपने आधिकारिक खाते या पूर्वानुमान में दिखाई गई राशि का उपयोग करें। यह परिदृश्य सामान्य सेवानिवृत्ति की आयु वाले एक व्यक्ति को कवर करता है; यह वेतन से करियर का पुनर्निर्माण या आयु पात्रता निर्धारित नहीं करता है।","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"केवल चित्रण: 2027 में CHF 46,080 की औसत वार्षिक आय और 44 क्रेडिट योगदान वर्षों में से 44 का निर्धारण करने के साथ, अनुमानित पूर्ण मासिक पेंशन CHF 1,946 है। 2026 से, योग्य वृद्धावस्था पेंशन का भुगतान प्रति वर्ष 13 बार किया जाता है; यह परिदृश्य मानता है कि पेंशन सभी 12 महीनों के लिए देय है।","Pension year":"पेंशन वर्ष\nयूवीएवीएस07|2026","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"आपके AHV विवरण (CHF) से औसत वार्षिक आय का निर्धारण","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"आधिकारिक RAM का उपयोग करें/औसत वार्षिक आय का निर्धारण करें। केवल अपना वर्तमान या अंतिम वेतन ही दर्ज न करें।","Credited contribution years from your account":"आपके खाते से योगदान वर्ष जमा","Full contribution duration for your case":"आपके मामले के लिए पूर्ण योगदान अवधि","43 years":"43 वर्ष","43 years and 3 months":"43 वर्ष और 3 महीने","43 years and 6 months":"43 वर्ष और 6 महीने","43 years and 9 months":"43 वर्ष और 9 महीने","44 years":"44 वर्ष","Estimate pension scenario":"पेंशन परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाएं","Clear inputs":"इनपुट साफ़ करें","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"अपने AHV खाते या आधिकारिक पूर्वानुमान द्वारा दिखाए गए मान दर्ज करें।","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"सांकेतिक वृद्धावस्था पेंशन परिदृश्य","Estimated monthly pension":"अनुमानित मासिक पेंशन","12 regular monthly payments":"12 नियमित मासिक भुगतान","13th old-age pension":"13वीं वृद्धावस्था पेंशन","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 महीने और 13वीं पेंशन के लिए अनुमानित कुल","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"अंशदान-वर्ष समायोजन से पहले पूर्ण पैमाने पर मासिक राशि","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"आधिकारिक टेबल बैंड तक पूर्णांकित औसत वार्षिक आय का निर्धारण","Credited contribution years / full duration":"क्रेडिट योगदान वर्ष/पूर्ण अवधि","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"चयनित वर्ष के लिए न्यूनतम पूर्ण मासिक पेंशन","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"चयनित वर्ष के लिए अधिकतम पूर्ण मासिक पेंशन","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"आधिकारिक आय का आंकड़ा अगले प्रकाशित तालिका बैंड तक पूर्णांकित किया गया है। वैधानिक फॉर्मूला लागू किया जाता है, फिर आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई योगदान अवधि के लिए समायोजित किया जाता है।","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"स्विट्ज़रलैंड और विदेशों के लिए आधिकारिक ऑनलाइन अनुमान: ESCAL","Official references:":"आधिकारिक संदर्भ:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV पेंशन फॉर्मूला और रकम","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV पत्रक 3.01","13th pension rules":"13वें पेंशन नियम","Download scenario CSV":"डाउनलोड परिदृश्य सीएसवी","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"इस ब्राउज़र में परिदृश्य की गणना की गई।","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"कर वर्ष, आधिकारिक औसत वार्षिक आय और अंशदान-वर्ष की राशि की जाँच करें।","Inputs cleared.":"इनपुट साफ़ हो गए।","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"परिदृश्य को CSV फ़ाइल के रूप में डाउनलोड किया गया।","Can I enter my current salary?":"क्या मैं अपना वर्तमान वेतन दर्ज कर सकता हूँ?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"नहीं. औसत वार्षिक आय का निर्धारण करने वाला अधिकारी बीमित करियर, इंडेक्सेशन और लागू क्रेडिट पर आधारित होता है। अकेले वर्तमान वेतन से इसकी भविष्यवाणी नहीं की जा सकती।","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"मुझे औसत वार्षिक आय का निर्धारण कहां मिलेगा?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"अपने AHV व्यक्तिगत खाते, आधिकारिक ESCAL पूर्वानुमान या अपने मुआवजा कार्यालय का उपयोग करें। यह उपकरण उम्र, देश या वर्तमान वेतन से इसका अनुमान नहीं लगाता है।","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"क्या इसमें देखभाल और शिक्षा क्रेडिट या विवाहित जोड़े का बंटवारा शामिल है?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"केवल तभी जब वे प्रभाव आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई आधिकारिक औसत आय में पहले से ही शामिल हों। उपकरण आपके व्यक्तिगत क्रेडिट या विभाजित आय का निर्धारण नहीं कर सकता।","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"क्या यह शीघ्र या विलंबित सेवानिवृत्ति की गणना करता है?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"नहीं. यह केवल सामान्य-सेवानिवृत्ति परिदृश्य दिखाता है। प्रारंभिक दावा कटौती, स्थगन वृद्धि, संक्रमण-पीढ़ी की खुराक और जीवनसाथी कैप के लिए व्यक्तिगत आधिकारिक रिकॉर्ड की आवश्यकता होती है और इसमें शामिल नहीं हैं।","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13वां भुगतान क्यों है?\nयूवीएवीएस03|2026 से, दिसंबर में एएचवी वृद्धावस्था पेंशन के हकदार लोगों को अतिरिक्त वार्षिक भुगतान मिलता है। यह अनुमान पूरे वर्ष की पात्रता मानता है और इसमें बच्चे या संक्रमणकालीन पूरक शामिल नहीं हैं।","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 से, दिसंबर में एएचवी वृद्धावस्था पेंशन के हकदार लोगों को अतिरिक्त वार्षिक भुगतान मिलता है। यह अनुमान पूरे वर्ष की पात्रता मानता है और इसमें बच्चे या संक्रमणकालीन पूरक शामिल नहीं हैं।","Is this an official pension decision?":"क्या यह एक आधिकारिक पेंशन निर्णय है?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"नहीं. यह आपके द्वारा प्रदान किए गए मानों का उपयोग करके एक अनुमान है। आपका मुआवजा कार्यालय बीमित रिकॉर्ड की जांच के बाद बाध्यकारी पेंशन निर्धारित करता है।"},"ar":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"حاسبة سيناريو معاش التقاعد السويسري AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"حاسبة المعاشات التقاعدية السويسرية AHV - سيناريوهاتا 2026 و2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"قم بتقدير سيناريو معاش الشيخوخة السويسري AHV/AVS من مسؤولك الذي يحدد متوسط الدخل السنوي وسنوات المساهمة المعتمدة. يتضمن صيغة المعاشات التقاعدية الفيدرالية لعامي 2026 و2027 ومعاش الشيخوخة الثالث عشر.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"أدخل تحديد متوسط ​​الدخل السنوي وسنوات المساهمة من حساب AHV الخاص بك أو تقدير المعاش الرسمي. تطبق الأداة صيغة التقاعد العادي الفيدرالية لعام 2026 أو 2027 وتعرض المبالغ الشهرية والسنوية، بما في ذلك معاش الشيخوخة الثالث عشر.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"إن متوسط ​​الدخل السنوي المحدد (RAM) ليس راتبك الحالي. وهو يعكس أرباح المساهمة المفهرسة وقد يشمل ائتمانات التعليم والرعاية وتقسيم الدخل. استخدم المبلغ الموضح في حسابك الرسمي أو توقعاتك. يغطي هذا السيناريو شخصًا واحدًا في سن التقاعد العادي؛ فهو لا يعيد بناء الحياة المهنية من الراتب أو يحدد أهلية العمر.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"توضيح فقط: مع تحديد متوسط ​​الدخل السنوي لعام 2027 بمبلغ 46,080 فرنك سويسري و44 من 44 سنة مساهمة معتمدة، فإن المعاش الشهري الكامل المقدر هو 1,946 فرنك سويسري. اعتبارًا من عام 2026، يُدفع معاش الشيخوخة المؤهل 13 مرة سنويًا؛ يفترض هذا السيناريو أن المعاش التقاعدي مستحق الدفع طوال الـ 12 شهرًا.","Pension year":"سنة التقاعد","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"تحديد متوسط الدخل السنوي من كشف حساب AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"استخدم ذاكرة الوصول العشوائي الرسمية / تحديد متوسط الدخل السنوي. لا تدخل فقط راتبك الحالي أو الأخير.","Credited contribution years from your account":"سنوات المساهمة المضافة من حسابك","Full contribution duration for your case":"مدة المساهمة الكاملة لحالتك","43 years":"43 سنة","43 years and 3 months":"43 سنة و3 أشهر","43 years and 6 months":"43 سنة و6 أشهر","43 years and 9 months":"43 سنة و9 أشهر","44 years":"44 سنة","Estimate pension scenario":"تقدير سيناريو المعاشات التقاعدية","Clear inputs":"مسح المدخلات","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"أدخل القيم التي يعرضها حساب AHV الخاص بك أو التوقعات الرسمية.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"سيناريو معاش الشيخوخة الإرشادي","Estimated monthly pension":"المعاش الشهري المقدر","12 regular monthly payments":"12 دفعة شهرية منتظمة","13th old-age pension":"معاش الشيخوخة الثالث عشر","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"المجموع المقدر لمدة 12 شهرًا بالإضافة إلى المعاش التقاعدي الثالث عشر","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"مبلغ شهري كامل قبل تعديل سنة المساهمة","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"تحديد متوسط الدخل السنوي مقربًا إلى نطاق الجدول الرسمي","Credited contribution years / full duration":"سنوات المساهمة المعتمدة / المدة الكاملة","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"الحد الأدنى للمعاش الشهري الكامل للسنة المختارة","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"الحد الأقصى للمعاش الشهري الكامل للسنة المختارة","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"تم تقريب رقم الدخل الرسمي إلى نطاق الجدول المنشور التالي. يتم تطبيق الصيغة القانونية، ثم تعديلها حسب مدة المساهمة التي تدخلها.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"التقدير الرسمي عبر الإنترنت لسويسرا والخارج: ESCAL","Official references:":"المراجع الرسمية:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV صيغة ومبالغ المعاشات التقاعدية","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"نشرة AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"قواعد المعاش الثالث عشر","Download scenario CSV":"تنزيل السيناريو بتنسيق CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"السيناريو المحسوب في هذا المتصفح.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"التحقق من السنة الضريبية ومتوسط ​​الدخل السنوي الرسمي ومبالغ سنة المساهمة.","Inputs cleared.":"تم مسح المدخلات.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"تم تنزيل السيناريو كملف CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"هل يمكنني إدخال راتبي الحالي؟","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"لا. يعتمد التحديد الرسمي لمتوسط ​​الدخل السنوي على المهنة المؤمن عليها والفهرسة والائتمانات المطبقة. الراتب الحالي وحده لا يمكن التنبؤ به.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"أين أجد متوسط ​​الدخل السنوي المحدد؟","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"استخدم حسابك الفردي في AHV، أو توقعات ESCAL الرسمية، أو مكتب التعويضات الخاص بك. ولا تستنتج هذه الأداة ذلك من العمر أو البلد أو الأجر الحالي.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"هل يشمل ذلك اعتمادات الرعاية والتعليم أو الانفصال بين الزوجين؟","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"فقط إذا كانت هذه التأثيرات مدرجة بالفعل في متوسط ​​الدخل الرسمي الذي تدخله. لا يمكن للأداة تحديد الاعتمادات الفردية الخاصة بك أو الدخل المقسم.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"هل يتم حساب التقاعد المبكر أم المؤجل؟","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"لا. ويعرض سيناريوهات التقاعد العادي فقط. تتطلب التخفيضات المبكرة للمطالبات، وزيادات التأجيل، ومكملات الجيل الانتقالي، والحدود القصوى للزوج سجلات رسمية فردية ولا يتم تضمينها.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"لماذا توجد الدفعة الثالثة عشرة؟","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"منذ عام 2026، يحصل الأشخاص الذين يحق لهم الحصول على معاش الشيخوخة AHV في ديسمبر على دفعة سنوية إضافية. يفترض هذا التقدير سنة كاملة من الاستحقاق ولا يشمل مكملات الأطفال أو الانتقال.","Is this an official pension decision?":"هل هذا قرار رسمي للتقاعد؟","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"لا. إنه تقدير باستخدام القيم التي تقدمها. يقوم مكتب التعويضات الخاص بك بتحديد المعاش الملزم بعد مراجعة سجل المؤمن عليه."},"zh":{"2026":"2026年","2027":"2027年","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"瑞士AHV/AVS退休金情景计算器","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"瑞士 AHV 养老金计算器 — 2026 年和 2027 年情景","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"根据官方确定的平均年收入和记入缴款年数估算瑞士 AHV/AVS 养老金情景。包括2026年和2027年联邦养老金公式以及第13期养老金。","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"输入您的 AHV 账户或官方养老金估算中确定的平均年收入和缴款年限。该工具应用 2026 年或 2027 年的联邦正常退休公式，并显示每月和每年的金额，包括第 13 期养老金。","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"决定平均年收入（RAM）的不是您当前的工资。它反映了索引缴款收入，可能包括教育和护理信贷以及收入分配。使用您的官方帐户或预测中显示的金额。这一场景涵盖了一个处于正常退休年龄的人；它不会根据工资重建职业或确定年龄资格。","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"仅供参考：根据 2027 年确定的平均年收入为 46,080 瑞士法郎以及 44 个记入缴款年中的 44 年，预计每月全额养老金为 1,946 瑞士法郎。从2026年起，符合条件的养老金每年支付13次；此方案假设养老金在所有 12 个月内均应支付。","Pension year":"养老金年","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"从您的 AHV 报表中确定平均年收入（瑞士法郎）","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"使用官方RAM/确定平均年收入。不要仅输入您当前或最后的工资。","Credited contribution years from your account":"您帐户的贷记缴款年数","Full contribution duration for your case":"您的案例的完整贡献期限","43 years":"43年","43 years and 3 months":"43年零3个月","43 years and 6 months":"43岁零6个月","43 years and 9 months":"43岁零9个月","44 years":"44年","Estimate pension scenario":"预估养老金情景","Clear inputs":"清除输入","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"输入您的 AHV 帐户或官方预测显示的值。","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"指示性养老金情景","Estimated monthly pension":"预计每月养老金","12 regular monthly payments":"12个月定期付款","13th old-age pension":"第十三期养老金","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12个月加第13期养老金的预计总额","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"缴费年度调整前的月度全额金额","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"确定平均年收入四舍五入到官方表格范围","Credited contribution years / full duration":"信用缴款年/全部存续期","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"选定年份的最低每月全额养老金","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"所选年份每月最高全额养老金","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"官方收入数据四舍五入到下一个发布的表格范围。应用法定公式，然后根据您输入的缴款期限进行调整。","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"瑞士及国外官方在线估价：ESCAL","Official references:":"官方参考：","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV养老金公式和金额","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 宣传册 3.01","13th pension rules":"第十三条养老金规则","Download scenario CSV":"下载场景 CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"在此浏览器中计算的场景。","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"检查纳税年度、官方平均年收入和缴款年度金额。","Inputs cleared.":"输入已清除。","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"场景以 CSV 文件形式下载。","Can I enter my current salary?":"我可以输入我目前的工资吗？","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"编号官方确定平均年收入的依据是受保职业、指数化和适用的积分。仅凭当前的工资无法预测这一点。","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"在哪里可以找到决定性的平均年收入？","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"使用您的 AHV 个人账户、官方 ESCAL 预测或您的薪酬办公室。该工具不会根据年龄、国家或当前工资来推断。","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"这是否包括护理和教育学分或夫妻分居？","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"仅当这些影响已包含在您输入的官方平均收入中时。该工具无法确定您的个人信用或分割收入。","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"是否计算提前退休或延迟退休？","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"编号它仅显示正常退休情景。早期索赔减少、延期增加、过渡代补助金和配偶上限需要个人正式记录，不包括在内。","Why is there a 13th payment?":"为什么有第13笔付款？","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"自2026年起，有权在12月领取AHV养老金的人将获得额外的年度付款。此估计假设享有一整年的权利，不包括儿童或过渡补助金。","Is this an official pension decision?":"这是官方的养老金决定吗？","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"编号这是使用您提供的值进行的估计。您的赔偿办公室在检查受保记录后确定具有约束力的养老金。"},"bn":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"সুইস AHV/AVS অবসরকালীন পেনশন সিনারিও ক্যালকুলেটর","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"সুইস AHV পেনশন ক্যালকুলেটর - 2026 এবং 2027 পরিস্থিতি","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"আপনার অফিসিয়াল গড় বার্ষিক আয় এবং জমাকৃত অবদানের বছর নির্ধারণ করে একটি সুইস AHV/AVS বার্ধক্য পেনশন পরিস্থিতি অনুমান করুন। 2026 এবং 2027 ফেডারেল পেনশন সূত্র এবং 13 তম বার্ধক্য পেনশন অন্তর্ভুক্ত।","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"আপনার AHV অ্যাকাউন্ট বা অফিসিয়াল পেনশন অনুমান থেকে নির্ধারক গড় বার্ষিক আয় এবং অবদানের বছর লিখুন। টুলটি 2026 বা 2027-এর জন্য ফেডারেল স্বাভাবিক-অবসরের সূত্র প্রয়োগ করে এবং 13 তম বার্ধক্য পেনশন সহ মাসিক এবং বার্ষিক পরিমাণ দেখায়।","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"গড় বার্ষিক আয় (RAM) নির্ধারণ করা আপনার বর্তমান বেতন নয়। এটি সূচীকৃত অবদান উপার্জনকে প্রতিফলিত করে এবং এতে শিক্ষা এবং যত্নের ক্রেডিট এবং আয় বিভাজন অন্তর্ভুক্ত থাকতে পারে। আপনার অফিসিয়াল অ্যাকাউন্ট বা পূর্বাভাসে দেখানো পরিমাণ ব্যবহার করুন। এই দৃশ্যকল্প একজন ব্যক্তিকে স্বাভাবিক অবসর বয়সে কভার করে; এটি বেতন থেকে ক্যারিয়ার পুনর্গঠন করে না বা বয়সের যোগ্যতা নির্ধারণ করে না।\nশুধুমাত্র","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"দৃষ্টান্ত: 2027 এর গড় বার্ষিক আয় CHF 46,080 এবং 44 জমাকৃত অবদান বছরের মধ্যে 44 নির্ধারণ করে, আনুমানিক পূর্ণ মাসিক পেনশন হল CHF 1,946। 2026 থেকে, একটি যোগ্য বার্ধক্য পেনশন প্রতি বছর 13 বার দেওয়া হয়; এই পরিস্থিতিতে অনুমান করে যে পেনশন সমস্ত 12 মাসের জন্য প্রদেয়।","Pension year":"পেনশন বছর","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"আপনার AHV স্টেটমেন্ট (CHF) থেকে গড় বার্ষিক আয় নির্ণয় করা","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"অফিসিয়াল RAM ব্যবহার করুন / গড় বার্ষিক আয় নির্ধারণ করুন। শুধুমাত্র আপনার বর্তমান বা শেষ বেতন লিখবেন না।","Credited contribution years from your account":"আপনার অ্যাকাউন্ট থেকে ক্রেডিট করা অবদান বছর","Full contribution duration for your case":"আপনার ক্ষেত্রে সম্পূর্ণ অবদানের সময়কাল","43 years":"43 বছর","43 years and 3 months":"43 বছর এবং 3 মাস","43 years and 6 months":"43 বছর এবং 6 মাস","43 years and 9 months":"43 বছর এবং 9 মাস","44 years":"44 বছর","Estimate pension scenario":"আনুমানিক পেনশন দৃশ্যকল্প","Clear inputs":"ইনপুট পরিষ্কার করুন","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"আপনার AHV অ্যাকাউন্ট বা অফিসিয়াল পূর্বাভাস দ্বারা দেখানো মানগুলি লিখুন৷","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"ইঙ্গিতমূলক বার্ধক্য পেনশন দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimated monthly pension":"আনুমানিক মাসিক পেনশন","12 regular monthly payments":"12 নিয়মিত মাসিক পেমেন্ট","13th old-age pension":"13তম বার্ধক্য পেনশন","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 মাস প্লাস 13তম পেনশনের জন্য আনুমানিক মোট","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"অবদান-বছর সমন্বয়ের আগে পূর্ণ-স্কেল মাসিক পরিমাণ","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"আধিকারিক টেবিল ব্যান্ড পর্যন্ত গড় বার্ষিক আয় নির্ধারণ করা","Credited contribution years / full duration":"প্রদেয় অবদানের বছর / সম্পূর্ণ সময়কাল","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"নির্বাচিত বছরের জন্য ন্যূনতম পূর্ণ মাসিক পেনশন","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"নির্বাচিত বছরের জন্য সর্বাধিক পূর্ণ মাসিক পেনশন","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"আধিকারিক আয়ের পরিসংখ্যান পরবর্তী প্রকাশিত টেবিল ব্যান্ড পর্যন্ত বৃত্তাকার। সংবিধিবদ্ধ সূত্র প্রয়োগ করা হয়, তারপর আপনার প্রবেশ করা অবদানের সময়কালের জন্য সামঞ্জস্য করা হয়।","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"সুইজারল্যান্ড এবং বিদেশের জন্য অফিসিয়াল অনলাইন অনুমান: ESCAL","Official references:":"অফিসিয়াল রেফারেন্স:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV পেনশন সূত্র এবং পরিমাণ","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV লিফলেট 3.01","13th pension rules":"13তম পেনশন নিয়ম","Download scenario CSV":"দৃশ্যকল্প CSV ডাউনলোড করুন","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"এই ব্রাউজারে গণনা করা দৃশ্যকল্প।","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"কর বছর, অফিসিয়াল গড় বার্ষিক আয় এবং অবদান-বছরের পরিমাণ পরীক্ষা করুন।","Inputs cleared.":"ইনপুট সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"একটি CSV ফাইল হিসাবে দৃশ্যকল্প ডাউনলোড করা হয়েছে৷","Can I enter my current salary?":"আমি কি আমার বর্তমান বেতন লিখতে পারি?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"না। সরকারী গড় বার্ষিক আয় নির্ধারণ করা হয় বীমাকৃত কর্মজীবন, সূচীকরণ এবং প্রযোজ্য ক্রেডিটগুলির উপর ভিত্তি করে। শুধুমাত্র একটি বর্তমান বেতন এটি ভবিষ্যদ্বাণী করতে পারে না।","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"আমি কোথায় বার্ষিক গড় আয় নির্ণয় করব?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"আপনার AHV ব্যক্তিগত অ্যাকাউন্ট, একটি অফিসিয়াল ESCAL পূর্বাভাস বা আপনার ক্ষতিপূরণ অফিস ব্যবহার করুন। এই টুলটি বয়স, দেশ বা বর্তমান বেতন থেকে অনুমান করে না।","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"এর মধ্যে কি যত্ন এবং শিক্ষার ক্রেডিট বা বিবাহিত-দম্পতির বিচ্ছেদ অন্তর্ভুক্ত?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"শুধুমাত্র যদি সেই প্রভাবগুলি ইতিমধ্যেই আপনার প্রবেশ করানো অফিসিয়াল গড় আয়ের অন্তর্ভুক্ত থাকে। টুলটি আপনার ব্যক্তিগত ক্রেডিট বা বিভক্ত আয় নির্ধারণ করতে পারে না।","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"এটি কি প্রাথমিক বা বিলম্বিত অবসর গণনা করে?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র স্বাভাবিক অবসরের পরিস্থিতি দেখায়। প্রারম্ভিক দাবি হ্রাস, বিলম্বিত বৃদ্ধি, ট্রানজিশন-জেনারেশন সাপ্লিমেন্টস এবং স্পাউস ক্যাপগুলির জন্য পৃথক অফিসিয়াল রেকর্ডের প্রয়োজন হয় এবং অন্তর্ভুক্ত নয়।","Why is there a 13th payment?":"কেন একটি 13 তম পেমেন্ট আছে?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 সাল থেকে, ডিসেম্বরে AHV বার্ধক্য পেনশন পাওয়ার অধিকারী ব্যক্তিরা একটি অতিরিক্ত বার্ষিক অর্থপ্রদান পান। এই অনুমানটি এনটাইটেলমেন্টের পুরো বছর ধরে নেয় এবং শিশু বা ট্রানজিশন সাপ্লিমেন্টগুলি অন্তর্ভুক্ত করে না।","Is this an official pension decision?":"এটি কি একটি অফিসিয়াল পেনশন সিদ্ধান্ত?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"না। এটি আপনার প্রদান করা মান ব্যবহার করে একটি অনুমান। আপনার ক্ষতিপূরণ অফিস বীমাকৃত রেকর্ড পরীক্ষা করার পরে বাধ্যতামূলক পেনশন নির্ধারণ করে।"},"ru":{"2026":"2026 год","2027":"2027 год","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Швейцарский калькулятор пенсионного сценария AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Швейцарский пенсионный калькулятор AHV — сценарии на 2026 и 2027 годы","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Оцените сценарий швейцарской пенсии по старости AHV/AVS на основании вашего официального определения среднего годового дохода и лет начисления взносов. Включает федеральную пенсионную формулу на 2026 и 2027 годы и 13-ю пенсию по старости.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Введите определяющий средний годовой доход и годы взносов из вашего счета AHV или официальной оценки пенсии. Инструмент применяет федеральную формулу обычного выхода на пенсию на 2026 или 2027 год и показывает ежемесячные и годовые суммы, включая 13-ю пенсию по старости.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Определяющим среднегодовым доходом (RAM) не является ваша текущая зарплата. Он отражает индексированные доходы от взносов и может включать кредиты на образование и уход, а также разделение доходов. Используйте сумму, указанную в вашем официальном аккаунте или прогнозе. Этот сценарий охватывает одного человека нормального пенсионного возраста; он не реконструирует карьеру на основе зарплаты и не определяет возраст, соответствующий критериям участия.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Только иллюстрация: при расчетном среднемесячном доходе в 2027 году в размере 46 080 швейцарских франков и 44 из 44 лет зачисления взносов расчетная полная ежемесячная пенсия составляет 1 946 швейцарских франков. С 2026 года квалификационная пенсия по старости выплачивается 13 раз в год; этот сценарий предполагает, что пенсия выплачивается за все 12 месяцев.","Pension year":"Пенсионный год\nУВАВС07|2026","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Определение среднегодового дохода на основе отчета AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Используйте официальную ОЗУ/определение среднегодового дохода. Не вводите только свою текущую или последнюю зарплату.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Годы зачисления взносов с вашего счета","Full contribution duration for your case":"Полный срок вклада в вашем случае","43 years":"43 года","43 years and 3 months":"43 года и 3 месяца","43 years and 6 months":"43 года и 6 месяцев","43 years and 9 months":"43 года и 9 месяцев","44 years":"44 года","Estimate pension scenario":"Оценить пенсионный сценарий","Clear inputs":"Очистить ввод","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Введите значения, указанные в вашей учетной записи AHV или в официальном прогнозе.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Индикативный пенсионный сценарий по старости","Estimated monthly pension":"Расчетная ежемесячная пенсия","12 regular monthly payments":"12 регулярных ежемесячных платежей","13th old-age pension":"13-я пенсия по старости","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Оценочная сумма за 12 месяцев плюс 13-я пенсия","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Полная ежемесячная сумма до корректировки года взноса","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Определение среднегодового дохода, округленного до официального табличного диапазона","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Зачисленные взносы в годах/полный срок","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Минимальная полная ежемесячная пенсия за выбранный год","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Максимальная полная ежемесячная пенсия за выбранный год","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Официальная цифра дохода округлена до следующего опубликованного диапазона таблицы. Применяется установленная законом формула, а затем корректируется с учетом введенной вами продолжительности взноса.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Официальная онлайн-оценка для Швейцарии и за рубежом: ESCAL","Official references:":"Официальные ссылки:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Формула и размеры пенсии BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Брошюра AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"13-е пенсионные правила","Download scenario CSV":"Загрузить сценарий в формате CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Сценарий рассчитан в этом браузере.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Проверьте налоговый год, официальный среднегодовой доход и суммы взносов за год.","Inputs cleared.":"Вводы очищены.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Сценарий загружен в виде файла CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Могу ли я ввести свою текущую зарплату?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Нет. Должностное лицо, определяющее средний годовой доход, основано на застрахованной карьере, индексации и применимых кредитах. Одна только текущая зарплата не может предсказать это.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Где я могу найти определяющий средний годовой доход?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Используйте свою индивидуальную учетную запись AHV, официальный прогноз ESCAL или офис вознаграждений. Этот инструмент не делает вывод об этом на основании возраста, страны или текущей заработной платы.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Включает ли это кредиты на уход и образование или развод супругов?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Только если эти эффекты уже включены в введенный вами официальный средний доход. Инструмент не может определить ваши индивидуальные кредиты или разделить доход.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Рассчитывается ли досрочный или отсроченный выход на пенсию?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Нет. Он показывает только сценарии нормального выхода на пенсию. Сокращение досрочных претензий, увеличение отсрочек, надбавки для переходного поколения и ограничения супругов требуют индивидуальной официальной отчетности и не включены.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Почему существует 13-й платеж?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"С 2026 года люди, имеющие право на пенсию по старости AHV, в декабре получают дополнительную ежегодную выплату. Эта оценка предполагает право на полный год и не включает детские или переходные доплаты.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Это официальное пенсионное решение?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Нет. Это оценка с использованием предоставленных вами значений. Ваш компенсационный офис определяет обязательную пенсию после проверки страховой записи."},"ur":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Swiss AHV/AVS ریٹائرمنٹ پنشن سیناریو کیلکولیٹر","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"سوئس AHV پنشن کیلکولیٹر - 2026 اور 2027 منظرنامے","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"سوئس AHV/AVS بڑھاپے کے پنشن کے منظر نامے کا تخمینہ اپنے آفیشل سے اوسط سالانہ آمدنی اور کریڈٹ شدہ شراکت کے سالوں سے لگائیں۔ 2026 اور 2027 وفاقی پنشن فارمولہ اور 13 ویں بڑھاپے کی پنشن پر مشتمل ہے۔","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"اپنے AHV اکاؤنٹ یا سرکاری پنشن تخمینہ سے اوسط سالانہ آمدنی اور شراکت کے سال درج کریں۔ یہ ٹول 2026 یا 2027 کے لیے فیڈرل نارمل ریٹائرمنٹ فارمولے کا اطلاق کرتا ہے اور ماہانہ اور سالانہ رقم دکھاتا ہے، بشمول 13 ویں بڑھاپے کی پنشن۔","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"اوسط سالانہ آمدنی (RAM) کا تعین آپ کی موجودہ تنخواہ نہیں ہے۔ یہ انڈیکس شدہ شراکت کی آمدنی کی عکاسی کرتا ہے اور اس میں تعلیم اور دیکھ بھال کے کریڈٹ اور آمدنی کی تقسیم شامل ہوسکتی ہے۔ اپنے آفیشل اکاؤنٹ یا پیشن گوئی میں دکھائی گئی رقم کا استعمال کریں۔ یہ منظر عام ریٹائرمنٹ کی عمر میں ایک شخص کا احاطہ کرتا ہے۔ یہ تنخواہ سے کیریئر کی تشکیل نو نہیں کرتا یا عمر کی اہلیت کا تعین نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"صرف مثال: 2027 کی اوسط سالانہ آمدنی CHF 46,080 اور 44 میں سے 44 کریڈٹ شدہ شراکت سالوں کے تعین کے ساتھ، تخمینہ مکمل ماہانہ پنشن CHF 1,946 ہے۔ 2026 سے، ایک کوالیفائنگ بڑھاپا پنشن ہر سال 13 بار ادا کی جاتی ہے۔ یہ منظر نامہ فرض کرتا ہے کہ پنشن تمام 12 ماہ کے لیے قابل ادائیگی ہے۔","Pension year":"پنشن کا سال","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"آپ کے AHV اسٹیٹمنٹ (CHF) سے اوسط سالانہ آمدنی کا تعین","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"آفیشل RAM استعمال کریں / اوسط سالانہ آمدنی کا تعین کریں۔ صرف اپنی موجودہ یا آخری تنخواہ درج نہ کریں۔","Credited contribution years from your account":"آپ کے اکاؤنٹ سے شراکت کے سال کریڈٹ","Full contribution duration for your case":"آپ کے کیس کے لیے شراکت کی مکمل مدت","43 years":"43 سال","43 years and 3 months":"43 سال اور 3 ماہ","43 years and 6 months":"43 سال اور 6 ماہ","43 years and 9 months":"43 سال اور 9 ماہ","44 years":"44 سال","Estimate pension scenario":"پنشن کے منظر نامے کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Clear inputs":"ان پٹ صاف کریں۔","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"اپنے AHV اکاؤنٹ یا سرکاری پیشن گوئی کے ذریعہ دکھائی گئی اقدار درج کریں۔","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"اشارہ بڑھاپا پنشن کا منظرنامہ","Estimated monthly pension":"تخمینہ شدہ ماہانہ پنشن","12 regular monthly payments":"12 باقاعدگی سے ماہانہ ادائیگی","13th old-age pension":"13ویں بڑھاپے کی پنشن","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 ماہ کے علاوہ 13ویں پنشن کے لیے تخمینی کل","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"تعاون سال کی ایڈجسٹمنٹ سے پہلے پورے پیمانے پر ماہانہ رقم","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"آفیشل ٹیبل بینڈ تک کی اوسط سالانہ آمدنی کا تعین کرنا","Credited contribution years / full duration":"کریڈیٹ شدہ شراکت کے سال / مکمل دورانیہ","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"منتخب سال کے لیے کم از کم مکمل ماہانہ پنشن","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"منتخب سال کے لیے زیادہ سے زیادہ مکمل ماہانہ پنشن","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"آفیشل آمدنی کے اعداد و شمار کو اگلے شائع شدہ ٹیبل بینڈ تک جمع کیا جاتا ہے۔ قانونی فارمولہ لاگو کیا جاتا ہے، پھر آپ کے داخل کردہ شراکت کی مدت کے لیے ایڈجسٹ کیا جاتا ہے۔","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"سوئٹزرلینڈ اور بیرون ملک سرکاری آن لائن تخمینہ: ESCAL","Official references:":"سرکاری حوالہ جات:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV پنشن فارمولہ اور رقم","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV کتابچہ 3.01","13th pension rules":"13ویں پنشن کے قواعد","Download scenario CSV":"ڈاؤن لوڈ منظرنامہ CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"اس براؤزر میں شمار کردہ منظرنامہ۔","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"ٹیکس سال، سرکاری اوسط سالانہ آمدنی اور شراکت سال کی رقم چیک کریں۔","Inputs cleared.":"ان پٹ صاف ہو گئے۔","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"CSV فائل کے طور پر ڈاؤن لوڈ کیا گیا منظرنامہ","Can I enter my current salary?":"کیا میں اپنی موجودہ تنخواہ درج کر سکتا ہوں؟","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"نہیں سرکاری اوسط سالانہ آمدنی کا تعین بیمہ شدہ کیرئیر، انڈیکسیشن اور قابل اطلاق کریڈٹس پر ہوتا ہے۔ اکیلے موجودہ تنخواہ اس کی پیش گوئی نہیں کر سکتی۔","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"میں اوسط سالانہ آمدنی کا تعین کہاں سے کروں؟","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"اپنا AHV انفرادی اکاؤنٹ، ایک سرکاری ESCAL پیشن گوئی یا اپنے معاوضے کا دفتر استعمال کریں۔ یہ ٹول عمر، ملک یا موجودہ تنخواہ سے اس کا اندازہ نہیں لگاتا ہے۔","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"کیا اس میں دیکھ بھال اور تعلیمی کریڈٹ یا شادی شدہ جوڑے کی علیحدگی شامل ہے؟","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"صرف اس صورت میں جب وہ اثرات پہلے سے آپ کی داخل کردہ سرکاری اوسط آمدنی میں شامل ہوں۔ ٹول آپ کے انفرادی کریڈٹ یا تقسیم آمدنی کا تعین نہیں کر سکتا۔","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"کیا یہ ابتدائی یا موخر ریٹائرمنٹ کا حساب لگاتا ہے؟","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"نہیں یہ صرف عام ریٹائرمنٹ کے منظرنامے دکھاتا ہے۔ ابتدائی دعوی میں کمی، التوا میں اضافہ، ٹرانزیشن جنریشن سپلیمنٹس اور زوج کیپس کے لیے انفرادی سرکاری ریکارڈ کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے اور ان میں شامل نہیں ہیں۔","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13ویں ادائیگی کیوں ہے؟","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"یہ تخمینہ پورا سال استحقاق کا حامل ہے اور اس میں بچہ یا منتقلی کے سپلیمنٹس شامل نہیں ہیں۔","Is this an official pension decision?":"کیا یہ پنشن کا سرکاری فیصلہ ہے؟","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"نہیں یہ آپ کی فراہم کردہ اقدار کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے ایک تخمینہ ہے۔ آپ کا معاوضہ دفتر بیمہ شدہ ریکارڈ کو چیک کرنے کے بعد پابند پنشن کا تعین کرتا ہے۔"},"tr":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"İsviçre AHV/AVS Emeklilik Emeklilik Senaryosu Hesaplayıcı","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"İsviçre AHV Emeklilik Hesaplayıcı — 2026 ve 2027 Senaryoları","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Resmi ortalama yıllık gelirinizi ve yatırılan prim yıllarınızı belirleyen İsviçre AHV/AVS yaşlılık aylığı senaryosunu tahmin edin. 2026 ve 2027 federal emeklilik formülünü ve 13. yaşlılık emekliliğini içerir.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"AHV hesabınızdan veya resmi emeklilik tahmininizden belirleyici ortalama yıllık geliri ve prim yıllarını girin. Araç, 2026 veya 2027 için federal normal emeklilik formülünü uyguluyor ve 13. yaşlılık aylığı da dahil olmak üzere aylık ve yıllık tutarları gösteriyor.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Belirleyici ortalama yıllık gelir (RAM), mevcut maaşınız değildir. Endekslenmiş katkı kazançlarını yansıtır ve eğitim ve bakım kredilerini ve gelir paylaşımını içerebilir. Resmi hesabınızda veya tahmininizde gösterilen tutarı kullanın. Bu senaryo normal emeklilik yaşında olan bir kişiyi kapsamaktadır; kariyeri maaşa göre yeniden yapılandırmaz veya yaş uygunluğunu belirlemez.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Yalnızca örnek: 2027'de ortalama yıllık gelirin 46.080 CHF olduğu ve 44 kredili prim yılının 44'ünün belirlendiği dikkate alındığında, tahmini tam aylık emekli maaşı 1.946 CHF'dir. 2026'dan itibaren, yılda 13 kez nitelikli yaşlılık aylığı ödenmektedir; bu senaryoda emekli maaşının 12 ay boyunca ödeneceği varsayılmaktadır.","Pension year":"Emeklilik yılı","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"AHV ekstrenizden (CHF) ortalama yıllık gelirin belirlenmesi","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Resmi RAM'i kullanın/ortalama yıllık geliri belirleyin. Yalnızca mevcut veya son maaşınızı girmeyin.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Hesabınızdan kredilendirilen katkı yılları","Full contribution duration for your case":"Davanız için tam katkı süresi","43 years":"43 yıl","43 years and 3 months":"43 yıl 3 ay","43 years and 6 months":"43 yıl 6 ay","43 years and 9 months":"43 yıl 9 ay","44 years":"44 yıl","Estimate pension scenario":"Emeklilik senaryosunu tahmin edin","Clear inputs":"Girişleri temizle","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"AHV hesabınızın veya resmi tahmininizin gösterdiği değerleri girin.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Gösterge niteliğinde yaşlılık aylığı senaryosu","Estimated monthly pension":"Tahmini aylık emekli maaşı","12 regular monthly payments":"12 düzenli aylık ödemeler","13th old-age pension":"13. yaşlılık aylığı","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 ay artı 13. emekli maaşı için tahmini toplam","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Katkı yılı ayarlamasından önceki tam ölçekli aylık tutar","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Resmi tablo aralığına yuvarlanmış ortalama yıllık gelirin belirlenmesi","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Kredilendirilen katkı yılı/tam süre","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Seçilen yıl için asgari tam aylık emekli maaşı","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Seçilen yıl için maksimum aylık tam emeklilik maaşı","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Resmi gelir rakamı bir sonraki yayınlanan tablo aralığına yuvarlanır. Yasal formül uygulanır ve girdiğiniz katkı payı süresine göre ayarlanır.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"İsviçre ve yurt dışı için resmi çevrimiçi tahmin: ESCAL","Official references:":"Resmi referanslar:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV emeklilik formülü ve tutarları","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV broşürü 3.01","13th pension rules":"13. emeklilik kuralları","Download scenario CSV":"Senaryo CSV'sini indir","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Senaryo bu tarayıcıda hesaplandı.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Vergi yılını, resmi ortalama yıllık geliri ve katkı yılı tutarlarını kontrol edin.","Inputs cleared.":"Girişler temizlendi.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Senaryo CSV dosyası olarak indirildi.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Mevcut maaşımı girebilir miyim?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Hayır. Ortalama yıllık gelirin resmi olarak belirlenmesi, sigortalı kariyere, endekslemeye ve geçerli kredilere dayanmaktadır. Mevcut maaş tek başına bunu tahmin edemez.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Belirleyici ortalama yıllık geliri nerede bulabilirim?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"AHV bireysel hesabınızı, resmi bir ESCAL tahminini veya tazminat ofisinizi kullanın. Bu araç bunu yaş, ülke veya mevcut maaştan çıkarmaz.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Buna bakım ve eğitim kredileri veya evli çiftlerin ayrılması da dahil mi?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Yalnızca bu etkiler halihazırda girdiğiniz resmi ortalama gelire dahil edilmişse. Araç, bireysel kredilerinizi veya bölünmüş gelirinizi belirleyemez.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Erken emeklilik mi yoksa ertelenmiş emeklilik mi hesaplıyor?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Hayır. Yalnızca normal emeklilik senaryolarını gösterir. Erken tazminat indirimleri, erteleme artışları, geçiş dönemi takviyeleri ve eş sınırlamaları, bireysel resmi kayıtlar gerektirir ve dahil edilmemiştir.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Neden 13. ödeme var?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026'dan bu yana, Aralık ayında AHV yaşlılık aylığı almaya hak kazanan kişilere yıllık ek ödeme yapılıyor. Bu tahmin, tam bir yıllık hak sahibi olduğunuzu varsayar ve çocuk veya geçiş eklerini içermez.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Bu resmi bir emeklilik kararı mı?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Hayır. Verdiğiniz değerleri kullanan bir tahmindir. Tazminat ofisiniz sigortalı sicilini kontrol ettikten sonra bağlayıcı emekliliği belirler."},"vi":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Máy tính kịch bản lương hưu hưu trí AHV/AVS của Thụy Sĩ","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Máy tính lương hưu AHV của Thụy Sĩ - Kịch bản 2026 và 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Ước tính kịch bản lương hưu người già AHV/AVS của Thụy Sĩ từ việc xác định thu nhập trung bình hàng năm và số năm đóng góp được ghi có chính thức của bạn. Bao gồm công thức lương hưu liên bang năm 2026 và 2027 và lương hưu tuổi già thứ 13.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Nhập thu nhập trung bình hàng năm được xác định và số năm đóng góp từ tài khoản AHV của bạn hoặc ước tính lương hưu chính thức. Công cụ này áp dụng công thức nghỉ hưu thông thường của liên bang cho năm 2026 hoặc 2027 và hiển thị số tiền hàng tháng và hàng năm, bao gồm cả lương hưu tuổi già thứ 13.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Thu nhập trung bình hàng năm (RAM) xác định không phải là mức lương hiện tại của bạn. Nó phản ánh thu nhập đóng góp được lập chỉ mục và có thể bao gồm các khoản tín dụng giáo dục và chăm sóc cũng như phân chia thu nhập. Sử dụng số tiền hiển thị trong tài khoản chính thức hoặc dự báo của bạn. Kịch bản này bao gồm một người ở độ tuổi nghỉ hưu thông thường; nó không xây dựng lại sự nghiệp từ tiền lương hoặc xác định tính đủ điều kiện về độ tuổi.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Chỉ minh họa: với thu nhập trung bình hàng năm được xác định vào năm 2027 là 46.080 CHF và 44 trong số 44 năm đóng góp được ghi có, mức lương hưu đầy đủ hàng tháng ước tính là 1.946 CHF. Từ năm 2026, lương hưu đủ điều kiện được trả 13 lần/năm; kịch bản này giả định lương hưu được trả trong cả 12 tháng.","Pension year":"Năm hưu trí","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Xác định thu nhập trung bình hàng năm từ bảng kê AHV của bạn (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Sử dụng RAM chính thức/xác định thu nhập bình quân hàng năm. Đừng chỉ nhập mức lương hiện tại hoặc cuối cùng của bạn.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Số năm đóng góp được ghi có từ tài khoản của bạn","Full contribution duration for your case":"Thời hạn đóng góp đầy đủ cho trường hợp của bạn","43 years":"43 năm","43 years and 3 months":"43 năm 3 tháng","43 years and 6 months":"43 năm 6 tháng","43 years and 9 months":"43 năm 9 tháng","44 years":"44 năm","Estimate pension scenario":"Ước tính kịch bản lương hưu","Clear inputs":"Xóa đầu vào","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Nhập các giá trị được hiển thị bởi tài khoản AHV hoặc dự báo chính thức của bạn.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Kịch bản lương hưu điển hình","Estimated monthly pension":"Ước tính lương hưu hàng tháng","12 regular monthly payments":"12 thanh toán định kỳ hàng tháng","13th old-age pension":"Lương hưu tuổi 13","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Tổng số tiền ước tính cho 12 tháng cộng với lương hưu thứ 13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Số tiền hàng tháng toàn diện trước khi điều chỉnh năm đóng góp","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Xác định thu nhập bình quân hàng năm làm tròn vào nhóm bảng chính thức","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Số năm đóng góp được ghi nhận / toàn bộ thời gian","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Mức lương hưu hàng tháng tối thiểu đầy đủ cho năm được chọn","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Mức lương hưu đầy đủ hàng tháng tối đa cho năm được chọn","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Số liệu thu nhập chính thức được làm tròn đến nhóm bảng được công bố tiếp theo. Công thức luật định được áp dụng, sau đó được điều chỉnh theo thời hạn đóng góp bạn nhập.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Ước tính trực tuyến chính thức cho Thụy Sĩ và nước ngoài: ESCAL","Official references:":"Tài liệu tham khảo chính thức:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV công thức và số tiền lương hưu","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Tờ rơi AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Quy tắc lương hưu thứ 13","Download scenario CSV":"Tải xuống kịch bản CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Kịch bản được tính toán trong trình duyệt này.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Kiểm tra năm tính thuế, thu nhập trung bình hàng năm chính thức và số tiền đóng góp trong năm.","Inputs cleared.":"Đã xóa đầu vào.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Kịch bản được tải xuống dưới dạng tệp CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Tôi có thể nhập mức lương hiện tại của mình không?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Không. Việc xác định chính thức thu nhập trung bình hàng năm dựa trên sự nghiệp được bảo hiểm, chỉ số và các khoản tín dụng hiện hành. Chỉ mức lương hiện tại không thể dự đoán được điều đó.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Tôi có thể tìm thu nhập trung bình hàng năm xác định ở đâu?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Sử dụng tài khoản cá nhân AHV của bạn, dự báo ESCAL chính thức hoặc văn phòng bồi thường của bạn. Công cụ này không suy ra nó từ độ tuổi, quốc gia hoặc mức lương hiện tại.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Điều này có bao gồm các khoản tín dụng chăm sóc và giáo dục hoặc việc chia tay vợ chồng không?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Chỉ khi những ảnh hưởng đó đã được tính vào thu nhập trung bình chính thức mà bạn nhập. Công cụ này không thể xác định tín dụng cá nhân hoặc phân chia thu nhập của bạn.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Nó có tính toán nghỉ hưu sớm hay hoãn lại không?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Không. Nó chỉ hiển thị các kịch bản nghỉ hưu bình thường. Việc giảm yêu cầu bồi thường sớm, tăng thời gian hoãn lại, các khoản bổ sung dành cho thế hệ chuyển tiếp và giới hạn vợ/chồng yêu cầu hồ sơ chính thức của từng cá nhân và không được đưa vào.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Tại sao lại có khoản thanh toán thứ 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Kể từ năm 2026, những người được hưởng lương hưu AHV vào tháng 12 sẽ nhận được khoản thanh toán bổ sung hàng năm. Ước tính này giả định một năm đầy đủ quyền lợi và không bao gồm các khoản bổ sung dành cho trẻ em hoặc chuyển tiếp.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Đây có phải là quyết định lương hưu chính thức?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Không. Đây là ước tính sử dụng các giá trị bạn cung cấp. Văn phòng bồi thường của bạn xác định mức lương hưu ràng buộc sau khi kiểm tra hồ sơ được bảo hiểm."},"it":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Calcola lo scenario della previdenza per la vecchiaia AVS/AVS svizzera","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Calcolatore della rendita AVS svizzera — Scenari 2026 e 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Stima uno scenario per la pensione di vecchiaia AVS/AVS svizzera in base alla determinazione ufficiale del reddito medio annuo e degli anni contributivi accreditati. Comprende la formula pensionistica federale 2026 e 2027 e la 13a pensione di vecchiaia.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Inserisci il reddito medio annuo determinante e gli anni di contribuzione dal tuo conto AVS o dalla stima ufficiale della rendita. Lo strumento applica la formula federale della pensione normale per il 2026 o 2027 e mostra gli importi mensili e annuali, compresa la 13a pensione di vecchiaia.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Il reddito medio annuo determinante (RAM) non è il tuo stipendio attuale. Riflette i guadagni dovuti ai contributi indicizzati e può includere crediti per l'istruzione e l'assistenza e la ripartizione del reddito. Utilizza l'importo mostrato nel tuo account o previsione ufficiale. Questo scenario riguarda una persona in età pensionabile normale; non ricostruisce una carriera dallo stipendio né determina l'idoneità all'età.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Solo illustrazione: con un reddito medio annuo determinante per il 2027 di CHF 46.080 e 44 anni di contribuzione accreditati su 44, la pensione mensile completa stimata è di CHF 1.946. Dal 2026 la pensione di vecchiaia qualificante verrà corrisposta 13 volte all'anno; questo scenario presuppone che la pensione sia pagabile per tutti i 12 mesi.","Pension year":"Anno pensionistico","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Determinare il reddito medio annuo dal conteggio AVS (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Utilizza RAM ufficiale / determinazione del reddito medio annuo. Non inserire solo il tuo stipendio attuale o l'ultimo.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Anni di contribuzione accreditati dal tuo conto","Full contribution duration for your case":"Durata completa del contributo per il tuo caso","43 years":"43 anni","43 years and 3 months":"43 anni e 3 mesi","43 years and 6 months":"43 anni e 6 mesi","43 years and 9 months":"43 anni e 9 mesi","44 years":"44 anni","Estimate pension scenario":"Scenario previdenziale","Clear inputs":"Cancella input","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Inserisci i valori indicati dal tuo conto AVS o dalle previsioni ufficiali.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Scenario indicativo della pensione di vecchiaia","Estimated monthly pension":"Pensione mensile stimata","12 regular monthly payments":"12 pagamenti mensili regolari","13th old-age pension":"13a pensione di vecchiaia","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Totale stimato per 12 mesi più 13a pensione","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Importo mensile intero prima dell'adeguamento anno contributivo","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Determinazione del reddito medio annuo arrotondato alla fascia della tabella ufficiale","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Anni contributivi accreditati/durata intera","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensione mensile completa minima per l'anno selezionato","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensione mensile intera massima per l'anno selezionato","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Il reddito ufficiale è arrotondato alla fascia successiva della tabella pubblicata. Viene applicata la formula legale, quindi adeguata alla durata del contributo inserita.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Preventivo online ufficiale per la Svizzera e l'estero: ESCAL","Official references:":"Riferimenti ufficiali:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Formula e importi della pensione BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Libretto AVS/AI 3.01","13th pension rules":"13° regole pensionistiche","Download scenario CSV":"Scarica CSV dello scenario","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario calcolato in questo browser.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Verifica l'anno fiscale, il reddito medio annuo ufficiale e gli importi dell'anno contributivo.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingressi cancellati.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenario scaricato come file CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Posso inserire il mio stipendio attuale?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"N. La determinazione ufficiale del reddito medio annuo si basa sulla carriera assicurata, sull'indicizzazione e sui crediti applicabili. Lo stipendio attuale da solo non può prevederlo.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Dove trovo il reddito medio annuo determinante?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Utilizzate il vostro conto individuale AVS, una previsione ufficiale ESCAL o la vostra cassa di compensazione. Questo strumento non lo deduce dall’età, dal paese o dalla retribuzione odierna.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Sono compresi i crediti di assistenza e formazione o la separazione della coppia sposata?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Solo se tali effetti sono già compresi nel reddito medio ufficiale inserito. Lo strumento non può determinare i tuoi crediti individuali o dividere il reddito.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Calcola il pensionamento anticipato o posticipato?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"N. Mostra solo scenari di pensionamento normale. Le riduzioni anticipate delle richieste di indennizzo, gli aumenti dei differimenti, i supplementi per la transizione generazionale e i massimali per i coniugi richiedono documenti ufficiali individuali e non sono inclusi.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Perché è prevista la 13ª rata?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Dal 2026 gli aventi diritto a una rendita di vecchiaia AVS a dicembre ricevono un pagamento annuo aggiuntivo. Questa stima presuppone un anno intero di diritto e non include i supplementi per i figli o per la transizione.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Si tratta di una decisione ufficiale sulla pensione?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"N. Si tratta di una stima utilizzando i valori forniti. La vostra cassa di compensazione determina la rendita vincolante dopo aver controllato la documentazione assicurata."},"zh_tw":{"2026":"2026年","2027":"2027年","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"瑞士AHV/AVS退休金情境計算器","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"瑞士 AHV 退休金計算器 — 2026 年和 2027 年情景","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"根據官方確定的平均年收入和記入繳款年數估算瑞士 AHV/AVS 退休金情境。包括2026年和2027年聯邦退休金公式以及第13期退休金。","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"輸入您的 AHV 帳戶或官方退休金估算中確定的平均年收入和繳款年限。該工具應用 2026 年或 2027 年的聯邦正常退休公式，並顯示每月和每年的金額，包括第 13 期退休金。","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"決定平均年收入（RAM）的不是您目前的薪資。它反映了索引繳款收入，可能包括教育和護理信貸以及收入分配。使用您的官方帳戶或預測中顯示的金額。這個場景涵蓋了一個處於正常退休年齡的人；它不會根據工資重建職業或確定年齡資格。","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"僅供參考：根據 2027 年確定的平均年收入為 46,080 瑞士法郎以及 44 個記入繳款年中的 44 年，預計每月全額養老金為 1,946 瑞士法郎。自2026年起，符合資格的退休金每年支付13次；此方案假設退休金在所有 12 個月內均應支付。","Pension year":"退休金年","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"從您的 AHV 報表中決定平均年收入（瑞士法郎）","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"使用官方RAM/決定平均年收入。不要僅輸入您當前或最後的工資。","Credited contribution years from your account":"您帳戶的貸記繳款年數","Full contribution duration for your case":"您的案例的完整貢獻期限","43 years":"43年","43 years and 3 months":"43年3個月","43 years and 6 months":"43歲6個月","43 years and 9 months":"43歲9個月","44 years":"44年","Estimate pension scenario":"預估退休金情景","Clear inputs":"清除輸入","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"輸入您的 AHV 帳戶或官方預測顯示的值。","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"指示性退休金情景","Estimated monthly pension":"預計每月退休金","12 regular monthly payments":"12個月定期付款","13th old-age pension":"第十三期退休金","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12個月加第13期退休金的預計總額","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"繳費年度調整前的每月全額金額","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"決定平均年收入四捨五入至官方表格範圍","Credited contribution years / full duration":"信用繳款年/全部存續期","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"選定年份的最低每月全額退休金","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"所選年份每月最高全額退休金","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"官方收入數據四捨五入到下一個發布的表格範圍。應用法定公式，然後根據您輸入的繳款期限進行調整。","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"瑞士及國外官方線上估價：ESCAL","Official references:":"官方參考：","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV退休金公式和金額","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 宣傳冊 3.01","13th pension rules":"第十三條退休金規則","Download scenario CSV":"下載場景 CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"在此瀏覽器中計算的場景。","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"檢視該課稅年度、官方平均年收入及繳款年度金額。","Inputs cleared.":"輸入已清除。","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"場景以 CSV 檔案下載。","Can I enter my current salary?":"我可以輸入我目前的薪水嗎？","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"編號官方決定平均年收入的依據是受保職業、指數化和適用的積分。僅憑當前的工資無法預測這一點。","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"在哪裡可以找到決定性的平均年收入？","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"使用您的 AHV 個人帳戶、官方 ESCAL 預測或您的薪資辦公室。該工具不會根據年齡、國家或當前工資來推斷。","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"這是否包括護理和教育學分或夫妻分居？","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"僅當這些影響已包含在您輸入的官方平均收入中。該工具無法確定您的個人信用或分割收入。","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"計算提早退休或延後退休？","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"編號它只顯示正常退休情境。早期索賠減少、延期增加、過渡代補助金和配偶上限需要個人正式記錄，不包括在內。","Why is there a 13th payment?":"為什麼有第13筆付款？","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"自2026年起，有權在12月領取AHV退休金的人將獲得額外的年度付款。此估計假設享有一整年的權利，不包括兒童或過渡補助金。","Is this an official pension decision?":"這是官方的退休金決定嗎？","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"編號這是使用您提供的值進行的估計。您的賠償辦公室在檢查受保記錄後確定具有約束力的退休金。"},"bg":{"2026":"2026 г","2027":"2027 г","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Швейцарски AHV/AVS пенсионен калкулатор за пенсия","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Швейцарски AHV пенсионен калкулатор — Сценарии за 2026 и 2027 г.","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Оценете швейцарския сценарий за AHV/AVS пенсия за старост от вашия официален среден годишен доход и кредитирани години на вноски. Включва федералната пенсионна формула за 2026 г. и 2027 г. и 13-та пенсия за старост.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Въведете определящия среден годишен доход и години на вноски от вашата AHV сметка или официална пенсионна оценка. Инструментът прилага федералната формула за нормално пенсиониране за 2026 или 2027 г. и показва месечни и годишни суми, включително 13-та пенсия за старост.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Определящият среден годишен доход (RAM) не е текущата ви заплата. Той отразява индексирани доходи от вноски и може да включва кредити за образование и грижи и разделяне на доходите. Използвайте сумата, показана в официалния ви акаунт или прогноза. Този сценарий обхваща едно лице на нормална възраст за пенсиониране; не възстановява кариера от заплатата или определя допустимостта на възрастта.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Само илюстрация: при определящ среден годишен доход за 2027 г. от 46 080 CHF и 44 от 44 кредитирани години осигурителен стаж, очакваната пълна месечна пенсия е 1946 CHF. От 2026 г. квалифицирана пенсия за старост се изплаща 13 пъти годишно; този сценарий предполага, че пенсията се изплаща за всичките 12 месеца.","Pension year":"Пенсионна година","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Определяне на среден годишен доход от извлечението ви за AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Използвайте официалния RAM / определяне на среден годишен доход. Не въвеждайте само текущата или последната си заплата.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Кредитирани години вноски от вашата сметка","Full contribution duration for your case":"Пълна продължителност на приноса за вашия случай","43 years":"43 години","43 years and 3 months":"43 години и 3 месеца","43 years and 6 months":"43 години и 6 месеца","43 years and 9 months":"43 години и 9 месеца","44 years":"44 години","Estimate pension scenario":"Приблизителен сценарий за пенсия","Clear inputs":"Изчистване на въведените данни","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Въведете стойностите, показани от вашия AHV акаунт или официална прогноза.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Индикативен сценарий за пенсия за старост","Estimated monthly pension":"Прогнозна месечна пенсия","12 regular monthly payments":"12 редовни месечни плащания","13th old-age pension":"13-та пенсия за старост","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Очаквано общо за 12 месеца плюс 13-та пенсия","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Пълна месечна сума преди корекция за година на вноска","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Определяне на средния годишен доход, закръглен до официалната лента на таблицата","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Кредитирани години вноски / пълна продължителност","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Минимална пълна месечна пенсия за избрана година","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Максимална пълна месечна пенсия за избрана година","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Официалната цифра на дохода се закръгля до следващата публикувана лента на таблицата. Прилага се законовата формула, след което се коригира за продължителността на вноската, която въвеждате.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Официална онлайн оценка за Швейцария и чужбина: ESCAL","Official references:":"Официални справки:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV пенсионна формула и размери","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV листовка 3.01","13th pension rules":"13-ти пенсионни правила","Download scenario CSV":"CSV сценарий за изтегляне","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Сценарий, изчислен в този браузър.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Проверете данъчната година, официалния среден годишен доход и сумите за годината на вноските.","Inputs cleared.":"Входовете са изчистени.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Сценарият е изтеглен като CSV файл.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Мога ли да въведа текущата си заплата?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Не. Официално определящият среден годишен доход се основава на осигурителната кариера, индексацията и приложимите кредити. Текущата заплата сама по себе си не може да го предвиди.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Къде мога да намеря определящия среден годишен доход?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Използвайте индивидуалния си акаунт в AHV, официална прогноза на ESCAL или вашия офис за компенсации. Този инструмент не го прави извод от възраст, държава или текущо заплащане.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Това включва ли кредити за грижи и образование или разделяне на женени двойки?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Само ако тези ефекти вече са включени в официалния среден доход, който въвеждате. Инструментът не може да определи вашите индивидуални кредити или разделен доход.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Изчислява ли ранно или отложено пенсиониране?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Не. Показва само сценарии за нормално пенсиониране. Ранните намаления на искове, увеличенията на отлагането, добавките за преходно поколение и ограниченията на съпрузите изискват индивидуални официални записи и не са включени.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Защо има 13-то плащане?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"От 2026 г. хората с право на AHV пенсия за старост през декември получават допълнително годишно плащане. Тази оценка предполага пълна година право на плащане и не включва добавки за дете или преход.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Това официално решение за пенсия ли е?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Не. Това е приблизителна оценка, използваща предоставените от вас стойности. Вашата служба за компенсации определя обвързващата пенсия след проверка на осигурителното досие."},"ca":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora d'escenaris de pensions de jubilació AHV/AVS suïssa","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Calculadora de pensions AHV suïssa — Escenaris 2026 i 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Calculeu un escenari de pensió de vellesa AHV/AVS suïssa a partir dels vostres ingressos anuals mitjans i anys de cotització acreditats. Inclou la fórmula de pensió federal 2026 i 2027 i la 13a pensió de vellesa.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Introduïu la mitjana anual d'ingressos i anys de cotització determinants del vostre compte d'AVS o estimació oficial de pensions. L'eina aplica la fórmula federal de jubilació normal per al 2026 o el 2027 i mostra els imports mensuals i anuals, inclosa la 13a pensió de vellesa.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"La renda mitjana anual (RAM) determinant no és el vostre sou actual. Reflecteix els ingressos de contribució indexats i pot incloure crèdits d'educació i cura i repartiment d'ingressos. Utilitzeu la quantitat que es mostra al vostre compte oficial o previsió. Aquest escenari cobreix una persona en edat normal de jubilació; no reconstrueix una carrera a partir del sou ni determina l'elegibilitat per edat.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Només il·lustració: amb una renda mitjana anual determinant de 2027 de 46.080 CHF i 44 de 44 anys de cotització acreditats, la pensió mensual completa estimada és de 1.946 CHF. A partir del 2026, una pensió de vellesa qualificada es paga 13 vegades a l'any; aquest escenari suposa que la pensió es paga durant els 12 mesos.","Pension year":"Any de pensió","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Determinació de la renda mitjana anual a partir del vostre extracte de l'AVS (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Utilitzar la memòria RAM oficial / determinació de la renda mitjana anual. No introduïu només el vostre sou actual o darrer.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Anys de cotització acreditats des del vostre compte","Full contribution duration for your case":"Durada total de la cotització per al teu cas","43 years":"43 anys","43 years and 3 months":"43 anys i 3 mesos","43 years and 6 months":"43 anys i 6 mesos","43 years and 9 months":"43 anys i 9 mesos","44 years":"44 anys","Estimate pension scenario":"Escenari estimat de pensions","Clear inputs":"Esborrar les entrades","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Introduïu els valors que mostra el vostre compte AHV o la previsió oficial.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Escenari indicatiu de pensions de vellesa","Estimated monthly pension":"Pensió mensual estimada","12 regular monthly payments":"12 mensualitats regulars","13th old-age pension":"13a pensió de vellesa","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Total estimat de 12 mesos més 13a pensió","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Import mensual global abans de l'ajust per any de cotització","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Determinació de la renda mitjana anual arrodonida a la franja de la taula oficial","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Anys de cotització acreditats / durada completa","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensió mensual completa mínima per a l'any seleccionat","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pensió mensual completa màxima per a l'any seleccionat","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"La xifra oficial d'ingressos s'arrodoneix a la següent banda de taula publicada. S'aplica la fórmula legal i després s'ajusta per a la durada de la contribució que introduïu.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Previs oficial en línia per a Suïssa i l'estranger: ESCAL","Official references:":"Referències oficials:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Fórmula i imports de la pensió BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Tríptic AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Normes de pensions 13a","Download scenario CSV":"Descàrrega CSV d'escenari","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Escenari calculat en aquest navegador.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Consultar l'exercici fiscal, la mitjana oficial de la renda anual i els imports de l'any de cotització.","Inputs cleared.":"Entrades esborrades.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Escenari baixat com a fitxer CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Puc introduir el meu sou actual?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Núm. L'oficial determinant la renda mitjana anual es basa en la carrera assegurada, la indexació i els crèdits aplicables. Un salari actual per si sol no ho pot predir.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"On trobo la renda mitjana anual determinant?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Utilitzeu el vostre compte individual AHV, una previsió oficial d'ESCAL o la vostra oficina de compensació. Aquesta eina no ho dedueix de l'edat, el país o el salari actual.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Això inclou els crèdits d'atenció i educació o la separació de la parella?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Només si aquests efectes ja estan inclosos en la renda mitjana oficial que ingressi. L'eina no pot determinar els vostres crèdits individuals ni dividir els vostres ingressos.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Calcula la jubilació anticipada o diferida?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Núm. Mostra només escenaris de jubilació normal. Les reduccions de reclamacions anticipades, els augments d'ajornament, els suplements de generació en transició i els límits de cònjuge requereixen registres oficials individuals i no s'inclouen.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Per què hi ha un 13è pagament?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Des de l'any 2026, les persones amb dret a una pensió de vellesa de l'AVS al desembre reben un pagament addicional anual. Aquesta estimació suposa un any sencer de dret i no inclou els suplements per a fills o de transició.","Is this an official pension decision?":"És una decisió oficial de pensions?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Núm. És una estimació utilitzant els valors que proporcioneu. La vostra oficina de compensació determina la pensió vinculant després de comprovar el registre de l'assegurat."},"nl":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Zwitserse AHV/AVS Pensioenscenariocalculator","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Zwitserse AHV-pensioencalculator — Scenario's voor 2026 en 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Schat een Zwitsers AHV/AVS-ouderdomspensioenscenario op basis van uw officiële bepaling van het gemiddelde jaarinkomen en de toegekende premiejaren. Omvat de federale pensioenformule 2026 en 2027 en het 13e ouderdomspensioen.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Vul het bepalende gemiddelde jaarinkomen en de premiejaren in uit uw AHV-rekening of officiële pensioenraming. De tool past de federale formule voor normaal pensioen voor 2026 of 2027 toe en toont maand- en jaarbedragen, inclusief het 13e ouderdomspensioen.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Het bepalende gemiddelde jaarinkomen (RAM) is niet uw huidige salaris. Het weerspiegelt geïndexeerde bijdrage-inkomsten en kan onderwijs- en zorgkredieten en inkomenssplitsing omvatten. Gebruik het bedrag dat op uw officiële rekening of prognose staat. Dit scenario heeft betrekking op één persoon op de normale pensioenleeftijd; het reconstrueert niet een carrière op basis van salaris en bepaalt niet of iemand in aanmerking komt voor de leeftijd.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Alleen ter illustratie: met een in 2027 bepalend gemiddeld jaarinkomen van CHF 46.080 en 44 van de 44 gecrediteerde bijdragejaren, bedraagt ​​het geschatte volledige maandelijkse pensioen CHF 1.946. Vanaf 2026 wordt 13 keer per jaar een kwalificerend ouderdomspensioen uitgekeerd; In dit scenario wordt ervan uitgegaan dat het pensioen voor alle twaalf maanden betaalbaar is.","Pension year":"Pensioenjaar","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Gemiddeld jaarinkomen bepalen uit uw AHV-verklaring (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Gebruik het officiële RAM/bepalen gemiddeld jaarinkomen. Vul niet alleen uw huidige of laatste salaris in.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Bijgeschreven contributiejaren van uw rekening","Full contribution duration for your case":"Volledige bijdrageduur voor uw zaak","43 years":"43 jaar","43 years and 3 months":"43 jaar en 3 maanden","43 years and 6 months":"43 jaar en 6 maanden","43 years and 9 months":"43 jaar en 9 maanden","44 years":"44 jaar","Estimate pension scenario":"Pensioenscenario schatten","Clear inputs":"Duidelijke ingangen","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Vul de waarden in die worden weergegeven door uw AHV-account of officiële prognose.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Indicatief ouderdomspensioenscenario","Estimated monthly pension":"Geschat maandelijks pensioen","12 regular monthly payments":"12 periodieke maandelijkse betalingen","13th old-age pension":"13e ouderdomspensioen","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Geschat totaal voor 12 maanden plus 13e pensioen","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Volledig maandbedrag vóór aanpassing premiejaar","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Bepalen van het gemiddelde jaarinkomen afgerond naar boven op de officiële tabelband","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Gecrediteerde contributiejaren / volledige looptijd","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Minimaal volledig maandelijks pensioen voor het geselecteerde jaar","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maximum volledig maandelijks pensioen voor geselecteerd jaar","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Het officiële inkomenscijfer wordt naar boven afgerond naar de volgende gepubliceerde tabelband. Hierbij wordt de wettelijke formule toegepast, daarna aangepast voor de door u ingevoerde premieduur.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Officiële online schatting voor Zwitserland en het buitenland: ESCAL","Official references:":"Officiële referenties:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV pensioenformule en bedragen","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV folder 3.01","13th pension rules":"13e pensioenreglement","Download scenario CSV":"Scenario CSV downloaden","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario berekend in deze browser.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Controleer het belastingjaar, het officiële gemiddelde jaarinkomen en de premiejaarbedragen.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingangen gewist.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenario gedownload als CSV-bestand.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Kan ik mijn huidige salaris invoeren?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Nr. De officiële vaststelling van het gemiddelde jaarinkomen is gebaseerd op de verzekerde loopbaan, indexatie en toepasselijke kredieten. Een huidig ​​salaris alleen kan dit niet voorspellen.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Waar vind ik het bepalende gemiddelde jaarinkomen?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Gebruik uw individuele AHV-account, een officiële ESCAL-prognose of uw compensatiekantoor. Deze tool leidt dit niet af op basis van leeftijd, land of huidige beloning.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Omvat dit ook zorg- en onderwijskredieten of scheidingen tussen echtgenoten?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Alleen als die effecten al zijn meegerekend in het officiële gemiddelde inkomen dat u invoert. De tool kan uw individuele tegoeden of gesplitste inkomsten niet bepalen.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Berekent het vervroegd of uitgesteld pensioen?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Nee. Het toont alleen normale pensioenscenario's. Voor vervroegde claimkortingen, verhogingen van uitstel, transitiegeneratiesupplementen en partnerlimieten zijn individuele officiële documenten vereist en deze zijn niet inbegrepen.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Waarom is er een 13e betaling?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Sinds 2026 ontvangen mensen die in december recht hebben op een AHV-ouderdomspensioen een extra jaarlijkse uitkering. Deze schatting gaat uit van een volledig jaar recht en omvat geen kinder- of transitietoeslagen.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Is dit een officieel pensioenbesluit?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Nr. Het is een schatting op basis van de waarden die u opgeeft. Uw compensatiekantoor stelt het bindende pensioen vast na controle van het verzekerde dossier."},"el":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Υπολογιστής σεναρίου συνταξιοδότησης Swiss AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — Σενάρια 2026 και 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Υπολογίστε ένα ελβετικό σενάριο σύνταξης γήρατος AHV/AVS από τον επίσημο προσδιορισμό του μέσου ετήσιου εισοδήματος και των πιστωμένων ετών εισφορών. Περιλαμβάνει τον τύπο ομοσπονδιακής σύνταξης 2026 και 2027 και τη 13η σύνταξη γήρατος.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Εισαγάγετε το καθοριστικό μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα και έτη εισφορών από τον λογαριασμό σας AHV ή την επίσημη εκτίμηση σύνταξης. Το εργαλείο εφαρμόζει τον ομοσπονδιακό τύπο κανονικής συνταξιοδότησης για το 2026 ή το 2027 και εμφανίζει μηνιαία και ετήσια ποσά, συμπεριλαμβανομένης της 13ης σύνταξης γήρατος.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Το καθοριστικό μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα (RAM) δεν είναι ο τρέχων μισθός σας. Αντικατοπτρίζει τιμαριθμοποιημένες εισφορές και μπορεί να περιλαμβάνει πιστώσεις εκπαίδευσης και φροντίδας και κατανομή εισοδήματος. Χρησιμοποιήστε το ποσό που εμφανίζεται στον επίσημο λογαριασμό ή την πρόβλεψή σας. Αυτό το σενάριο καλύπτει ένα άτομο σε κανονική ηλικία συνταξιοδότησης. δεν αναδομεί μια καριέρα από τον μισθό ή δεν καθορίζει την καταλληλότητα ηλικίας.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Μόνο απεικόνιση: με μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα 46.080 CHF που προσδιορίζει το 2027 και 44 από 44 πιστωμένες εισφορές, η εκτιμώμενη πλήρης μηνιαία σύνταξη είναι 1.946 CHF. Από το 2026, η ειδική σύνταξη γήρατος καταβάλλεται 13 φορές το χρόνο. Αυτό το σενάριο υποθέτει ότι η σύνταξη είναι πληρωτέα και για τους 12 μήνες.","Pension year":"Έτος σύνταξης","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Προσδιορισμός του μέσου ετήσιου εισοδήματος από το αντίγραφο κίνησης AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε την επίσημη μνήμη RAM / προσδιορίζοντας το μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα. Μην εισάγετε μόνο τον τρέχοντα ή τον τελευταίο μισθό σας.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Πιστωμένες συνεισφορές ετών από τον λογαριασμό σας","Full contribution duration for your case":"Πλήρης διάρκεια συνεισφοράς για την περίπτωσή σας","43 years":"43 χρόνια","43 years and 3 months":"43 χρόνια και 3 μήνες","43 years and 6 months":"43 χρόνια και 6 μήνες","43 years and 9 months":"43 χρόνια και 9 μήνες","44 years":"44 χρόνια","Estimate pension scenario":"Εκτίμηση συνταξιοδοτικού σεναρίου","Clear inputs":"Διαγραφή εισόδων","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Εισαγάγετε τις τιμές που εμφανίζονται από τον λογαριασμό σας AHV ή την επίσημη πρόβλεψη.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Ενδεικτικό σενάριο σύνταξης γήρατος","Estimated monthly pension":"Εκτιμώμενη μηνιαία σύνταξη","12 regular monthly payments":"12 τακτικές μηνιαίες πληρωμές","13th old-age pension":"13η σύνταξη γήρατος","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Εκτιμώμενο σύνολο για 12 μήνες συν 13η σύνταξη","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Μηνιαίο ποσό πλήρους κλίμακας πριν από την προσαρμογή του έτους εισφοράς","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Προσδιορισμός του μέσου ετήσιου εισοδήματος στρογγυλοποιημένο στην επίσημη ζώνη του τραπεζιού","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Έτη πιστωμένης εισφοράς / πλήρης διάρκεια","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Ελάχιστη πλήρη μηνιαία σύνταξη για επιλεγμένο έτος","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Μέγιστη πλήρης μηνιαία σύνταξη για επιλεγμένο έτος","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Το επίσημο ποσό εισοδήματος στρογγυλοποιείται στην επόμενη δημοσιευμένη ζώνη πίνακα. Εφαρμόζεται ο νόμιμος τύπος και, στη συνέχεια, προσαρμόζεται για τη διάρκεια συνεισφοράς που εισάγετε.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Επίσημη ηλεκτρονική εκτίμηση για την Ελβετία και το εξωτερικό: ESCAL","Official references:":"Επίσημες αναφορές:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Τύπος και ποσά σύνταξης BSV\nΦυλλάδιο","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Κανόνες 13ης σύνταξης","Download scenario CSV":"Λήψη σεναρίου CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Το σενάριο υπολογίζεται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Ελέγξτε το φορολογικό έτος, το επίσημο μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα και τα ποσά του έτους εισφορών.","Inputs cleared.":"Οι είσοδοι διαγράφηκαν.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Λήψη του σεναρίου ως αρχείο CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Μπορώ να καταχωρήσω τον τρέχοντα μισθό μου;","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Αρ. Ο επίσημος προσδιορισμός του μέσου ετήσιου εισοδήματος βασίζεται στην ασφαλισμένη καριέρα, την τιμαριθμική αναπροσαρμογή και τις ισχύουσες πιστώσεις. Ένας τρέχων μισθός από μόνος του δεν μπορεί να το προβλέψει.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Πού μπορώ να βρω το καθοριστικό μέσο ετήσιο εισόδημα;","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε τον ατομικό σας λογαριασμό AHV, μια επίσημη πρόβλεψη ESCAL ή το γραφείο αποζημίωσης. Αυτό το εργαλείο δεν το συμπεραίνει από την ηλικία, τη χώρα ή την τρέχουσα αμοιβή.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Περιλαμβάνει πιστώσεις φροντίδας και εκπαίδευσης ή χωρισμό παντρεμένου ζευγαριού;","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Μόνο εάν αυτά τα αποτελέσματα περιλαμβάνονται ήδη στο επίσημο μέσο εισόδημα που καταχωρίζετε. Το εργαλείο δεν μπορεί να προσδιορίσει τις μεμονωμένες πιστώσεις σας ή να μοιράσει το εισόδημά σας.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Υπολογίζει πρόωρη ή αναβαλλόμενη συνταξιοδότηση;","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Αρ. Δείχνει μόνο σενάρια κανονικής συνταξιοδότησης. Οι πρόωρες μειώσεις αξιώσεων, οι αυξήσεις αναβολής, τα συμπληρώματα μεταβατικής γενιάς και τα ανώτατα όρια συζύγου απαιτούν ατομικά επίσημα αρχεία και δεν περιλαμβάνονται.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Γιατί υπάρχει 13η πληρωμή;","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Από το 2026, τα άτομα που δικαιούνται σύνταξη γήρατος AHV τον Δεκέμβριο λαμβάνουν πρόσθετη ετήσια πληρωμή. Αυτή η εκτίμηση προϋποθέτει ένα πλήρες έτος δικαιώματος και δεν περιλαμβάνει τα συμπληρώματα τέκνων ή μετάβασης.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Είναι αυτή μια επίσημη απόφαση για τη σύνταξη;","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Αρ. Είναι μια εκτίμηση που χρησιμοποιεί τις τιμές που παρέχετε. Το γραφείο αποζημίωσης σας καθορίζει τη δεσμευτική σύνταξη αφού ελέγξει το ασφαλισμένο μητρώο."},"ms":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Senario Pencen Persaraan Swiss AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Kalkulator Pencen AHV Switzerland — Senario 2026 dan 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Anggarkan senario pencen umur tua Swiss AHV/AVS daripada purata pendapatan tahunan dan tahun caruman berkredit rasmi anda. Termasuk formula pencen persekutuan 2026 dan 2027 dan pencen hari tua ke-13.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Masukkan purata pendapatan tahunan dan tahun caruman yang menentukan daripada akaun AHV anda atau anggaran pencen rasmi. Alat ini menggunakan formula persaraan biasa persekutuan untuk 2026 atau 2027 dan menunjukkan jumlah bulanan dan tahunan, termasuk pencen hari tua ke-13.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Purata pendapatan tahunan (RAM) yang menentukan bukanlah gaji semasa anda. Ia mencerminkan pendapatan sumbangan yang diindeks dan mungkin termasuk kredit pendidikan dan penjagaan serta pembahagian pendapatan. Gunakan jumlah yang ditunjukkan dalam akaun atau ramalan rasmi anda. Senario ini meliputi seorang pada umur persaraan biasa; ia tidak membina semula kerjaya daripada gaji atau menentukan kelayakan umur.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Ilustrasi sahaja: dengan purata pendapatan tahunan 2027 yang menentukan sebanyak CHF 46,080 dan 44 daripada 44 tahun caruman dikreditkan, anggaran pencen bulanan penuh ialah CHF 1,946. Mulai 2026, pencen hari tua yang layak dibayar 13 kali setahun; senario ini menganggap pencen perlu dibayar untuk semua 12 bulan.","Pension year":"Tahun pencen","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Menentukan purata pendapatan tahunan daripada penyata AHV (CHF) anda","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Gunakan RAM rasmi / menentukan purata pendapatan tahunan. Jangan masukkan hanya gaji semasa atau terakhir anda.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Tahun sumbangan dikreditkan daripada akaun anda","Full contribution duration for your case":"Tempoh sumbangan penuh untuk kes anda","43 years":"43 tahun","43 years and 3 months":"43 tahun 3 bulan","43 years and 6 months":"43 tahun dan 6 bulan","43 years and 9 months":"43 tahun 9 bulan","44 years":"44 tahun","Estimate pension scenario":"Anggaran senario pencen","Clear inputs":"Kosongkan input","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Masukkan nilai yang ditunjukkan oleh akaun AHV anda atau ramalan rasmi.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Senario pencen hari tua indikatif","Estimated monthly pension":"Anggaran pencen bulanan","12 regular monthly payments":"12 bayaran bulanan tetap","13th old-age pension":"pencen hari tua ke-13","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Anggaran jumlah untuk 12 bulan ditambah pencen ke-13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Jumlah bulanan berskala penuh sebelum pelarasan tahun caruman","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Menentukan purata pendapatan tahunan yang dibundarkan kepada band meja rasmi","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Tahun sumbangan berkredit / tempoh penuh","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pencen bulanan penuh minimum untuk tahun terpilih","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Pencen bulanan penuh maksimum untuk tahun terpilih","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Angka pendapatan rasmi dibundarkan ke jalur jadual yang diterbitkan seterusnya. Formula berkanun digunakan, kemudian diselaraskan untuk tempoh sumbangan yang anda masukkan.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Anggaran dalam talian rasmi untuk Switzerland dan luar negara: ESCAL","Official references:":"Rujukan rasmi:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"Formula dan amaun pencen BSV\nRisalah","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"peraturan pencen ke-13","Download scenario CSV":"Muat turun senario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Senario dikira dalam penyemak imbas ini.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Semak tahun cukai, purata pendapatan tahunan rasmi dan jumlah tahun sumbangan.","Inputs cleared.":"Input dibersihkan.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Senario dimuat turun sebagai fail CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Bolehkah saya memasukkan gaji semasa saya?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"No. Purata pendapatan tahunan rasmi yang menentukan adalah berdasarkan kerjaya yang diinsuranskan, indeksasi dan kredit yang berkenaan. Gaji semasa sahaja tidak dapat meramalkannya.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Di manakah saya boleh mencari purata pendapatan tahunan yang menentukan?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Gunakan akaun individu AHV anda, ramalan ESCAL rasmi atau pejabat pampasan anda. Alat ini tidak menyimpulkannya daripada umur, negara atau gaji masa kini.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Adakah ini termasuk kredit penjagaan dan pendidikan atau perpisahan pasangan suami isteri?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Hanya jika kesan tersebut sudah termasuk dalam purata pendapatan rasmi yang anda masukkan. Alat ini tidak dapat menentukan kredit individu anda atau memisahkan pendapatan.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Adakah ia mengira persaraan awal atau tertunda?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"No. Ia menunjukkan senario persaraan biasa sahaja. Pengurangan tuntutan awal, peningkatan penangguhan, tambahan generasi peralihan dan penutup pasangan memerlukan rekod rasmi individu dan tidak disertakan.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Kenapa ada bayaran ke-13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Sejak 2026, orang yang layak mendapat pencen hari tua AHV pada bulan Disember menerima bayaran tahunan tambahan. Anggaran ini mengambil kira setahun penuh kelayakan dan tidak termasuk tambahan kanak-kanak atau peralihan.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Adakah ini keputusan pencen rasmi?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"No. Ia adalah anggaran menggunakan nilai yang anda berikan. Pejabat pampasan anda menentukan pencen yang mengikat selepas menyemak rekod yang diinsuranskan."},"pl":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Szwajcarski kalkulator scenariusza emerytury AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Szwajcarski kalkulator emerytalny AHV — scenariusze na lata 2026 i 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Oszacuj scenariusz szwajcarskiej emerytury AHV/AVS na podstawie oficjalnego ustalenia średniego rocznego dochodu i uznawanych lat składkowych. Obejmuje federalną formułę emerytury na lata 2026 i 2027 oraz 13. emeryturę.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Wprowadź średni roczny dochód i lata składkowe ustalane na podstawie konta AHV lub oficjalnego szacunkowego wymiaru emerytury. Narzędzie stosuje federalną formułę normalnej emerytury na rok 2026 lub 2027 i pokazuje kwoty miesięczne i roczne, w tym 13. emeryturę.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Determinujący średni roczny dochód (RAM) nie jest Twoją obecną pensją. Odzwierciedla indeksowane zarobki ze składek i może obejmować kredyty na edukację i opiekę oraz podział dochodów. Wykorzystaj kwotę pokazaną na Twoim oficjalnym koncie lub prognozie. Scenariusz ten obejmuje jedną osobę w normalnym wieku emerytalnym; nie rekonstruuje kariery na podstawie wynagrodzenia ani nie określa uprawnień wiekowych.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Tylko ilustracja: przy średnim rocznym dochodzie w roku 2027 wynoszącym 46 080 CHF i 44 z 44 uznawanych lat składkowych, szacunkowa pełna miesięczna emerytura wynosi 1 946 CHF. Od 2026 r. kwalifikująca się emerytura będzie wypłacana 13 razy w roku; scenariusz ten zakłada, że ​​emerytura będzie wypłacana przez wszystkie 12 miesięcy.","Pension year":"Rok emerytalny","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Wyznaczanie średniego rocznego dochodu na podstawie wyciągu AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Użyj oficjalnego RAM / ustalania średniego rocznego dochodu. Nie wpisuj tylko aktualnego lub ostatniego wynagrodzenia.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Zaliczone lata składkowe z Twojego konta","Full contribution duration for your case":"Pełny czas trwania składki w Twojej sprawie","43 years":"43 lata","43 years and 3 months":"43 lata i 3 miesiące","43 years and 6 months":"43 lata i 6 miesięcy","43 years and 9 months":"43 lata i 9 miesięcy","44 years":"44 lata","Estimate pension scenario":"Oszacuj scenariusz emerytalny","Clear inputs":"Wyczyść dane wejściowe","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Wprowadź wartości pokazane na Twoim koncie AHV lub w oficjalnej prognozie.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Indykatywny scenariusz emerytalny","Estimated monthly pension":"Szacowana miesięczna emerytura","12 regular monthly payments":"12 regularnych płatności miesięcznych","13th old-age pension":"13. emerytura","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Szacowana suma na 12 miesięcy plus 13. emerytura","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Pełna kwota miesięczna przed korektą za rok składkowy","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Wyznaczanie średniego rocznego dochodu zaokrąglonego w górę do oficjalnego przedziału tabeli","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Zaliczone lata składkowe / pełny okres trwania","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Minimalna pełna miesięczna emerytura za wybrany rok","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maksymalna pełna miesięczna emerytura za wybrany rok","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Oficjalna wielkość dochodu jest zaokrąglana w górę do następnego opublikowanego przedziału tabeli. Stosowany jest wzór ustawowy, następnie korygowany o wprowadzony przez Ciebie okres składkowy.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Oficjalne szacunki online dla Szwajcarii i za granicą: ESCAL","Official references:":"Oficjalne referencje:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV formuła i wysokość emerytury","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Ulotka AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"13. zasady emerytalne","Download scenario CSV":"Pobierz scenariusz CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenariusz obliczony w tej przeglądarce.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Sprawdź rok podatkowy, oficjalny średni roczny dochód i kwotę roku składkowego.","Inputs cleared.":"Wejścia wyczyszczone.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenariusz pobrany jako plik CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Czy mogę wpisać swoje aktualne wynagrodzenie?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Nie. Urzędnik ustalający średni roczny dochód opiera się na ubezpieczonej karierze, indeksacji i obowiązujących kredytach. Sama aktualna pensja nie jest w stanie tego przewidzieć.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Gdzie znajdę decydujący średni roczny dochód?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Skorzystaj ze swojego indywidualnego konta AHV, oficjalnej prognozy ESCAL lub swojego biura odszkodowań. Narzędzie to nie wnioskuje tego na podstawie wieku, kraju czy aktualnej płacy.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Czy obejmuje to kredyty na opiekę i edukację lub rozwód małżeństwa?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Tylko jeśli te efekty są już uwzględnione w oficjalnym średnim dochodzie, który wpisujesz. Narzędzie nie jest w stanie określić Twoich indywidualnych kredytów ani podziału dochodów.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Czy oblicza wcześniejszą lub odroczoną emeryturę?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Nie. Pokazuje tylko scenariusze normalnej emerytury. Wcześniejsze obniżki roszczeń, podwyżki za odroczenie, dodatki z pokolenia na pokolenie i limity dla małżonków wymagają indywidualnych oficjalnych dokumentów i nie są uwzględniane.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Dlaczego istnieje 13. płatność?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Od 2026 roku osoby uprawnione do emerytury AHV w grudniu otrzymują dodatkowe świadczenie roczne. Szacunki te obejmują cały rok uprawnienia i nie obejmują dodatków na dzieci ani dodatków przejściowych.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Czy to oficjalna decyzja emerytalna?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Nie. Jest to oszacowanie na podstawie podanych przez Ciebie wartości. Twoje biuro ds. odszkodowań ustala wiążącą emeryturę po sprawdzeniu historii ubezpieczenia."},"sv":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Schweizisk AHV/AVS Pensionsscenariokalkylator","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 och 2027 scenarier","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Uppskatta ett schweiziskt AHV/AVS ålderspensionsscenario från din officiella fastställande genomsnittliga årsinkomst och krediterade avgiftsår. Inkluderar den federala pensionsformeln 2026 och 2027 och den 13:e ålderspensionen.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Ange den bestämmande genomsnittliga årsinkomsten och avgiftsåren från ditt AHV-konto eller officiella pensionsberäkning. Verktyget tillämpar den federala normala pensionsformeln för 2026 eller 2027 och visar månatliga och årliga belopp, inklusive den 13:e ålderspensionen.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Den bestämmande genomsnittliga årsinkomsten (RAM) är inte din nuvarande lön. Det återspeglar indexerade avgiftsinkomster och kan innefatta utbildnings- och omsorgskrediter och inkomstdelning. Använd det belopp som visas i ditt officiella konto eller din prognos. Detta scenario omfattar en person vid normal pensionsålder; den rekonstruerar inte en karriär från lön eller bestämmer åldersberättigande.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Endast illustration: med en 2027 bestämmande genomsnittlig årsinkomst på 46 080 CHF och 44 av 44 krediterade avgiftsår, är den beräknade fulla månatliga pensionen 1 946 CHF. Från och med 2026 utgår kvalificerande ålderspension 13 gånger per år; Detta scenario förutsätter att pensionen utgår för alla 12 månader.","Pension year":"Pensionsår","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Bestämma genomsnittlig årsinkomst från ditt AHV-utdrag (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Använd det officiella RAM-minnet / bestämma genomsnittlig årsinkomst. Ange inte bara din nuvarande eller senaste lön.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Krediterade bidragsår från ditt konto","Full contribution duration for your case":"Fullständig bidragslängd för ditt ärende","43 years":"43 år","43 years and 3 months":"43 år och 3 månader","43 years and 6 months":"43 år och 6 månader","43 years and 9 months":"43 år och 9 månader","44 years":"44 år","Estimate pension scenario":"Uppskatta pensionsscenario","Clear inputs":"Rensa ingångar","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Ange värdena som visas av ditt AHV-konto eller officiella prognos.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Vägledande ålderspensionsscenario","Estimated monthly pension":"Beräknad månatlig pension","12 regular monthly payments":"12 regelbundna månadsbetalningar","13th old-age pension":"13:e ålderspension","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Beräknad summa för 12 månader plus 13:e pension","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Fullskale månadsbelopp före avgiftsårsjustering","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Bestämma genomsnittlig årsinkomst avrundad till det officiella tabellbandet","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Krediterade bidragsår / full varaktighet","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Minsta hel månadspension för valt år","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maximal hel månadspension för valt år","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Den officiella inkomstsiffran avrundas uppåt till nästa publicerade tabellband. Den lagstadgade formeln tillämpas och justeras sedan för den bidragslängd du anger.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Officiell onlineuppskattning för Schweiz och utomlands: ESCAL","Official references:":"Officiella referenser:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV pensionsformel och belopp","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV broschyr 3.01","13th pension rules":"13:e pensionsregler","Download scenario CSV":"Ladda ner scenario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario beräknat i den här webbläsaren.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Kontrollera beskattningsår, officiella genomsnittliga årsinkomst och avgiftsårsbelopp.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingångar rensade.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenario nedladdat som en CSV-fil.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Kan jag ange min nuvarande lön?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Nr. Den officiella bestämmande genomsnittliga årsinkomsten baseras på den försäkrade karriären, indexering och tillämpliga krediter. Enbart en aktuell lön kan inte förutsäga det.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Var hittar jag den bestämmande genomsnittliga årsinkomsten?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Använd ditt individuella AHV-konto, en officiell ESCAL-prognos eller ditt ersättningskontor. Det här verktyget härleder inte det från ålder, land eller nuvarande lön.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Inkluderar detta vård- och utbildningskrediter eller splittring av gifta par?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Endast om dessa effekter redan ingår i den officiella genomsnittsinkomsten du anger. Verktyget kan inte bestämma dina individuella krediter eller delade inkomster.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Kalkylerar den förtida eller uppskjuten pension?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Nr. Den visar bara normala pensionsscenarier. Tidiga skadereduktioner, höjningar av uppskov, tillägg för övergångsgeneration och spousetak kräver individuella officiella register och ingår inte.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Varför finns det en 13:e betalning?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Sedan 2026 får personer som är berättigade till AHV-ålderspension i december en extra årlig utbetalning. Denna uppskattning förutsätter ett helt år av rätt och inkluderar inte barn- eller övergångstillägg.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Är detta ett officiellt pensionsbeslut?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Nr. Det är en uppskattning med de värden du anger. Ditt ersättningskontor fastställer den bindande pensionen efter att ha kontrollerat försäkringsjournalen."},"th":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณสถานการณ์เงินบำนาญเกษียณอายุของสวิส AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"เครื่องคำนวณเงินบำนาญของ Swiss AHV - สถานการณ์ปี 2026 และ 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"ประมาณการสถานการณ์เงินบำนาญผู้สูงอายุของสวิส AHV/AVS จากการกำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีและจำนวนปีสมทบที่เป็นทางการของคุณ รวมสูตรเงินบำนาญของรัฐบาลกลางปี ​​2026 และ 2027 และเงินบำนาญวัยชราครั้งที่ 13","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"ป้อนรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีที่กำหนดและปีการสมทบจากบัญชี AHV ของคุณหรือประมาณการเงินบำนาญอย่างเป็นทางการ เครื่องมือนี้ใช้สูตรการเกษียณอายุตามปกติของรัฐบาลกลางสำหรับปี 2026 หรือ 2027 และแสดงจำนวนเงินรายเดือนและรายปี รวมถึงเงินบำนาญวัยชราครั้งที่ 13","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"การกำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปี (RAM) ไม่ใช่เงินเดือนปัจจุบันของคุณ โดยสะท้อนถึงรายได้จากการสมทบทุนที่จัดทำดัชนีไว้ และอาจรวมถึงเครดิตการศึกษาและการดูแล และการแบ่งรายได้ ใช้จำนวนเงินที่แสดงในบัญชีอย่างเป็นทางการหรือการคาดการณ์ของคุณ ภาพจำลองนี้ครอบคลุมบุคคลหนึ่งคนในวัยเกษียณตามปกติ มันไม่ได้สร้างอาชีพขึ้นมาใหม่จากเงินเดือนหรือกำหนดอายุที่เหมาะสม","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"ภาพประกอบเท่านั้น: ในปี 2027 กำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีที่ CHF 46,080 และ 44 จาก 44 ปีที่ได้รับเครดิต เงินบำนาญเต็มจำนวนต่อเดือนโดยประมาณคือ CHF 1,946 ตั้งแต่ปี 2569 เป็นต้นไป จะมีการจ่ายบำนาญผู้สูงอายุที่มีคุณสมบัติตามที่กำหนด 13 ครั้งต่อปี สถานการณ์นี้ถือว่าต้องจ่ายเงินบำนาญครบ 12 เดือน","Pension year":"ปีบำนาญ","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"การกำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีจากใบแจ้งยอด AHV ของคุณ (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"ใช้ RAM อย่างเป็นทางการ / กำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปี อย่าป้อนเฉพาะเงินเดือนปัจจุบันหรือเงินเดือนล่าสุดของคุณ","Credited contribution years from your account":"จำนวนปีที่ได้รับเครดิตจากบัญชีของคุณ","Full contribution duration for your case":"ระยะเวลาการสนับสนุนเต็มจำนวนสำหรับกรณีของคุณ","43 years":"43 ปี","43 years and 3 months":"43 ปี 3 เดือน","43 years and 6 months":"43 ปี 6 เดือน","43 years and 9 months":"43 ปี 9 เดือน","44 years":"44 ปี","Estimate pension scenario":"ประมาณการสถานการณ์เงินบำนาญ","Clear inputs":"ล้างอินพุต","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"ป้อนค่าที่แสดงโดยบัญชี AHV ของคุณหรือการคาดการณ์อย่างเป็นทางการ","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"สถานการณ์บ่งชี้เงินบำนาญวัยชรา","Estimated monthly pension":"เงินบำนาญรายเดือนโดยประมาณ","12 regular monthly payments":"12 การชำระเงินรายเดือนปกติ","13th old-age pension":"บำนาญวัยชราครั้งที่ 13","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"ยอดรวมโดยประมาณ 12 เดือนบวกเงินบำนาญครั้งที่ 13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"จำนวนเงินเต็มสเกลต่อเดือนก่อนการปรับปรุงปีสมทบ","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"การกำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีปัดเศษขึ้นตามแถบตารางอย่างเป็นทางการ","Credited contribution years / full duration":"ปีที่ได้รับเครดิต/เต็มระยะเวลา","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"เงินบำนาญรายเดือนขั้นต่ำเต็มจำนวนสำหรับปีที่เลือก","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"เงินบำนาญเต็มจำนวนรายเดือนสูงสุดสำหรับปีที่เลือก","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"ตัวเลขรายได้อย่างเป็นทางการจะปัดเศษขึ้นตามแถบตารางที่เผยแพร่ถัดไป มีการใช้สูตรตามกฎหมาย จากนั้นจึงปรับตามระยะเวลาการบริจาคที่คุณป้อน","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"การประมาณการออนไลน์อย่างเป็นทางการสำหรับสวิตเซอร์แลนด์และต่างประเทศ: ESCAL","Official references:":"ข้อมูลอ้างอิงอย่างเป็นทางการ:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"สูตรและจำนวนเงินบำนาญ BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"ใบปลิว AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"กฎบำนาญที่ 13","Download scenario CSV":"ดาวน์โหลดสถานการณ์ CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"สถานการณ์ที่คำนวณในเบราว์เซอร์นี้","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"ตรวจสอบปีภาษี รายได้ต่อปีเฉลี่ยอย่างเป็นทางการ และจำนวนเงินปีสมทบ","Inputs cleared.":"ล้างอินพุตแล้ว","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"สถานการณ์ที่ดาวน์โหลดเป็นไฟล์ CSV","Can I enter my current salary?":"ฉันสามารถระบุเงินเดือนปัจจุบันของฉันได้หรือไม่?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"เลขที่ การกำหนดรายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีอย่างเป็นทางการขึ้นอยู่กับอาชีพของผู้ประกันตน การจัดทำดัชนี และเครดิตที่เกี่ยวข้อง เงินเดือนปัจจุบันเพียงอย่างเดียวไม่สามารถคาดเดาได้","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"ฉันจะหารายได้เฉลี่ยต่อปีที่กำหนดได้จากที่ไหน?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"ใช้บัญชีรายบุคคล AHV ของคุณ การคาดการณ์ ESCAL อย่างเป็นทางการ หรือสำนักงานค่าตอบแทนของคุณ เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้อนุมานจากอายุ ประเทศ หรือค่าจ้างในปัจจุบัน","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"นี่รวมถึงเครดิตการดูแลและการศึกษาหรือการแยกทางกันของคู่สมรสหรือไม่?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"เฉพาะในกรณีที่ผลกระทบเหล่านั้นรวมอยู่ในรายได้เฉลี่ยอย่างเป็นทางการที่คุณป้อนแล้วเท่านั้น เครื่องมือนี้ไม่สามารถระบุเครดิตส่วนบุคคลหรือแบ่งรายได้ของคุณได้","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"คำนวณการเกษียณก่อนกำหนดหรือเลื่อนออกไปหรือไม่?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"เลขที่ โดยจะแสดงสถานการณ์การเกษียณอายุตามปกติเท่านั้น การลดการเรียกร้องค่าสินไหมทดแทนก่อนกำหนด การเพิ่มการเลื่อนเวลา การเสริมการเปลี่ยนแปลง และจำนวนสูงสุดของคู่สมรส จำเป็นต้องมีบันทึกอย่างเป็นทางการของแต่ละบุคคลและจะไม่รวมอยู่ด้วย","Why is there a 13th payment?":"ทำไมถึงมีการชำระเงินครั้งที่ 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"ตั้งแต่ปี 2026 ผู้ที่มีสิทธิได้รับเงินบำนาญผู้สูงอายุของ AHV ในเดือนธันวาคมจะได้รับเงินรายปีเพิ่มเติม การประมาณการนี้ถือว่าหนึ่งปีเต็มของการได้รับสิทธิ และไม่รวมค่าเสริมสำหรับเด็กหรือช่วงการเปลี่ยนผ่าน","Is this an official pension decision?":"นี่เป็นการตัดสินใจเรื่องเงินบำนาญอย่างเป็นทางการหรือไม่?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"เลขที่ เป็นการประมาณการโดยใช้ค่าที่คุณระบุ สำนักงานค่าตอบแทนของคุณจะกำหนดเงินบำนาญที่มีผลผูกพันหลังจากตรวจสอบบันทึกผู้เอาประกันภัย"},"uk":{"2026":"2026 рік","2027":"2027 рік","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Швейцарський калькулятор пенсії AHV/AVS","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Калькулятор пенсій AHV у Швейцарії — сценарії 2026 та 2027 років","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Оцініть сценарій AHV/AVS пенсії за віком у Швейцарії на основі вашого офіційного визначення середнього річного доходу та років, зарахованих до сплати внесків. Включає федеральну пенсійну формулу 2026 і 2027 років і 13-ту пенсію за віком.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Введіть визначальний середній річний дохід і роки внесків із вашого рахунку AHV або офіційної оцінки пенсії. Інструмент застосовує федеральну формулу нормального виходу на пенсію для 2026 або 2027 років і показує місячні та річні суми, включаючи 13-ту пенсію за віком.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Визначальний середньорічний дохід (RAM) не є вашою поточною зарплатою. Він відображає індексовані доходи від внесків і може включати кредити на освіту та догляд, а також розподіл доходу. Використовуйте суму, указану у вашому офіційному рахунку або прогнозі. Цей сценарій охоплює одну особу нормального пенсійного віку; він не реконструює кар'єру на підставі зарплати чи визначає відповідність віку.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Лише ілюстрація: із середнім річним доходом у 2027 році в 46 080 швейцарських франків і 44 із 44 років сплати внесків, орієнтовна повна місячна пенсія становить 1946 швейцарських франків. З 2026 року пенсія за віком виплачується 13 разів на рік; цей сценарій передбачає, що пенсія виплачується за всі 12 місяців.","Pension year":"Пенсійний рік","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Визначення середньорічного доходу з вашого звіту про AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Використовуйте офіційну RAM / визначення середньорічного доходу. Не вводьте лише свою поточну або останню зарплату.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Зараховані роки внесків з вашого рахунку","Full contribution duration for your case":"Повна тривалість внеску для вашої справи","43 years":"43 роки","43 years and 3 months":"43 роки 3 міс","43 years and 6 months":"43 роки 6 місяців","43 years and 9 months":"43 роки 9 місяців","44 years":"44 роки","Estimate pension scenario":"Сценарій розрахунку пенсії","Clear inputs":"Очистити введені дані","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Введіть значення, показані вашим обліковим записом AHV або офіційним прогнозом.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Індикативний сценарій пенсії за віком","Estimated monthly pension":"Розрахункова місячна пенсія","12 regular monthly payments":"12 регулярних щомісячних платежів","13th old-age pension":"13 пенсія за віком","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Орієнтовна сума за 12 місяців плюс 13-та пенсія","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Повна місячна сума до коригування внесків за рік","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Визначення середньорічного доходу, округленого до офіційної таблиці","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Зараховані роки внесків / повна тривалість","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Мінімальна повна місячна пенсія за обраний рік","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Максимальна повна місячна пенсія за обраний рік","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Офіційна цифра доходу округлюється до наступної опублікованої групи таблиці. Застосовується законодавча формула, яка потім коригується відповідно до введеної вами тривалості внеску.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Офіційна онлайн-кошторис для Швейцарії та за кордоном: ESCAL","Official references:":"Офіційні довідки:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV формула та розміри пенсії","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV листівка 3.01","13th pension rules":"13-ті правила пенсійного забезпечення","Download scenario CSV":"Завантажити сценарій CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Сценарій, розрахований у цьому браузері.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Перевірте податковий рік, офіційний середньорічний дохід і суми внесків за рік.","Inputs cleared.":"Введення очищено.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Сценарій завантажено як файл CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Чи можу я ввести свою поточну зарплату?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"№ Офіційний середньорічний дохід визначається на основі страхового стажу, індексації та відповідних кредитів. Лише поточна зарплата не може це передбачити.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Де я можу знайти визначальний середньорічний дохід?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Використовуйте свій індивідуальний обліковий запис AHV, офіційний прогноз ESCAL або ваш офіс компенсації. Цей інструмент не залежить від віку, країни або поточної оплати праці.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Чи включає це кредити на догляд та освіту чи розлучення подружньої пари?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Тільки якщо ці ефекти вже включені в офіційний середній дохід, який ви вводите. Інструмент не може визначити ваші індивідуальні кредити чи розподіл доходу.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Чи розраховується достроковий або відстрочений вихід на пенсію?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"№ Він показує лише сценарії нормального виходу на пенсію. Ранні скорочення претензій, збільшення відстрочки, доплати для перехідного покоління та обмеження для подружжя потребують індивідуальних офіційних записів і не включені.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Чому існує 13-й платіж?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"З 2026 року люди, які мають право на пенсію за віком у грудні, отримують щорічну доплату. Ця оцінка передбачає повний рік права і не включає доплати на дітей або перехідний період.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Це офіційне пенсійне рішення?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"№ Це оцінка з використанням наданих вами значень. Ваш відділ компенсацій визначає обов'язкову пенсію після перевірки страхового стажу."},"sw":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Hali ya Pensheni ya Kustaafu ya AHV/AVS ya Uswizi","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Kikokotoo cha Pensheni cha AHV cha Uswizi - Matukio ya 2026 na 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Kadiria hali ya pensheni ya wazee ya Uswizi ya AHV/AVS kutoka kwa kubainisha rasmi wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka na miaka ya mchango iliyoainishwa. Inajumuisha fomula ya pensheni ya shirikisho ya 2026 na 2027 na pensheni ya 13 ya wazee.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Weka wastani wa miaka inayobainisha ya mapato na mchango wa kila mwaka kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya AHV au makadirio rasmi ya pensheni. Chombo hiki kinatumia fomula ya shirikisho ya kustaafu ya kawaida ya 2026 au 2027 na inaonyesha viwango vya kila mwezi na kila mwaka, ikijumuisha pensheni ya 13 ya wazee.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Wastani wa mapato ya mwaka unaobainisha (RAM) sio mshahara wako wa sasa. Inaonyesha mapato ya michango iliyoorodheshwa na inaweza kujumuisha mikopo ya elimu na utunzaji na mgawanyo wa mapato. Tumia kiasi kilichoonyeshwa kwenye akaunti yako rasmi au utabiri. Hali hii inahusu mtu mmoja katika umri wa kawaida wa kustaafu; haiunda upya taaluma kutokana na mshahara au kuamua kustahiki umri.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Mchoro pekee: kwa 2027 kubainisha wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka ya CHF 46,080 na 44 kati ya miaka 44 ya mchango iliyoainishwa, makadirio ya pensheni kamili ya kila mwezi ni CHF 1,946. Kuanzia 2026, pensheni ya uzee inayohitimu inalipwa mara 13 kwa mwaka; hali hii inadhani pensheni inalipwa kwa miezi yote 12.","Pension year":"Mwaka wa pensheni","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Kuamua wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka kutoka kwa taarifa yako ya AHV (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Tumia RAM rasmi / kubainisha wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka. Usiingize tu mshahara wako wa sasa au wa mwisho.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Miaka ya mchango ulioidhinishwa kutoka kwa akaunti yako","Full contribution duration for your case":"Muda kamili wa mchango kwa kesi yako","43 years":"miaka 43","43 years and 3 months":"miaka 43 na miezi 3","43 years and 6 months":"miaka 43 na miezi 6","43 years and 9 months":"miaka 43 na miezi 9","44 years":"miaka 44","Estimate pension scenario":"Kadiria hali ya pensheni","Clear inputs":"Futa pembejeo","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Weka thamani zilizoonyeshwa na akaunti yako ya AHV au utabiri rasmi.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Elekezi ya pensheni ya uzee","Estimated monthly pension":"Kadirio la pensheni ya kila mwezi","12 regular monthly payments":"12 malipo ya kila mwezi ya kawaida","13th old-age pension":"13 ya uzee pensheni","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Kadirio la jumla la miezi 12 pamoja na pensheni ya 13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Kiwango kamili cha kila mwezi kabla ya marekebisho ya mwaka wa mchango","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Kuamua wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka yaliyowekwa kwenye bendi rasmi ya jedwali","Credited contribution years / full duration":"miaka ya mchango ulioidhinishwa / muda kamili","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Kima cha chini cha pensheni kamili ya kila mwezi kwa mwaka uliochaguliwa","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Kiwango cha juu cha pensheni kamili ya kila mwezi kwa mwaka uliochaguliwa","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Takwimu rasmi ya mapato inakusanywa hadi bendi inayofuata ya jedwali iliyochapishwa. Fomula ya kisheria inatumika, kisha kurekebishwa kwa muda wa mchango unaoweka.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Kadirio rasmi la mtandaoni kwa Uswisi na nje ya nchi: ESCAL","Official references:":"Marejeleo rasmi:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV fomula na kiasi cha pensheni","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV kipeperushi 3.01","13th pension rules":"sheria za pensheni za 13","Download scenario CSV":"Pakua hali ya CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario imekokotolewa katika kivinjari hiki.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Angalia mwaka wa ushuru, wastani rasmi wa mapato ya kila mwaka na viwango vya mwaka wa michango.","Inputs cleared.":"Imefuta.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenario imepakuliwa kama faili ya CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Je, ninaweza kuingiza mshahara wangu wa sasa?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Na. Kiwango rasmi cha wastani cha mapato ya kila mwaka kinatokana na taaluma iliyowekewa bima, faharasa na mikopo inayotumika. Mshahara wa sasa pekee hauwezi kutabiri.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Nitapata wapi wastani wa mapato ya kila mwaka?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Tumia akaunti yako ya kibinafsi ya AHV, utabiri rasmi wa ESCAL au ofisi yako ya fidia. Zana hii haiashirii kulingana na umri, nchi au malipo ya sasa.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Je, hii inajumuisha mikopo ya matunzo na elimu au kutengana kwa watu waliooana?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Ikiwa tu athari hizo tayari zimejumuishwa kwenye wastani rasmi wa mapato unayoingiza. Zana haiwezi kuamua mikopo yako binafsi au kugawanya mapato.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Je, inakokotoa kustaafu mapema au kuahirishwa?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Na. Inaonyesha matukio ya kawaida ya kustaafu pekee. Kupunguzwa kwa madai ya mapema, ongezeko la kuahirishwa, nyongeza za kizazi cha mpito na kofia za mwenzi zinahitaji rekodi rasmi za kibinafsi na hazijumuishwi.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Kwa nini kuna malipo ya 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Tangu 2026, watu wanaostahiki pensheni ya uzee ya AHV mwezi wa Desemba hupokea malipo ya ziada ya kila mwaka. Kadirio hili linachukua mwaka mzima wa haki na halijumuishi nyongeza za watoto au za mpito.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Je, huu ni uamuzi rasmi wa pensheni?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Na. Ni makadirio kwa kutumia thamani unazotoa. Ofisi yako ya fidia huamua pensheni ya kisheria baada ya kuangalia rekodi ya bima."},"mr":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"स्विस AHV/AVS सेवानिवृत्ती पेन्शन परिस्थिती कॅल्क्युलेटर","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"स्विस AHV पेन्शन कॅल्क्युलेटर - 2026 आणि 2027 परिस्थिती","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"स्विस AHV/AVS वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शन परिस्थितीचा अंदाज तुमच्या अधिकृत वार्षिक सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न आणि श्रेय दिलेल्या योगदान वर्षांवरून काढा. 2026 आणि 2027 फेडरल पेन्शन फॉर्म्युला आणि 13 वी वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शन समाविष्ट करते.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"तुमच्या AHV खात्यातून किंवा अधिकृत पेन्शन अंदाजानुसार सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न आणि योगदान वर्षे एंटर करा. हे टूल 2026 किंवा 2027 साठी फेडरल नॉर्मल-रिटायरमेंट फॉर्म्युला लागू करते आणि 13 व्या वृद्धापकाळाच्या पेन्शनसह मासिक आणि वार्षिक रक्कम दर्शवते.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न (RAM) निर्धारित करणे हा तुमचा सध्याचा पगार नाही. हे अनुक्रमित योगदान कमाई प्रतिबिंबित करते आणि त्यात शिक्षण आणि काळजी क्रेडिट आणि उत्पन्नाचे विभाजन समाविष्ट असू शकते. तुमच्या अधिकृत खात्यात किंवा अंदाजामध्ये दाखवलेली रक्कम वापरा. ही परिस्थिती सामान्य सेवानिवृत्तीच्या वयातील एका व्यक्तीचा समावेश करते; ते पगारातून करिअरची पुनर्रचना करत नाही किंवा वयाची पात्रता ठरवत नाही.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"केवळ चित्रण: 2027 चे सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न CHF 46,080 आणि 44 क्रेडिट केलेल्या योगदान वर्षांपैकी 44 निर्धारित करून, अंदाजे पूर्ण मासिक पेन्शन CHF 1,946 आहे. 2026 पासून, पात्र वृद्धापकाळ निवृत्ती वेतन वर्षातून 13 वेळा दिले जाते; ही परिस्थिती गृहीत धरते की पेन्शन सर्व 12 महिन्यांसाठी देय आहे.","Pension year":"पेन्शन वर्ष","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"तुमच्या AHV स्टेटमेंट (CHF) वरून सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न निश्चित करणे","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"अधिकृत RAM वापरा / सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न निश्चित करा. फक्त तुमचा सध्याचा किंवा शेवटचा पगार टाकू नका.","Credited contribution years from your account":"तुमच्या खात्यातून जमा केलेले योगदान वर्ष","Full contribution duration for your case":"तुमच्या केससाठी पूर्ण योगदान कालावधी","43 years":"43 वर्षे","43 years and 3 months":"43 वर्षे आणि 3 महिने","43 years and 6 months":"43 वर्षे आणि 6 महिने","43 years and 9 months":"43 वर्षे आणि 9 महिने","44 years":"44 वर्षे","Estimate pension scenario":"पेन्शन परिस्थितीचा अंदाज लावा","Clear inputs":"क्लीअर इनपुट","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"तुमच्या AHV खात्याने दाखवलेली मूल्ये किंवा अधिकृत अंदाज एंटर करा.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"सूचक वृद्धापकाळ निवृत्तीवेतन परिदृश्य","Estimated monthly pension":"अंदाजित मासिक पेन्शन","12 regular monthly payments":"12 नियमित मासिक पेमेंट","13th old-age pension":"13वी वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शन","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 महिने अधिक 13 व्या पेन्शनसाठी अंदाजे एकूण","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"योगदान-वर्ष समायोजनापूर्वी पूर्ण प्रमाणात मासिक रक्कम","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"अधिकृत टेबल बँड पर्यंत गोळा केलेले सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न निर्धारित करणे","Credited contribution years / full duration":"श्रेय दिलेली योगदान वर्षे / पूर्ण कालावधी","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"निवडलेल्या वर्षासाठी किमान पूर्ण मासिक पेन्शन","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"निवडलेल्या वर्षासाठी कमाल पूर्ण मासिक पेन्शन","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"अधिकृत उत्पन्नाचा आकडा पुढील प्रकाशित टेबल बँडपर्यंत पूर्ण केला जातो. वैधानिक सूत्र लागू केले जाते, नंतर तुम्ही प्रविष्ट केलेल्या योगदान कालावधीसाठी समायोजित केले जाते.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"स्वित्झर्लंड आणि परदेशासाठी अधिकृत ऑनलाइन अंदाज: ESCAL","Official references:":"अधिकृत संदर्भ:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV पेन्शन फॉर्म्युला आणि रक्कम","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV पत्रक 3.01","13th pension rules":"13वे पेन्शन नियम","Download scenario CSV":"परिदृश्य CSV डाउनलोड करा","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"या ब्राउझरमध्ये गणना केलेली परिस्थिती.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"कर वर्ष, अधिकृत सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न आणि योगदान-वर्षाची रक्कम तपासा.","Inputs cleared.":"इनपुट साफ केले.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"सीएसव्ही फाइल म्हणून डाउनलोड केलेली परिस्थिती.","Can I enter my current salary?":"मी माझा सध्याचा पगार प्रविष्ट करू शकतो का?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"नाही. सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न निर्धारित करणारे अधिकृत विमा उतरवलेले करिअर, इंडेक्सेशन आणि लागू क्रेडिट्सवर आधारित असतात. सध्याचा पगारच त्याचा अंदाज लावू शकत नाही.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"मला सरासरी वार्षिक उत्पन्न कुठे मिळेल?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"तुमचे AHV वैयक्तिक खाते, अधिकृत ESCAL अंदाज किंवा तुमचे नुकसान भरपाई कार्यालय वापरा. हे साधन वय, देश किंवा सध्याच्या वेतनावरून याचा अंदाज लावत नाही.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"यामध्ये काळजी आणि शिक्षण क्रेडिट्स किंवा विवाहित जोडप्यांचे विभाजन समाविष्ट आहे का?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"आपण प्रविष्ट करत असलेल्या अधिकृत सरासरी उत्पन्नामध्ये ते प्रभाव आधीच समाविष्ट केले असल्यासच. साधन तुमची वैयक्तिक क्रेडिट्स किंवा विभाजित उत्पन्न निर्धारित करू शकत नाही.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"यामध्ये लवकर किंवा स्थगित सेवानिवृत्तीची गणना होते का?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"नाही. हे फक्त सामान्य-निवृत्ती परिस्थिती दर्शवते. लवकर दावा कपात, स्थगित वाढ, संक्रमण-जनरेशन पूरक आणि जोडीदार कॅप्स वैयक्तिक अधिकृत रेकॉर्ड आवश्यक आहेत आणि समाविष्ट नाहीत.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"१३वे पेमेंट का आहे?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 पासून, डिसेंबरमध्ये AHV वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शनसाठी पात्र असलेल्या लोकांना अतिरिक्त वार्षिक पेमेंट मिळते. हा अंदाज पूर्ण वर्षाचा हक्क गृहीत धरतो आणि त्यात मूल किंवा संक्रमण पूरक समाविष्ट नाही.","Is this an official pension decision?":"हा अधिकृत पेन्शन निर्णय आहे का?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"नाही. तुम्ही प्रदान केलेली मूल्ये वापरून हा अंदाज आहे. तुमचे नुकसान भरपाई कार्यालय विमा उतरवलेले रेकॉर्ड तपासल्यानंतर बंधनकारक पेन्शन ठरवते."},"te":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"స్విస్ AHV/AVS రిటైర్మెంట్ పెన్షన్ సినారియో కాలిక్యులేటర్","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"స్విస్ AHV పెన్షన్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — 2026 మరియు 2027 దృశ్యాలు","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"మీ అధికారిక సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయం మరియు క్రెడిట్ చేయబడిన సహకార సంవత్సరాలను నిర్ణయించే స్విస్ AHV/AVS వృద్ధాప్య పింఛను దృష్టాంతాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి. 2026 మరియు 2027 ఫెడరల్ పెన్షన్ ఫార్ములా మరియు 13వ వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్‌ను కలిగి ఉంటుంది.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"మీ AHV ఖాతా లేదా అధికారిక పెన్షన్ అంచనా నుండి నిర్ణయించే సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయం మరియు సహకారం సంవత్సరాలను నమోదు చేయండి. ఈ సాధనం 2026 లేదా 2027కి సంబంధించిన ఫెడరల్ నార్మల్-రిటైర్మెంట్ ఫార్ములాను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది మరియు 13వ వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్‌తో సహా నెలవారీ మరియు వార్షిక మొత్తాలను చూపుతుంది.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"నిర్ధారించే సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయం (RAM) మీ ప్రస్తుత జీతం కాదు. ఇది ఇండెక్స్డ్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ ఆదాయాలను ప్రతిబింబిస్తుంది మరియు విద్య మరియు సంరక్షణ క్రెడిట్‌లు మరియు ఆదాయ విభజనను కలిగి ఉండవచ్చు. మీ అధికారిక ఖాతా లేదా సూచనలో చూపిన మొత్తాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి. ఈ దృశ్యం సాధారణ పదవీ విరమణ వయస్సులో ఒక వ్యక్తిని కవర్ చేస్తుంది; ఇది జీతం నుండి వృత్తిని పునర్నిర్మించదు లేదా వయస్సు అర్హతను నిర్ణయించదు.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"ఇలస్ట్రేషన్ మాత్రమే: 2027లో CHF 46,080 మరియు 44 జమ చేయబడిన సహకార సంవత్సరాలలో 44 నిర్ణయించే సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయంతో, అంచనా వేయబడిన పూర్తి నెలవారీ పెన్షన్ CHF 1,946. 2026 నుండి, అర్హత కలిగిన వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ సంవత్సరానికి 13 సార్లు చెల్లించబడుతుంది; ఈ దృష్టాంతంలో పెన్షన్ మొత్తం 12 నెలలకు చెల్లించబడుతుందని భావించబడుతుంది.","Pension year":"పెన్షన్ సంవత్సరం","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"మీ AHV స్టేట్‌మెంట్ (CHF) నుండి సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయాన్ని నిర్ణయించడం","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"అధికారిక RAMని ఉపయోగించండి / సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయాన్ని నిర్ణయించండి. మీ ప్రస్తుత లేదా చివరి జీతం మాత్రమే నమోదు చేయవద్దు.","Credited contribution years from your account":"మీ ఖాతా నుండి క్రెడిట్ చేయబడిన సహకారం సంవత్సరాలు","Full contribution duration for your case":"మీ కేసు కోసం పూర్తి సహకారం వ్యవధి","43 years":"43 సంవత్సరాలు","43 years and 3 months":"43 సంవత్సరాల 3 నెలలు","43 years and 6 months":"43 సంవత్సరాల 6 నెలలు","43 years and 9 months":"43 సంవత్సరాల 9 నెలలు","44 years":"44 సంవత్సరాలు","Estimate pension scenario":"పెన్షన్ దృశ్యాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","Clear inputs":"ఇన్‌పుట్‌లను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"మీ AHV ఖాతా లేదా అధికారిక సూచన ద్వారా చూపబడిన విలువలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ దృష్టాంతం","Estimated monthly pension":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నెలవారీ పెన్షన్","12 regular monthly payments":"12 సాధారణ నెలవారీ చెల్లింపులు","13th old-age pension":"13వ వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 నెలలతో పాటు 13వ పెన్షన్ కోసం అంచనా వేసిన మొత్తం","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"కంట్రిబ్యూషన్-ఇయర్ సర్దుబాటుకు ముందు పూర్తి స్థాయి నెలవారీ మొత్తం","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"సరాసరి వార్షిక ఆదాయాన్ని అధికారిక పట్టిక బ్యాండ్‌కు పూరించడాన్ని నిర్ణయించడం","Credited contribution years / full duration":"క్రెడిటెడ్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ సంవత్సరాలు / పూర్తి వ్యవధి","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"ఎంచుకున్న సంవత్సరానికి కనీస పూర్తి నెలవారీ పెన్షన్","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"ఎంచుకున్న సంవత్సరానికి గరిష్ట పూర్తి నెలవారీ పెన్షన్","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"అధికారిక ఆదాయ సంఖ్య తదుపరి ప్రచురించబడిన టేబుల్ బ్యాండ్‌కు పూరించబడింది. చట్టబద్ధమైన ఫార్ములా వర్తించబడుతుంది, ఆపై మీరు నమోదు చేసే సహకార వ్యవధికి సర్దుబాటు చేయబడుతుంది.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"స్విట్జర్లాండ్ మరియు విదేశాలకు అధికారిక ఆన్‌లైన్ అంచనా: ESCAL","Official references:":"అధికారిక సూచనలు:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV పెన్షన్ ఫార్ములా మరియు మొత్తాలు","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV కరపత్రం 3.01","13th pension rules":"13వ పెన్షన్ నియమాలు","Download scenario CSV":"సినారియో CSVని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో దృశ్యం లెక్కించబడుతుంది.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"పన్ను సంవత్సరం, అధికారిక సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయం మరియు సహకారం-సంవత్సరం మొత్తాలను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Inputs cleared.":"ఇన్‌పుట్‌లు క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"దృష్టాంతం CSV ఫైల్‌గా డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయబడింది.","Can I enter my current salary?":"నేను నా ప్రస్తుత జీతం నమోదు చేయవచ్చా?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"నం. అధికారికంగా నిర్ణయించే సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయం బీమా చేయబడిన కెరీర్, ఇండెక్సేషన్ మరియు వర్తించే క్రెడిట్‌లపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది. ప్రస్తుత జీతం మాత్రమే దానిని అంచనా వేయదు.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"నిర్ధారించే సగటు వార్షిక ఆదాయాన్ని నేను ఎక్కడ కనుగొనగలను?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"మీ AHV వ్యక్తిగత ఖాతా, అధికారిక ESCAL సూచన లేదా మీ పరిహార కార్యాలయాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి. ఈ సాధనం వయస్సు, దేశం లేదా ప్రస్తుత వేతనం నుండి దీనిని ఊహించదు.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"ఇందులో సంరక్షణ మరియు విద్య క్రెడిట్‌లు లేదా వివాహిత జంట విడిపోవడాన్ని కలిగి ఉంటారా?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"మీరు నమోదు చేసే అధికారిక సగటు ఆదాయంలో ఆ ప్రభావాలు ఇప్పటికే చేర్చబడితే మాత్రమే. సాధనం మీ వ్యక్తిగత క్రెడిట్‌లను లేదా ఆదాయాన్ని విభజించలేదు.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"ఇది ముందస్తు లేదా వాయిదా వేసిన పదవీ విరమణను లెక్కిస్తుందా?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"నం. ఇది సాధారణ పదవీ విరమణ దృశ్యాలను మాత్రమే చూపుతుంది. ముందస్తు క్లెయిమ్ తగ్గింపులు, వాయిదా పెరుగుదల, పరివర్తన-తరం సప్లిమెంట్‌లు మరియు జీవిత భాగస్వామి క్యాప్‌లకు వ్యక్తిగత అధికారిక రికార్డులు అవసరం మరియు అవి చేర్చబడవు.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13వ చెల్లింపు ఎందుకు ఉంది?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 నుండి, డిసెంబర్‌లో AHV వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్‌కు అర్హులైన వ్యక్తులు అదనపు వార్షిక చెల్లింపును అందుకుంటారు. ఈ అంచనా పూర్తి సంవత్సరం అర్హతను కలిగి ఉంటుంది మరియు చైల్డ్ లేదా ట్రాన్సిషన్ సప్లిమెంట్‌లను కలిగి ఉండదు.","Is this an official pension decision?":"ఇది అధికారిక పెన్షన్ నిర్ణయమా?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"నం. మీరు అందించిన విలువలను ఉపయోగించి ఇది అంచనా. బీమా చేసిన రికార్డును తనిఖీ చేసిన తర్వాత మీ పరిహార కార్యాలయం బైండింగ్ పెన్షన్‌ను నిర్ణయిస్తుంది."},"ha":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Swiss AHV/AVS Mai Ritaya Hulɗar Yanayin Fansho","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Lissafin Lissafi na fensho AHV na Swiss - Yanayin 2026 da 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Ya haɗa da tsarin fansho na tarayya na 2026 da 2027 da fansho na tsofaffi na 13.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Kayan aikin yana amfani da tsarin ritaya na al'ada na tarayya don 2026 ko 2027 kuma yana nuna adadin kowane wata da na shekara, gami da fenshon tsofaffi na 13.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Yana nuna alamar gudummawar gudummawar da ake samu kuma yana iya haɗawa da ilimi da kiredit na kulawa da raba kudaden shiga. Yi amfani da adadin da aka nuna a cikin asusun hukuma ko hasashen ku. Wannan yanayin ya shafi mutum ɗaya a lokacin al'ada shekarun ritaya; baya sake gina aiki daga albashi ko ƙayyade cancantar shekaru.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Daga 2026, ana biyan fensho mai cancantar tsufa sau 13 a shekara; wannan yanayin yana ɗauka cewa ana biyan fensho na duk watanni 12.","Pension year":"Shekarar fansho","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Yanke ƙayyade matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara daga bayanin AHV ɗin ku (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Yi amfani da RAM na hukuma / ƙayyade matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara. Kada ku shigar da albashin ku na yanzu ko na ƙarshe kawai.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Shekarun gudummawar da aka ƙirƙira daga asusun ku","Full contribution duration for your case":"Cikakken gudunmuwar tsawon lokacin shari'ar ku","43 years":"shekaru 43","43 years and 3 months":"shekaru 43 da watanni 3","43 years and 6 months":"shekaru 43 da watanni 6","43 years and 9 months":"shekaru 43 da watanni 9","44 years":"shekaru 44","Estimate pension scenario":"Kimanin yanayin fensho","Clear inputs":"Share abubuwan shigarwa","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Shigar da ƙimar da aka nuna ta asusun AHV ko hasashen hukuma.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Alamar yanayin fansho na tsufa","Estimated monthly pension":"Kimanin fansho na wata-wata","12 regular monthly payments":"12 biyan kuɗi na kowane wata","13th old-age pension":"fenshon tsufa na 13","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Kididdigar jimlar na watanni 12 da fansho na 13","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Cikakken adadin kowane wata kafin daidaitawar shekara-shekara","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Ƙayyade matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara har zuwa rukunin tebur na hukuma","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Shekarun gudummawar da aka ƙima / cikakken tsawon lokaci","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Mafi qarancin cikakken cikakken fansho na kowane wata na zaɓaɓɓen shekara","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Mafi girman cikakken fansho na wata-wata don zaɓaɓɓen shekara","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"An tattara adadin kuɗin shiga na hukuma har zuwa rukunin tebur da aka buga na gaba. Ana amfani da dabarar doka, sannan aka daidaita don tsawon gudunmawar da kuka shigar.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Ƙimar kan layi na hukuma don Switzerland da ƙasashen waje: ESCAL","Official references:":"Nassoshi na hukuma:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV dabarar fansho da adadin kuɗi","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"Takardar AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"Sharuɗɗan fansho na 13","Download scenario CSV":"Zazzage yanayin CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Halin da aka ƙididdige shi a cikin wannan burauzar.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Duba shekarar haraji, matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara na hukuma da adadin gudummawar shekara.","Inputs cleared.":"An share abubuwan shigarwa.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"An sauke yanayin azaman fayil na CSV.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Zan iya shigar da albashi na na yanzu?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"No. Jami'in da ke ƙayyade matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara ya dogara ne akan inshorar sana'a, ƙididdiga da ƙididdiga masu dacewa. Albashin yanzu shi kadai ba zai iya hasashensa ba.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"A ina zan sami matsakaicin matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na shekara?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Yi amfani da asusun AHV naku ɗaya, ƙwaƙƙwaran ESCAL na hukuma ko ofishin diyya. Wannan kayan aikin baya fa'ida daga shekaru, ƙasa ko biyan kuɗi na yau.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Shin wannan ya haɗa da kula da ƙididdiga na ilimi ko rabuwa da ma'aurata?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Sai idan waɗannan tasirin an riga an haɗa su cikin matsakaicin kuɗin shiga na hukuma da kuka shigar. Kayan aikin ba zai iya tantance ƙimar ku ɗaya ko raba kuɗin shiga ba.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Shin yana lissafin da wuri ko jinkirta ritaya?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"No. Yana nuna al'amuran al'ada-yi ritaya kawai. Rage da'awar farko, haɓaka jinkiri, abubuwan haɓaka-ƙarni da ma'aurata suna buƙatar bayanan hukuma na mutum ɗaya kuma ba a haɗa su ba.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Me yasa ake biyan kuɗi na 13?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Tun daga 2026, mutanen da suka cancanci fansho na tsufa na AHV a watan Disamba suna samun ƙarin biyan kuɗi na shekara-shekara. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Shin wannan hukuncin fensho ne na hukuma?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"No. Ƙididdiga ce ta amfani da ƙimar da kuka bayar. Ofishin diyya na ku yana ƙayyade fensho mai ɗaure bayan duba rikodin inshorar."},"tl":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 at 2027 na Mga Sitwasyon","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Tantyahin ang isang Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario mula sa iyong opisyal na pagtukoy ng average na taunang kita at kredito na mga taon ng kontribusyon. Kasama ang 2026 at 2027 federal pension formula at ang 13th old-age pension.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Ilagay ang tinutukoy na average na taunang kita at mga taon ng kontribusyon mula sa iyong AHV account o opisyal na pagtatantya ng pensiyon. Inilalapat ng tool ang federal normal-retirement formula para sa 2026 o 2027 at nagpapakita ng buwanan at taunang mga halaga, kabilang ang ika-13 na pensiyon sa katandaan.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Ang pagtukoy sa average na taunang kita (RAM) ay hindi ang iyong kasalukuyang suweldo. Sinasalamin nito ang na-index na mga kita sa kontribusyon at maaaring kabilang ang mga kredito sa edukasyon at pangangalaga at paghahati ng kita. Gamitin ang halagang ipinapakita sa iyong opisyal na account o hula. Sinasaklaw ng sitwasyong ito ang isang tao sa normal na edad ng pagreretiro; hindi nito itinatayo muli ang isang karera mula sa suweldo o tinutukoy ang pagiging karapat-dapat sa edad.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Ilustrasyon lamang: na may 2027 na tumutukoy sa average na taunang kita na CHF 46,080 at 44 sa 44 na kreditong taon ng kontribusyon, ang tinantyang buong buwanang pensiyon ay CHF 1,946. Mula 2026, ang isang kwalipikadong pensiyon sa katandaan ay binabayaran ng 13 beses bawat taon; ipinapalagay ng sitwasyong ito na ang pensiyon ay babayaran sa lahat ng 12 buwan.","Pension year":"Taon ng pensiyon","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Pagtukoy sa average na taunang kita mula sa iyong AHV statement (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Gamitin ang opisyal na RAM / pagtukoy ng average na taunang kita. Huwag ipasok lamang ang iyong kasalukuyan o huling suweldo.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Mga taon ng kredito ng kontribusyon mula sa iyong account","Full contribution duration for your case":"Buong tagal ng kontribusyon para sa iyong kaso","43 years":"43 taon","43 years and 3 months":"43 taon at 3 buwan","43 years and 6 months":"43 taon at 6 na buwan","43 years and 9 months":"43 taon at 9 na buwan","44 years":"44 na taon","Estimate pension scenario":"Tantyahin ang senaryo ng pensiyon","Clear inputs":"I-clear ang mga input","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Ilagay ang mga halagang ipinapakita ng iyong AHV account o opisyal na hula.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Indikasyon na senaryo ng pensiyon sa katandaan","Estimated monthly pension":"Tinantyang buwanang pensiyon","12 regular monthly payments":"12 regular na buwanang pagbabayad","13th old-age pension":"13th old-age pension","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Tinantyang kabuuan para sa 12 buwan kasama ang ika-13 pensiyon","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Buong-buwanang halaga bago ang pagsasaayos ng taon ng kontribusyon","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Pagtukoy sa average na taunang kita na naka-round up sa opisyal na table band","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Mga taon ng kredito ng kontribusyon / buong tagal","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Minimum na buong buwanang pensiyon para sa napiling taon","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maximum na buong buwanang pensiyon para sa napiling taon","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Ang opisyal na numero ng kita ay ni-round up sa susunod na nai-publish na table band. Inilapat ang ayon sa batas na formula, pagkatapos ay iaakma para sa tagal ng kontribusyon na iyong inilagay.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Opisyal na online na pagtatantya para sa Switzerland at sa ibang bansa: ESCAL","Official references:":"Opisyal na mga sanggunian:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV pension formula at mga halaga","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV leaflet 3.01","13th pension rules":"ika-13 na tuntunin sa pensiyon","Download scenario CSV":"I-download ang senaryo na CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario na kinakalkula sa browser na ito.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Suriin ang taon ng buwis, opisyal na average na taunang kita at mga halaga ng taon ng kontribusyon.","Inputs cleared.":"Na-clear ang mga input.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Na-download ang sitwasyon bilang isang CSV file.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Maaari ko bang ipasok ang aking kasalukuyang suweldo?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Hindi. Ang opisyal na pagtukoy ng average na taunang kita ay batay sa nakasegurong karera, indexation at naaangkop na mga kredito. Ang kasalukuyang suweldo lamang ay hindi mahuhulaan ito.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Saan ko makikita ang pagtukoy sa average na taunang kita?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Gamitin ang iyong indibidwal na account sa AHV, isang opisyal na hula ng ESCAL o ang iyong tanggapan ng kompensasyon. Ang tool na ito ay hindi naghihinuha mula sa edad, bansa o kasalukuyang suweldo.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Kasama ba dito ang mga kredito sa pangangalaga at edukasyon o paghihiwalay ng mag-asawa?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Kung ang mga epektong iyon ay kasama na sa opisyal na average na kita na iyong ipinasok. Hindi matukoy ng tool ang iyong mga indibidwal na kredito o hating kita.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Kinakalkula ba nito nang maaga o ipinagpaliban ang pagreretiro?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Hindi. Nagpapakita lamang ito ng mga senaryo sa normal na pagreretiro. Ang mga pagbabawas sa maagang paghahabol, mga pagtaas ng pagpapaliban, mga suplemento sa pagbuo ng paglipat at mga takip ng asawa ay nangangailangan ng mga indibidwal na opisyal na talaan at hindi kasama.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Bakit may 13th payment?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Mula noong 2026, ang mga taong may karapatan sa AHV old-age pension noong Disyembre ay tumatanggap ng karagdagang taunang bayad. Ipinagpapalagay ng pagtatantyang ito ang isang buong taon ng karapatan at hindi kasama ang mga suplemento ng bata o paglipat.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Ito ba ay isang opisyal na desisyon sa pensiyon?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang pagtatantya gamit ang mga halagang ibinibigay mo. Tinutukoy ng iyong tanggapan ng kompensasyon ang may-bisang pensiyon pagkatapos suriin ang rekord ng nakaseguro."},"ta":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"சுவிஸ் AHV/AVS ஓய்வூதியக் காட்சி கால்குலேட்டர்","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"சுவிஸ் AHV பென்ஷன் கால்குலேட்டர் — 2026 மற்றும் 2027 காட்சிகள்","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"சுவிஸ் AHV/AVS முதியோர் ஓய்வூதிய சூழ்நிலையை உங்களின் உத்தியோகபூர்வ நிர்ணயம் செய்யும் சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் மற்றும் வரவு செய்யப்பட்ட பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுகளிலிருந்து மதிப்பிடவும். 2026 மற்றும் 2027 ஃபெடரல் பென்ஷன் ஃபார்முலா மற்றும் 13வது முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் ஆகியவை அடங்கும்.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"உங்கள் AHV கணக்கு அல்லது அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ஓய்வூதிய மதிப்பீட்டில் இருந்து நிர்ணயிக்கும் சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் மற்றும் பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுகளை உள்ளிடவும். கருவியானது 2026 அல்லது 2027 ஆம் ஆண்டிற்கான கூட்டாட்சி சாதாரண ஓய்வூதிய சூத்திரத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது மற்றும் 13 வது முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் உட்பட மாதாந்திர மற்றும் வருடாந்திர தொகைகளைக் காட்டுகிறது.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"உங்கள் தற்போதைய சம்பளத்தை நிர்ணயிக்கும் சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் (RAM) அல்ல. இது குறியீட்டு பங்களிப்பு வருவாயைப் பிரதிபலிக்கிறது மற்றும் கல்வி மற்றும் பராமரிப்பு வரவுகள் மற்றும் வருமானப் பிரிப்பு ஆகியவை அடங்கும். உங்கள் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கணக்கு அல்லது முன்னறிவிப்பில் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ள தொகையைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். இந்தக் காட்சியானது சாதாரண ஓய்வூதிய வயதில் ஒருவரை உள்ளடக்கியது; அது சம்பளத்தில் இருந்து ஒரு தொழிலை மறுகட்டமைக்கவோ அல்லது வயது தகுதியை நிர்ணயிக்கவோ இல்லை.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"விளக்கம் மட்டும்: 2027 ஐ நிர்ணயிக்கும் சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் CHF 46,080 மற்றும் 44 கிரெடிட் செய்யப்பட்ட பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுகளில், மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட முழு மாதாந்திர ஓய்வூதியம் CHF 1,946 ஆகும். 2026 முதல், தகுதியான முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் ஆண்டுக்கு 13 முறை வழங்கப்படுகிறது; இந்த சூழ்நிலையில் அனைத்து 12 மாதங்களுக்கும் ஓய்வூதியம் வழங்கப்படும்.","Pension year":"ஓய்வூதிய ஆண்டு","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"உங்கள் AHV அறிக்கையிலிருந்து (CHF) சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானத்தைத் தீர்மானித்தல்","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ரேமைப் பயன்படுத்தவும் / சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானத்தை நிர்ணயிக்கவும். உங்கள் தற்போதைய அல்லது கடைசி சம்பளத்தை மட்டும் உள்ளிட வேண்டாம்.","Credited contribution years from your account":"உங்கள் கணக்கில் இருந்து வரவு வைக்கப்பட்ட பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுகள்","Full contribution duration for your case":"உங்கள் வழக்குக்கான முழு பங்களிப்பு காலம்","43 years":"43 ஆண்டுகள்","43 years and 3 months":"43 ஆண்டுகள் மற்றும் 3 மாதங்கள்","43 years and 6 months":"43 ஆண்டுகள் மற்றும் 6 மாதங்கள்","43 years and 9 months":"43 ஆண்டுகள் மற்றும் 9 மாதங்கள்","44 years":"44 ஆண்டுகள்","Estimate pension scenario":"ஓய்வூதிய சூழ்நிலையை மதிப்பிடவும்","Clear inputs":"உள்ளீடுகளை அழி","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"உங்கள் AHV கணக்கு அல்லது அதிகாரப்பூர்வ முன்னறிவிப்பு மூலம் காட்டப்படும் மதிப்புகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியக் காட்சி","Estimated monthly pension":"மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர ஓய்வூதியம்","12 regular monthly payments":"12 வழக்கமான மாதாந்திர கொடுப்பனவுகள்","13th old-age pension":"13வது முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம்","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 மாதங்கள் மற்றும் 13வது ஓய்வூதியத்திற்கான மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட மொத்தம்","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"பங்களிப்பு-ஆண்டு சரிசெய்தலுக்கு முன் முழு அளவிலான மாதாந்திரத் தொகை","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ டேபிள் பேண்ட் வரையிலான சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானத்தை நிர்ணயித்தல்","Credited contribution years / full duration":"கிரெடிட் செய்யப்பட்ட பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுகள் / முழு கால அளவு","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டிற்கான குறைந்தபட்ச முழு மாத ஓய்வூதியம்","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டிற்கான அதிகபட்ச முழு மாதாந்திர ஓய்வூதியம்","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ வருமானம் அடுத்த வெளியிடப்பட்ட டேபிள் பேண்ட் வரை வளைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. சட்டப்பூர்வ சூத்திரம் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது, பின்னர் நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் பங்களிப்பு காலத்திற்கு சரிசெய்யப்படும்.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"சுவிட்சர்லாந்து மற்றும் வெளிநாடுகளுக்கான அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ஆன்லைன் மதிப்பீடு: ESCAL","Official references:":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ குறிப்புகள்:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV ஓய்வூதிய சூத்திரம் மற்றும் தொகைகள்","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV துண்டுப்பிரசுரம் 3.01","13th pension rules":"13வது ஓய்வூதிய விதிகள்","Download scenario CSV":"பதிவிறக்க காட்சி CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"இந்த உலாவியில் காட்சி கணக்கிடப்படுகிறது.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"வரி ஆண்டு, உத்தியோகபூர்வ சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் மற்றும் பங்களிப்பு ஆண்டுத் தொகைகளை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Inputs cleared.":"உள்ளீடுகள் அழிக்கப்பட்டன.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"காட்சி CSV கோப்பாகப் பதிவிறக்கப்பட்டது.","Can I enter my current salary?":"எனது தற்போதைய சம்பளத்தை உள்ளிட முடியுமா?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"எண். உத்தியோகபூர்வ நிர்ணயிக்கும் சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானம் காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட தொழில், அட்டவணைப்படுத்தல் மற்றும் பொருந்தக்கூடிய வரவுகளை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டது. தற்போதைய சம்பளத்தை மட்டும் கணிக்க முடியாது.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"உறுதியான சராசரி ஆண்டு வருமானத்தை நான் எங்கே கண்டுபிடிப்பது?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"உங்கள் AHV தனிப்பட்ட கணக்கு, அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ESCAL முன்னறிவிப்பு அல்லது உங்கள் இழப்பீட்டு அலுவலகத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். இந்தக் கருவி வயது, நாடு அல்லது இன்றைய ஊதியம் ஆகியவற்றிலிருந்து அதைக் கண்டறியவில்லை.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"இதில் கவனிப்பு மற்றும் கல்விக் கடன்கள் அல்லது திருமணமான தம்பதிகள் பிரிந்து செல்வது உள்ளதா?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ சராசரி வருமானத்தில் அந்த விளைவுகள் ஏற்கனவே சேர்க்கப்பட்டிருந்தால் மட்டுமே. கருவியால் உங்கள் தனிப்பட்ட வரவுகளையோ அல்லது வருமானத்தைப் பிரிக்கவோ முடியாது.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"முன்கூட்டிய அல்லது ஒத்திவைக்கப்பட்ட ஓய்வூதியத்தைக் கணக்கிடுகிறதா?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"எண். இது சாதாரண ஓய்வு காட்சிகளை மட்டுமே காட்டுகிறது. ஆரம்பகால உரிமைகோரல் குறைப்புகள், ஒத்திவைப்பு அதிகரிப்புகள், மாற்றம்-தலைமுறை சப்ளிமெண்ட்ஸ் மற்றும் வாழ்க்கைத் துணைக்கு தனிப்பட்ட அதிகாரப்பூர்வ பதிவுகள் தேவை மற்றும் அவை சேர்க்கப்படவில்லை.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13வது கட்டணம் ஏன்?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 ஆம் ஆண்டு முதல், டிசம்பரில் AHV முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் பெறும் தகுதி உடையவர்கள் கூடுதல் வருடாந்திரப் பணத்தைப் பெறுகின்றனர். இந்த மதிப்பீட்டில் ஒரு முழு ஆண்டு உரிமையை எடுத்துக்கொள்கிறது மற்றும் குழந்தை அல்லது மாற்றத்திற்கான கூடுதல் சேர்க்கைகள் இல்லை.","Is this an official pension decision?":"இது அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ஓய்வூதிய முடிவா?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"எண். நீங்கள் வழங்கும் மதிப்புகளைப் பயன்படுத்தி இது ஒரு மதிப்பீடு. உங்கள் இழப்பீட்டு அலுவலகம் காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட பதிவை சரிபார்த்த பிறகு பிணைப்பு ஓய்வூதியத்தை தீர்மானிக்கிறது."},"fa":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"ماشین حساب سناریوی بازنشستگی AHV/AVS سوئیس","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"ماشین حساب بازنشستگی AHV سوئیس — سناریوهای 2026 و 2027","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"سناریوی بازنشستگی سالمندی AHV/AVS سوئیس را از طریق رسمی تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه و سالهای مشارکت اعتباری تخمین بزنید. شامل فرمول بازنشستگی فدرال 2026 و 2027 و سیزدهمین مستمری سالمندی است.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"متوسط ​​تعیین کننده درآمد سالانه و سالهای مشارکت را از حساب AHV یا برآورد رسمی بازنشستگی خود وارد کنید. این ابزار فرمول بازنشستگی عادی فدرال را برای سال 2026 یا 2027 اعمال می کند و مبالغ ماهانه و سالانه، از جمله سیزدهمین مستمری سالمندی را نشان می دهد.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"متوسط ​​درآمد سالانه (RAM) تعیین کننده حقوق فعلی شما نیست. این نشان دهنده درآمدهای سهم شاخص است و ممکن است شامل اعتبارات آموزشی و مراقبتی و تقسیم درآمد باشد. از مبلغ نشان داده شده در حساب رسمی یا پیش بینی خود استفاده کنید. این سناریو یک نفر را در سن عادی بازنشستگی پوشش می دهد. این یک شغل را از حقوق بازسازی نمی کند یا واجد شرایط بودن سن را تعیین نمی کند.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"فقط تصویر: با تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه 2027 CHF 46080 و 44 سال از 44 سال مشارکت اعتباری، بازنشستگی کامل ماهانه تخمینی 1946 CHF است. از سال 2026، مستمری واجد شرایط سالمندی 13 بار در سال پرداخت می شود. این سناریو فرض می کند که مستمری برای تمام 12 ماه قابل پرداخت است.","Pension year":"سال بازنشستگی","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه از صورت وضعیت AHV شما (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"استفاده از رم رسمی / تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه. فقط حقوق فعلی یا آخرین حقوق خود را وارد نکنید.","Credited contribution years from your account":"سالهای مشارکت اعتباری از حساب شما","Full contribution duration for your case":"مدت زمان مشارکت کامل برای پرونده شما","43 years":"43 سال","43 years and 3 months":"43 سال و 3 ماه","43 years and 6 months":"43 سال و 6 ماه","43 years and 9 months":"43 سال و 9 ماه","44 years":"44 سال","Estimate pension scenario":"تخمین سناریوی بازنشستگی","Clear inputs":"ورودی ها را پاک کنید","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"مقادیر نشان داده شده توسط حساب AHV یا پیش بینی رسمی خود را وارد کنید.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"سناریوی بازنشستگی نشان دهنده سالمندی","Estimated monthly pension":"تخمین مستمری ماهانه","12 regular monthly payments":"12 پرداخت منظم ماهانه","13th old-age pension":"سیزدهمین مستمری سالمندی","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"مجموع تخمینی برای 12 ماه به اضافه سیزدهمین مستمری","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"مقدار ماهانه در مقیاس کامل قبل از تعدیل سال مشارکت","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه گرد شده به باند جدول رسمی","Credited contribution years / full duration":"سالهای مشارکت اعتباری / مدت زمان کامل","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"حداقل مستمری کامل ماهانه برای سال انتخابی","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"حداکثر مستمری کامل ماهانه برای سال انتخابی","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"رقم رسمی درآمد به نوار جدول منتشر شده بعدی گرد می شود. فرمول قانونی اعمال می شود، سپس برای مدت مشارکتی که وارد می کنید تنظیم می شود.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"برآورد آنلاین رسمی برای سوئیس و خارج از کشور: ESCAL","Official references:":"مراجع رسمی:\nفرمول و مبالغ مستمری","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"بروشور AHV/IV 3.01","13th pension rules":"قوانین بازنشستگی سیزدهم","Download scenario CSV":"دانلود سناریو CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"سناریو در این مرورگر محاسبه شده است.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"سال مالیاتی، میانگین رسمی درآمد سالانه و مبالغ سال مشارکت را بررسی کنید.","Inputs cleared.":"ورودی ها پاک شدند.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"سناریو به صورت فایل CSV دانلود شد.","Can I enter my current salary?":"آیا می توانم حقوق فعلی خود را وارد کنم؟","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"خیر. رسمی تعیین میانگین درآمد سالانه بر اساس شغل بیمه شده، نمایه سازی و اعتبارات قابل اجرا می باشد. حقوق فعلی به تنهایی نمی تواند آن را پیش بینی کند.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"متوسط ​​درآمد سالانه تعیین کننده را از کجا پیدا کنم؟","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"از حساب انفرادی AHV، پیش بینی رسمی ESCAL یا دفتر جبران خسارت خود استفاده کنید. این ابزار آن را از سن، کشور یا حقوق فعلی استنباط نمی کند.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"آیا این شامل اعتبارات مراقبتی و آموزشی یا جدایی زن و شوهر می شود؟","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"فقط در صورتی که این اثرات قبلاً در میانگین رسمی درآمدی که وارد می‌کنید لحاظ شده باشد. این ابزار نمی تواند اعتبار فردی یا تقسیم درآمد شما را تعیین کند.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"بازنشستگی پیش از موعد یا معوق را محاسبه می کند؟","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"خیر. این فقط سناریوهای بازنشستگی عادی را نشان می دهد. کاهش زودهنگام مطالبات، افزایش تعویق، مکمل های نسل انتقالی و سقف همسر نیاز به سوابق رسمی فردی دارند و شامل نمی شوند.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"چرا سیزدهمین پرداخت وجود دارد؟","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"از سال 2026، افرادی که در ماه دسامبر مستمری سالمندی AHV را دریافت می کنند، یک پرداخت سالانه اضافی دریافت می کنند. این برآورد یک سال کامل استحقاق را در نظر می گیرد و شامل مکمل های کودک یا دوره گذار نمی شود.","Is this an official pension decision?":"آیا این یک تصمیم رسمی بازنشستگی است؟","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"خیر. این یک تخمین با استفاده از مقادیری است که ارائه می کنید. اداره غرامت شما پس از بررسی سوابق بیمه شده، مستمری الزام آور را تعیین می کند."},"am":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"የስዊስ AHV/AVS የጡረታ ጡረታ ሁኔታ ማስያ","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"የስዊስ AHV የጡረታ ማስያ - 2026 እና 2027 ሁኔታዎች","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"የስዊስ AHV/AVS የእርጅና የጡረታ ሁኔታን ከአማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢዎ እና ከተቀበሉት መዋጮ አመታትን ይገምቱ። የ 2026 እና 2027 የፌዴራል የጡረታ ቀመር እና 13 ኛውን የእርጅና ጡረታን ያካትታል።","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"ከ AHV መለያዎ ወይም ከኦፊሴላዊ የጡረታ ግምት የሚወስነውን አማካይ አመታዊ ገቢ እና መዋጮ አስገባ። መሳሪያው ለ 2026 ወይም 2027 የፌደራል መደበኛ የጡረታ ቀመርን የሚተገበር ሲሆን ወርሃዊ እና አመታዊ መጠኖችን ያሳያል፣ የ13ኛውን የእርጅና ጡረታን ጨምሮ።","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"የሚወስነው አማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢ (ራም) የአሁኑ ደሞዝዎ አይደለም። በመረጃ የተደገፈ አስተዋጽዖ ገቢን የሚያንፀባርቅ ሲሆን የትምህርት እና የእንክብካቤ ክሬዲቶችን እና የገቢ ክፍፍልን ሊያካትት ይችላል። በይፋዊ መለያዎ ወይም ትንበያዎ ላይ የሚታየውን መጠን ይጠቀሙ። ይህ ሁኔታ በተለመደው የጡረታ ዕድሜ ላይ ያለ አንድ ሰው ይሸፍናል; ከደመወዝ ሙያን እንደገና አይገነባም ወይም የዕድሜ ብቁነትን አይወስንም.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"ምሳሌ ብቻ፡- በ2027 አማካኝ ዓመታዊ ገቢ CHF 46,080 እና 44 ከ44 ክሬዲት መዋጮ ዓመታት በመወሰን፣ ሙሉ ወርሃዊ ጡረታ የሚገመተው CHF 1,946 ነው። ከ 2026 ጀምሮ ብቁ የሆነ የእርጅና ጡረታ በዓመት 13 ጊዜ ይከፈላል ። ይህ ሁኔታ የጡረታ አበል ለ12 ወራት የሚከፈል ነው ተብሎ ይታሰባል።","Pension year":"የጡረታ ዓመት","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"ከእርስዎ AHV መግለጫ (CHF) አማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢ መወሰን","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"ኦፊሴላዊውን RAM ይጠቀሙ/አማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢን ይወስኑ። የአሁኑን ወይም የመጨረሻ ደሞዝዎን ብቻ አያስገቡ።","Credited contribution years from your account":"የተመሰከረ መዋጮ ዓመታት ከመለያዎ","Full contribution duration for your case":"ለእርስዎ ጉዳይ የሙሉ አስተዋፅዖ ቆይታ","43 years":"43 ዓመታት","43 years and 3 months":"43 ዓመታት እና 3 ወራት","43 years and 6 months":"43 ዓመታት ከ6 ወራት","43 years and 9 months":"43 ዓመታት እና 9 ወራት","44 years":"44 ዓመታት","Estimate pension scenario":"የጡረታ ሁኔታ ግምት","Clear inputs":"ግብዓቶችን አጽዳ","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"በ AHV መለያዎ ወይም በይፋ ትንበያዎ የሚታዩትን እሴቶች ያስገቡ።","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"የእርጅና ጡረታ አመልካች ሁኔታ","Estimated monthly pension":"የሚገመተው ወርሃዊ ጡረታ","12 regular monthly payments":"12 መደበኛ ወርሃዊ ክፍያዎች","13th old-age pension":"13ኛ የእርጅና ጡረታ","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"የተገመተው ጠቅላላ ለ12 ወራት እና 13ኛ ጡረታ","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"የመዋጮ-ዓመት ማስተካከያ ከመደረጉ በፊት ሙሉ-ልኬት ወርሃዊ መጠን","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"አማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢን መወሰን እስከ ይፋዊው የጠረጴዛ ባንድ","Credited contribution years / full duration":"የተመሰከረ መዋጮ ዓመታት/ሙሉ ቆይታ","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"ለተመረጠው ዓመት ቢያንስ ሙሉ ወርሃዊ ጡረታ","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"ለተመረጠው ዓመት ከፍተኛው ሙሉ ወርሃዊ ጡረታ","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"የኦፊሴላዊው የገቢ አሃዝ ወደሚቀጥለው የታተመ የጠረጴዛ ባንድ ተጠቃልሏል። ህጋዊው ቀመር ይተገበራል፣ ከዚያ ያስገባኸው የአስተዋጽኦ ቆይታ ተስተካክሏል።","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"ኦፊሴላዊ የመስመር ላይ ግምት ለስዊዘርላንድ እና ለውጭ፡ ESCAL","Official references:":"ኦፊሴላዊ ማጣቀሻዎች፡-","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV የጡረታ ቀመር እና መጠን","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV በራሪ ወረቀት 3.01","13th pension rules":"13ኛ የጡረታ ሕጎች","Download scenario CSV":"ሁኔታን አውርድ CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"ሁኔታ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰላል።","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"የግብር አመቱን፣የኦፊሴላዊ አማካይ አመታዊ ገቢ እና መዋጮ-ዓመት መጠንን ይመልከቱ።","Inputs cleared.":"ግብዓቶች ጸድተዋል።","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"ሁኔታ እንደ CSV ፋይል ወርዷል።","Can I enter my current salary?":"የአሁኑን ደሞዜን ማስገባት እችላለሁን?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"አይ. አማካኝ ዓመታዊ ገቢን የሚወስነው ኦፊሴላዊው በኢንሹራንስ ሥራ፣ በመረጃ ጠቋሚ እና በሚተገበሩ ክሬዲቶች ላይ የተመሠረተ ነው። አሁን ያለው ደመወዝ ብቻውን ሊተነብይ አይችልም.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"አማካኝ አመታዊ ገቢን ከየት አገኛለው?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"የእርስዎን AHV የግል መለያ፣ ይፋዊ የESCAL ትንበያ ወይም የማካካሻ ቢሮዎን ይጠቀሙ። ይህ መሳሪያ ከዕድሜ፣ ከሀገር ወይም ከአሁኑ ክፍያ አይገምተውም።","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"ይህ የእንክብካቤ እና የትምህርት ክሬዲቶችን ወይም የተጋቢዎችን መለያየት ይጨምራል?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"እነዚህ ተጽእኖዎች በሚያስገቡት ኦፊሴላዊ አማካይ ገቢ ውስጥ ከተካተቱ ብቻ ነው። መሣሪያው የእርስዎን የግል ክሬዲት ወይም የተከፋፈለ ገቢ ሊወስን አይችልም።","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"ቀደም ብሎ ያሰላል ወይስ የዘገየ ጡረታ?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"አይ. እሱ መደበኛ የጡረታ ሁኔታዎችን ብቻ ያሳያል። ቀደምት የይገባኛል ጥያቄ ቅነሳ፣ የዘገየ ጭማሪ፣ የሽግግር-ትውልድ ማሟያዎች እና የትዳር ጓደኛ መያዣዎች የግለሰብ ኦፊሴላዊ መዝገቦችን ይፈልጋሉ እና አልተካተቱም።","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13ኛ ክፍያ ለምን አለ?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"ከ2026 ጀምሮ፣ በታህሳስ ወር የ AHV የእርጅና ጡረታ የማግኘት መብት ያላቸው ሰዎች ተጨማሪ ዓመታዊ ክፍያ ያገኛሉ። ይህ ግምት የአንድ አመት ሙሉ መብት የሚወስድ ሲሆን የልጅ ወይም የሽግግር ማሟያዎችን አያካትትም።","Is this an official pension decision?":"ይህ ይፋዊ የጡረታ ውሳኔ ነው?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"አይ. እርስዎ ያቀረቧቸውን እሴቶች በመጠቀም ግምት ነው. የማካካሻ ጽህፈት ቤትዎ የኢንሹራንስ መዝገብ ካጣራ በኋላ አስገዳጅ ጡረታ ይወስናል።"},"gu":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"સ્વિસ AHV/AVS નિવૃત્તિ પેન્શન દૃશ્ય કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"સ્વિસ AHV પેન્શન કેલ્ક્યુલેટર - 2026 અને 2027 દૃશ્યો","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"સ્વિસ AHV/AVS વૃદ્ધાવસ્થાના પેન્શનની સ્થિતિનો અંદાજ કાઢો તમારા સત્તાવાર સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક અને જમા યોગદાન વર્ષ. 2026 અને 2027 ફેડરલ પેન્શન ફોર્મ્યુલા અને 13મી વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શનનો સમાવેશ થાય છે.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"તમારા AHV ખાતા અથવા સત્તાવાર પેન્શન અંદાજમાંથી નિર્ધારિત સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક અને યોગદાન વર્ષ દાખલ કરો. આ સાધન 2026 અથવા 2027 માટે ફેડરલ સામાન્ય-નિવૃત્તિ સૂત્રને લાગુ કરે છે અને 13મી વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન સહિત માસિક અને વાર્ષિક રકમ દર્શાવે છે.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક (RAM) નક્કી કરવી એ તમારો વર્તમાન પગાર નથી. તે અનુક્રમિત યોગદાન કમાણીને પ્રતિબિંબિત કરે છે અને તેમાં શિક્ષણ અને સંભાળ ક્રેડિટ અને આવક વિભાજનનો સમાવેશ થઈ શકે છે. તમારા સત્તાવાર ખાતા અથવા આગાહીમાં દર્શાવેલ રકમનો ઉપયોગ કરો. આ દૃશ્ય સામાન્ય નિવૃત્તિ વયે એક વ્યક્તિને આવરી લે છે; તે પગારમાંથી કારકિર્દીનું પુનર્નિર્માણ કરતું નથી અથવા વય પાત્રતા નક્કી કરતું નથી.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"ફક્ત ચિત્ર: 2027 ની સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક CHF 46,080 અને 44 જમા યોગદાન વર્ષોમાં 44 નક્કી કરવા સાથે, અંદાજિત પૂર્ણ માસિક પેન્શન CHF 1,946 છે. 2026 થી, લાયકાત ધરાવતી વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન દર વર્ષે 13 વખત ચૂકવવામાં આવે છે; આ દૃશ્ય ધારે છે કે પેન્શન બધા 12 મહિના માટે ચૂકવવાપાત્ર છે.","Pension year":"પેન્શન વર્ષ","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"તમારા AHV સ્ટેટમેન્ટ (CHF)માંથી સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક નક્કી કરવી","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"અધિકૃત RAM નો ઉપયોગ કરો / સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક નક્કી કરો. ફક્ત તમારો વર્તમાન અથવા છેલ્લો પગાર દાખલ કરશો નહીં.","Credited contribution years from your account":"તમારા ખાતામાંથી યોગદાન વર્ષ ક્રેડિટ","Full contribution duration for your case":"તમારા કેસ માટે સંપૂર્ણ યોગદાન અવધિ","43 years":"43 વર્ષ","43 years and 3 months":"43 વર્ષ અને 3 મહિના","43 years and 6 months":"43 વર્ષ અને 6 મહિના","43 years and 9 months":"43 વર્ષ અને 9 મહિના","44 years":"44 વર્ષ","Estimate pension scenario":"અંદાજિત પેન્શન દૃશ્ય","Clear inputs":"ઇનપુટ્સ સાફ કરો","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"તમારા AHV એકાઉન્ટ અથવા સત્તાવાર આગાહી દ્વારા દર્શાવવામાં આવેલ મૂલ્યો દાખલ કરો.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"સૂચક વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન દૃશ્ય","Estimated monthly pension":"અંદાજિત માસિક પેન્શન","12 regular monthly payments":"12 નિયમિત માસિક ચૂકવણી","13th old-age pension":"13મું વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"12 મહિના વત્તા 13મી પેન્શન માટે અંદાજિત કુલ","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"યોગદાન-વર્ષ એડજસ્ટમેન્ટ પહેલાં પૂર્ણ-સ્કેલ માસિક રકમ","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"અધિકૃત ટેબલ બેન્ડ સુધીની સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક નક્કી કરવી","Credited contribution years / full duration":"જમા યોગદાન વર્ષ / સંપૂર્ણ અવધિ","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"પસંદ કરેલ વર્ષ માટે ન્યૂનતમ સંપૂર્ણ માસિક પેન્શન","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"પસંદ કરેલ વર્ષ માટે મહત્તમ સંપૂર્ણ માસિક પેન્શન","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"આધિકારિક આવકનો આંકડો આગામી પ્રકાશિત ટેબલ બેન્ડ સુધી ગોળાકાર છે. વૈધાનિક સૂત્ર લાગુ કરવામાં આવે છે, પછી તમે દાખલ કરેલ યોગદાનની અવધિ માટે સમાયોજિત કરવામાં આવે છે.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"સ્વિત્ઝર્લેન્ડ અને વિદેશ માટે સત્તાવાર ઓનલાઇન અંદાજ: ESCAL","Official references:":"સત્તાવાર સંદર્ભો:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV પેન્શન ફોર્મ્યુલા અને રકમો","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV પત્રિકા 3.01","13th pension rules":"13મું પેન્શન નિયમો","Download scenario CSV":"ડાઉનલોડ દૃશ્ય CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ગણતરી કરેલ દૃશ્ય.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"કર વર્ષ, સત્તાવાર સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક અને યોગદાન-વર્ષની રકમ તપાસો.","Inputs cleared.":"ઇનપુટ્સ સાફ.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"સીએસવી ફાઇલ તરીકે ડાઉનલોડ કરેલ દૃશ્ય.","Can I enter my current salary?":"શું હું મારો વર્તમાન પગાર દાખલ કરી શકું?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"નં. સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક નક્કી કરતી સત્તાવાર રીતે વીમાધારક કારકિર્દી, અનુક્રમણિકા અને લાગુ ક્રેડિટ પર આધારિત છે. એકલો વર્તમાન પગાર તેની આગાહી કરી શકતો નથી.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"મને સરેરાશ વાર્ષિક આવક ક્યાંથી મળશે?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"તમારા AHV વ્યક્તિગત ખાતા, સત્તાવાર ESCAL આગાહી અથવા તમારી વળતર કચેરીનો ઉપયોગ કરો. આ સાધન તેને વય, દેશ અથવા વર્તમાન પગાર પરથી અનુમાનિત કરતું નથી.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"શું આમાં કેર અને એજ્યુકેશન ક્રેડિટ્સ અથવા વિવાહિત-દંપતીના વિભાજનનો સમાવેશ થાય છે?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે અધિકૃત સરેરાશ આવકમાં તે અસરો પહેલેથી જ સામેલ હોય તો જ. સાધન તમારી વ્યક્તિગત ક્રેડિટ અથવા વિભાજિત આવક નક્કી કરી શકતું નથી.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"શું તે વહેલા કે વિલંબિત નિવૃત્તિની ગણતરી કરે છે?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"નં. તે માત્ર સામાન્ય-નિવૃત્તિના દૃશ્યો દર્શાવે છે. પ્રારંભિક દાવાઓમાં ઘટાડો, સ્થગિત વધારો, સંક્રમણ-જનરેશન સપ્લિમેન્ટ્સ અને જીવનસાથી કેપ્સ માટે વ્યક્તિગત સત્તાવાર રેકોર્ડની જરૂર છે અને તેનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"13મી ચુકવણી શા માટે છે?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"2026 થી, ડિસેમ્બરમાં AHV વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન માટે હકદાર લોકોને વધારાની વાર્ષિક ચુકવણી મળે છે. આ અંદાજ સંપૂર્ણ વર્ષ હકદારી ધારે છે અને તેમાં બાળક અથવા સંક્રમણ પૂરકનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી.","Is this an official pension decision?":"શું આ સત્તાવાર પેન્શન નિર્ણય છે?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"નં. તમે પ્રદાન કરો છો તે મૂલ્યોનો ઉપયોગ કરીને તે એક અંદાજ છે. તમારી વળતર કચેરી વીમા રેકોર્ડની તપાસ કર્યા પછી બંધનકર્તા પેન્શન નક્કી કરે છે."},"nb":{"2026":"2026","2027":"2027","Swiss AHV/AVS Retirement Pension Scenario Calculator":"Sveitsisk AHV/AVS Scenariokalkulator for alderspensjon","Swiss AHV Pension Calculator — 2026 and 2027 Scenarios":"Sveitsisk AHV Pensjonskalkulator — 2026 og 2027 scenarier","Estimate a Swiss AHV/AVS old-age pension scenario from your official determining average annual income and credited contribution years. Includes the 2026 and 2027 federal pension formula and the 13th old-age pension.":"Beregn et sveitsisk AHV/AVS alderspensjonsscenario fra din offisielle fastsettelse av gjennomsnittlig årlig inntekt og kreditert bidragsår. Inkluderer den føderale pensjonsformelen for 2026 og 2027 og den 13. alderspensjonen.","Enter the determining average annual income and contribution years from your AHV account or official pension estimate. The tool applies the federal normal-retirement formula for 2026 or 2027 and shows monthly and annual amounts, including the 13th old-age pension.":"Skriv inn den avgjørende gjennomsnittlige årlige inntekten og bidragsårene fra din AHV-konto eller offisielle pensjonsestimat. Verktøyet bruker den føderale normalpensjonsformelen for 2026 eller 2027 og viser månedlige og årlige beløp, inkludert den 13. alderspensjonen.","The determining average annual income (RAM) is not your current salary. It reflects indexed contribution earnings and may include education and care credits and income splitting. Use the amount shown in your official account or forecast. This scenario covers one person at normal retirement age; it does not reconstruct a career from salary or determine age eligibility.":"Den avgjørende gjennomsnittlige årlige inntekten (RAM) er ikke din nåværende lønn. Den reflekterer indeksert bidragsinntekt og kan inkludere utdannings- og omsorgskreditter og inntektsdeling. Bruk beløpet som vises i din offisielle konto eller prognose. Dette scenariet dekker én person ved normal pensjonsalder; den rekonstruerer ikke en karriere fra lønn eller bestemmer aldersberettigelse.","Illustration only: with a 2027 determining average annual income of CHF 46,080 and 44 of 44 credited contribution years, the estimated full monthly pension is CHF 1,946. From 2026, a qualifying old-age pension is paid 13 times per year; this scenario assumes the pension is payable for all 12 months.":"Bare illustrasjon: med en gjennomsnittlig årsinntekt i 2027 på 46 080 CHF og 44 av 44 krediterte bidragsår, er den estimerte fulle månedlige pensjonen 1 946 CHF. Fra 2026 utbetales det kvalifisert alderspensjon 13 ganger per år; Dette scenariet forutsetter at pensjonen utbetales for alle 12 måneder.","Pension year":"Pensjonsår","Determining average annual income from your AHV statement (CHF)":"Bestemme gjennomsnittlig årlig inntekt fra AHV-utskriften din (CHF)","Use the official RAM / determining average annual income. Do not enter only your current or last salary.":"Bruk den offisielle RAM/bestemmelse av gjennomsnittlig årlig inntekt. Ikke oppgi kun din nåværende eller siste lønn.","Credited contribution years from your account":"Kreditert bidragsår fra kontoen din","Full contribution duration for your case":"Full bidragsvarighet for din sak","43 years":"43 år","43 years and 3 months":"43 år og 3 måneder","43 years and 6 months":"43 år og 6 måneder","43 years and 9 months":"43 år og 9 måneder","44 years":"44 år","Estimate pension scenario":"Beregn pensjonsscenario","Clear inputs":"Tydelige innganger","Enter the values shown by your AHV account or official forecast.":"Skriv inn verdiene som vises av din AHV-konto eller offisielle prognose.","Indicative old-age pension scenario":"Veledende scenario for alderspensjon","Estimated monthly pension":"Beregnet månedlig pensjon","12 regular monthly payments":"12 faste månedlige betalinger","13th old-age pension":"13. alderspensjon","Estimated total for 12 months plus 13th pension":"Estimert total for 12 måneder pluss 13. pensjon","Full-scale monthly amount before contribution-year adjustment":"Fullskala månedsbeløp før bidragsårsjustering","Determining average annual income rounded up to the official table band":"Fastsettelse av gjennomsnittlig årsinntekt rundet opp til det offisielle tabellbåndet","Credited contribution years / full duration":"Kreditert bidrag år / full varighet","Minimum full monthly pension for selected year":"Minste full månedlig pensjon for valgt år","Maximum full monthly pension for selected year":"Maksimal full månedlig pensjon for valgt år","The official income figure is rounded up to the next published table band. The statutory formula is applied, then adjusted for the contribution duration you enter.":"Det offisielle inntektstallet rundes opp til neste publiserte tabellbånd. Den lovbestemte formelen brukes, deretter justeres for bidragsvarigheten du angir.","Official online estimate for Switzerland and abroad: ESCAL":"Offisielt online estimat for Sveits og i utlandet: ESCAL","Official references:":"Offisielle referanser:","BSV pension formula and amounts":"BSV pensjonsformel og beløp","AHV/IV leaflet 3.01":"AHV/IV-hefte 3.01","13th pension rules":"13. pensjonsregler","Download scenario CSV":"Last ned scenario CSV","Scenario calculated in this browser.":"Scenario beregnet i denne nettleseren.","Check the tax year, official average annual income and contribution-year amounts.":"Sjekk skatteåret, offisiell gjennomsnittlig årsinntekt og bidragsårsbeløp.","Inputs cleared.":"Innganger slettet.","Scenario downloaded as a CSV file.":"Scenario lastet ned som en CSV-fil.","Can I enter my current salary?":"Kan jeg legge inn min nåværende lønn?","No. The official determining average annual income is based on the insured career, indexation and applicable credits. A current salary alone cannot predict it.":"Nei. Den offisielle fastsettelse av gjennomsnittlig årsinntekt er basert på den forsikrede karrieren, indeksregulering og gjeldende kreditter. En nåværende lønn alene kan ikke forutsi det.","Where do I find the determining average annual income?":"Hvor finner jeg den avgjørende gjennomsnittlige årsinntekten?","Use your AHV individual account, an official ESCAL forecast or your compensation office. This tool does not infer it from age, country or present-day pay.":"Bruk din individuelle AHV-konto, en offisiell ESCAL-prognose eller kompensasjonskontoret ditt. Dette verktøyet utleder det ikke fra alder, land eller dagens lønn.","Does this include care and education credits or married-couple splitting?":"Inkluderer dette omsorgs- og utdanningspoeng eller splittelse mellom ektepar?","Only if those effects are already included in the official average income you enter. The tool cannot determine your individual credits or split income.":"Bare hvis disse effektene allerede er inkludert i den offisielle gjennomsnittsinntekten du legger inn. Verktøyet kan ikke bestemme dine individuelle kreditter eller delt inntekt.","Does it calculate early or deferred retirement?":"Beregner den tidlig eller utsatt pensjonering?","No. It shows normal-retirement scenarios only. Early claim reductions, deferral increases, transition-generation supplements and spouse caps require individual official records and are not included.":"Nei. Den viser bare scenarier for normal pensjonering. Tidlige kravreduksjoner, utsettelsesøkninger, overgangsgenerasjonstillegg og ektefelletak krever individuelle offisielle poster og er ikke inkludert.","Why is there a 13th payment?":"Hvorfor er det en 13. betaling?","Since 2026, people entitled to an AHV old-age pension in December receive an additional annual payment. This estimate assumes a full year of entitlement and does not include child or transition supplements.":"Siden 2026 får personer med rett til AHV alderspensjon i desember en ekstra årlig utbetaling. Dette anslaget forutsetter et helt år med rettighet og inkluderer ikke barne- eller overgangstillegg.","Is this an official pension decision?":"Er dette en offisiell pensjonsavgjørelse?","No. It is an estimate using the values you provide. Your compensation office determines the binding pension after checking the insured record.":"Nei. Det er et estimat basert på verdiene du oppgir. Erstatningskontoret ditt fastsetter den bindende pensjonen etter å ha kontrollert forsikringsjournalen."}});
